(606996, 62535, 16957, '<td valign="top">This feels like a hastily taken shot. I presume the graininess a consequence of a low-end camera so not fault there. Composition is main concern. I need to see more of the child to evoke more silence. The drum attracts unwarranted attention. Try getting a bit highgher and close to child''s face and you will then have a nice portrait rather than a rather cluttered snapshot.</td>', 'This feels like a hastily taken shot. I presume the graininess a consequence of a low-end camera so not fault there. Composition is main concern. I need to see more of the child to evoke more silence. The drum attracts unwarranted attention. Try getting a bit highgher and close to child''s face and you will then have a nice portrait rather than a rather cluttered snapshot.', '2004-03-03 08:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
