(607154, 63108, 5391, '<td valign="top">I had the exact same idea for this challenge, but wound up doing something else instead.  So obviously I like your concept very much!  :)  I''m not sure about the edge of the swing being right at the edge of the frame, but for the most part I really like the composition.  Good focus and use of depth of field.  The tones seem somewhat pixelated and chunky - of course, with the basic editing rules you''re unable to fix things like that, though, so no marks down for that.  Overall I like it quite a bit.  Definitely has the feeling of "silence".</td>', 'I had the exact same idea for this challenge, but wound up doing something else instead.  So obviously I like your concept very much!  :)  I''m not sure about the edge of the swing being right at the edge of the frame, but for the most part I really like the composition.  Good focus and use of depth of field.  The tones seem somewhat pixelated and chunky - of course, with the basic editing rules you''re unable to fix things like that, though, so no marks down for that.  Overall I like it quite a bit.  Definitely has the feeling of "silence".', '2004-03-03 09:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(607155, 62862, 14614, '<td valign="top">engaging pairs - lighting could be used better (less orange and less flat)</td>', 'engaging pairs - lighting could be used better (less orange and less flat)', '2004-03-03 09:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
