(607172, 63085, 17166, '<td valign="top">Very clever interpretation of the theme, and a good photo.  If the wood were a bit sharper it would emphasize the motion of the dropping pin a bit more.</td>', 'Very clever interpretation of the theme, and a good photo.  If the wood were a bit sharper it would emphasize the motion of the dropping pin a bit more.', '2004-03-03 09:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(607173, 63121, 8139, '<td valign="top">Minimalistic, he...<br/>But i like this. It conveys the sensation of silence through the absence of visuals and the softness of the plume.</td>', 'Minimalistic, he...But i like this. It conveys the sensation of silence through the absence of visuals and the softness of the plume.', '2004-03-03 09:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(607175, 63105, 15129, '<td valign="top">Tacky but a hysterically funny picture. It made me laugh out loud (in the office) when I saw the cat. I''d give it a 6 for technical, but a 10 for content, so I''m averaging out to an 8. Hope you do more of this kind of thing.</td>', 'Tacky but a hysterically funny picture. It made me laugh out loud (in the office) when I saw the cat. I''d give it a 6 for technical, but a 10 for content, so I''m averaging out to an 8. Hope you do more of this kind of thing.', '2004-03-03 09:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
