(607203, 63090, 16900, '<td valign="top">Too much grain for this particular scene, but great idea...picture=7-3 for grain=4</td>', 'Too much grain for this particular scene, but great idea...picture=7-3 for grain=4', '2004-03-03 10:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(607205, 62408, 5391, '<td valign="top">I really like this image overall.  It fits the challenge well, and the bicycle covered in snow is a very pretty and interesting subject.  I am, however, distracted by the oversaturated blues.  I think the blue tone adds to the image and overall I like it, but the spots on the fence and a couple of small spots on the bike are so blue that they''ve lost and detail or texture that might have been there.  Great composition, though - I love the panoramic crop.</td>', 'I really like this image overall.  It fits the challenge well, and the bicycle covered in snow is a very pretty and interesting subject.  I am, however, distracted by the oversaturated blues.  I think the blue tone adds to the image and overall I like it, but the spots on the fence and a couple of small spots on the bike are so blue that they''ve lost and detail or texture that might have been there.  Great composition, though - I love the panoramic crop.', '2004-03-03 10:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(607206, 63067, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.<br/>I find the frame extremely distracting.<br/>Photo is also a bit dully lit.</td>', 'Nice idea.I find the frame extremely distracting.Photo is also a bit dully lit.', '2004-03-03 10:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
