(607228, 62667, 17228, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Photo seems to be angled to the right which makes it hard to enjoy the shot. Wide angle lens may be adding to that problem as well. Keep it up.  :)</td>', 'Good idea. Photo seems to be angled to the right which makes it hard to enjoy the shot. Wide angle lens may be adding to that problem as well. Keep it up.  :)', '2004-03-03 10:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(607229, 63124, 16957, '<td valign="top">I''m unclear what this is and it does not communicate the idea of silence to me. Technically it is a good shot. I like the reflected plug. perhaps, given that it is Advanced editing you might have adjusted levels or done a bit of dodging in the dark areas to reveal detail there? then again they are a nice contrast to the shiny areas which are well lit (easy to get flare and highlights if you''re not careful) So well done for a good shot but marked down as it does not communicate silence (to me anyway:)) 6</td>', 'I''m unclear what this is and it does not communicate the idea of silence to me. Technically it is a good shot. I like the reflected plug. perhaps, given that it is Advanced editing you might have adjusted levels or done a bit of dodging in the dark areas to reveal detail there? then again they are a nice contrast to the shiny areas which are well lit (easy to get flare and highlights if you''re not careful) So well done for a good shot but marked down as it does not communicate silence (to me anyway:)) 6', '2004-03-03 10:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(607231, 62979, 15129, '<td valign="top">Good composition but it seems to lack contrast.</td>', 'Good composition but it seems to lack contrast.', '2004-03-03 10:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(607234, 62779, 16957, '<td valign="top">It''s difficult for this image to communicate silence when the main subject - a hammer - is one more asociated with noise. The effect is compounded by the use of the hammer to break something. Thus not good choice of subject for challenge. Yet it is nicely composed with effective use of depth of field.</td>', 'It''s difficult for this image to communicate silence when the main subject - a hammer - is one more asociated with noise. The effect is compounded by the use of the hammer to break something. Thus not good choice of subject for challenge. Yet it is nicely composed with effective use of depth of field.', '2004-03-03 10:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
