(607248, 62926, 16957, '<td valign="top">technically a competent photo but a gun is something associated with extreme noise and thus even with mufflers, it is really difficult to appreciate any sense of silence. the flag is confusing also since it is not clear what it has to do with the idea of silence. I note the title but it does not help much. Are you saying that you could ban guns but the people would make a noise about it? In that context this is a good subject for a ''prpoganda'', ''media'' or ''campaigning'' challenge. For silence, however, it eludes me - sorry :))</td>', 'technically a competent photo but a gun is something associated with extreme noise and thus even with mufflers, it is really difficult to appreciate any sense of silence. the flag is confusing also since it is not clear what it has to do with the idea of silence. I note the title but it does not help much. Are you saying that you could ban guns but the people would make a noise about it? In that context this is a good subject for a ''prpoganda'', ''media'' or ''campaigning'' challenge. For silence, however, it eludes me - sorry :))', '2004-03-03 10:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
