(607282, 63019, 15934, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, it seems very desolute, even in the middle of Jersey or wherever.  It feels like one of Tony Soprano''s dream sequences.</td>', 'I really like this photo, it seems very desolute, even in the middle of Jersey or wherever.  It feels like one of Tony Soprano''s dream sequences.', '2004-03-03 10:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(607283, 62394, 5391, '<td valign="top">The photograph as a whole definitely conveys the feeling of silence.  I''d like to see some different crops - perhaps where the light source is not as central, to add a more dynamic composition.  The effect of the light is beautiful and very peaceful.</td>', 'The photograph as a whole definitely conveys the feeling of silence.  I''d like to see some different crops - perhaps where the light source is not as central, to add a more dynamic composition.  The effect of the light is beautiful and very peaceful.', '2004-03-03 10:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
