(607288, 62902, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - I like the idea that the main figure is almost something you notice after looking for a while.  Emphasizes the feeling of silence and aloneness in the large house.  A much wider-angle lens would have intensified the feeling even more - possibly hard to do, depending on your camera.</td>', 'Nice composition - I like the idea that the main figure is almost something you notice after looking for a while.  Emphasizes the feeling of silence and aloneness in the large house.  A much wider-angle lens would have intensified the feeling even more - possibly hard to do, depending on your camera.', '2004-03-03 10:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
