(607397, 62902, 14773, '<td valign="top">All the space certainly gives the idea of quiet where a busy life possibly once was, but it lacks edge for me. 5.</td>', 'All the space certainly gives the idea of quiet where a busy life possibly once was, but it lacks edge for me. 5.', '2004-03-03 11:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(607399, 62344, 14773, '<td valign="top">I was waiting for this...I almost submitted "silence of the cow"..lol...sorry, not very original but a nice photo with good detail. 5.</td>', 'I was waiting for this...I almost submitted "silence of the cow"..lol...sorry, not very original but a nice photo with good detail. 5.', '2004-03-03 11:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(607400, 62245, 16520, '<td valign="top">Very moving photo gave it a 10</td>', 'Very moving photo gave it a 10', '2004-03-03 11:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(607401, 62442, 17720, '<td valign="top">the fuzziness and the colors in the background sort of give me a headache...I like the idea, but the difference in composure between the primary and secondary subjects are too extreme for me.</td>', 'the fuzziness and the colors in the background sort of give me a headache...I like the idea, but the difference in composure between the primary and secondary subjects are too extreme for me.', '2004-03-03 11:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(607402, 62346, 5391, '<td valign="top">There are an awful lot of elements to this photograph - even without patrons, the cafe still seems "busy" due to elements everywhere in the frame, compounded by the reflections we''re seeing on the glass you apparently took this through.  Distracts from the feeling of "silence".</td>', 'There are an awful lot of elements to this photograph - even without patrons, the cafe still seems "busy" due to elements everywhere in the frame, compounded by the reflections we''re seeing on the glass you apparently took this through.  Distracts from the feeling of "silence".', '2004-03-03 11:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(607404, 62684, 17720, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, not enough snap</td>', 'Out of focus, not enough snap', '2004-03-03 11:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(607405, 63060, 5391, '<td valign="top">Extremely well composed.  Although there are all kinds of elements working in this photograph, you''ve found a way to quiet them down by using a nice wide angle and lots of the pavement, as well as the lines formed by the lights to help contribute to the "silence" of the image.  Nice work.</td>', 'Extremely well composed.  Although there are all kinds of elements working in this photograph, you''ve found a way to quiet them down by using a nice wide angle and lots of the pavement, as well as the lines formed by the lights to help contribute to the "silence" of the image.  Nice work.', '2004-03-03 11:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(607406, 63121, 14773, '<td valign="top">I love negative space, it usually strikes me strongly. Here it''s a bit overwhelming, but for the challenge of ''silence'' it fits very well. Love the shadow on the feather as well. 6.</td>', 'I love negative space, it usually strikes me strongly. Here it''s a bit overwhelming, but for the challenge of ''silence'' it fits very well. Love the shadow on the feather as well. 6.', '2004-03-03 11:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(607407, 63110, 17720, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what this is</td>', 'I can''t tell what this is', '2004-03-03 11:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(607409, 62248, 14773, '<td valign="top">Love the idea of the old newspaper which normally would convey so many ''voices'' now laying silent.  But the stone [?] on the left takes over a bit too much of the focus. 5.</td>', 'Love the idea of the old newspaper which normally would convey so many ''voices'' now laying silent.  But the stone [?] on the left takes over a bit too much of the focus. 5.', '2004-03-03 11:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(607410, 62361, 17720, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic...I like this a lot</td>', 'Very dramatic...I like this a lot', '2004-03-03 11:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(607411, 62558, 14773, '<td valign="top">Sorry, too small, can''t make out any detail....it''s too bad because it looks like it might be a great pic, really can''t tell though.</td>', 'Sorry, too small, can''t make out any detail....it''s too bad because it looks like it might be a great pic, really can''t tell though.', '2004-03-03 11:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(607412, 63061, 17720, '<td valign="top">Nice, but noisy in they sky pixelwise</td>', 'Nice, but noisy in they sky pixelwise', '2004-03-03 11:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
