(607647, 62981, 3697, '<td valign="top">This definately conveys "silence" :) The only thing I might change is not having the person so centered in the shot. I would have had him on the right hand side of the photo, since he is looking toward the left.  Good work.</td>', 'This definately conveys "silence" :) The only thing I might change is not having the person so centered in the shot. I would have had him on the right hand side of the photo, since he is looking toward the left.  Good work.', '2004-03-03 13:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
