(607665, 62437, 17166, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but I think I would like it more if the focus was moved more towards the middle.  The lines pull my eye from the bottom left to the top right, into the fuzzy area.  Then again, maybe that was the effect you were going for - trying to get a visual version of the sound fading away?</td>', 'I like this photo, but I think I would like it more if the focus was moved more towards the middle.  The lines pull my eye from the bottom left to the top right, into the fuzzy area.  Then again, maybe that was the effect you were going for - trying to get a visual version of the sound fading away?', '2004-03-03 14:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
