(607725, 62477, 12131, '<td valign="top">That is so cool.  I once heard of some students who got locked in a college library overnight and built a log cabin out of the reference section.  Love how organized this is, so the colors swirl.</td>', 'That is so cool.  I once heard of some students who got locked in a college library overnight and built a log cabin out of the reference section.  Love how organized this is, so the colors swirl.', '2004-03-03 14:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
