(607728, 63078, 12131, '<td valign="top">Love the blue and the play on words in the title.  Kind of wish the image were bigger though.</td>', 'Love the blue and the play on words in the title.  Kind of wish the image were bigger though.', '2004-03-03 14:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(607730, 63108, 12131, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Kind of sad indeed.  I like the redscale and the depth. The age of the wood enhances the number of years these have seen action and what is not there now.</td>', 'Nice image.  Kind of sad indeed.  I like the redscale and the depth. The age of the wood enhances the number of years these have seen action and what is not there now.', '2004-03-03 14:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(607731, 62722, 13136, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect with the high grain. Not sure about it. Could maybe use a bit mor contrast/darkness? Clever and unique. Good composition.</td>', 'Interesting effect with the high grain. Not sure about it. Could maybe use a bit mor contrast/darkness? Clever and unique. Good composition.', '2004-03-03 14:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(607734, 62813, 16188, '<td valign="top">Very funny. :) - 6</td>', 'Very funny. :) - 6', '2004-03-03 14:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(607736, 63115, 16230, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, and a good subject for the challenge. The symmetry is a bit off for a straight on shot though. The lighting is pretty good, but a bit more in the lower half might have better. Assuming I had the talent to come up with an idea like this (I came up with zip), I might have tried a wider angle and added a single woman sitting or kneeling in one of the pews, maybe wearing something brightly colored to make her stand out. But, then I''d probably find some other way to screw it up.</td>', 'Nice photo, and a good subject for the challenge. The symmetry is a bit off for a straight on shot though. The lighting is pretty good, but a bit more in the lower half might have better. Assuming I had the talent to come up with an idea like this (I came up with zip), I might have tried a wider angle and added a single woman sitting or kneeling in one of the pews, maybe wearing something brightly colored to make her stand out. But, then I''d probably find some other way to screw it up.', '2004-03-03 14:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(607737, 62428, 16188, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait. - 7</td>', 'Wonderful portrait. - 7', '2004-03-03 14:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
