(607822, 62691, 16957, '<td valign="top">This photo feels like you''ve gone outside, pointed your camera at a tree and pressed the button. The flash has highlighted the grass (flash can only travel a limited distance) and leaves little of interest in the frame. If your camera is capable, try a long exposure (30 sec or so) and highlight the tree with a torch. You might get some interestign effects that manage to evoke silence a bit better.</td>', 'This photo feels like you''ve gone outside, pointed your camera at a tree and pressed the button. The flash has highlighted the grass (flash can only travel a limited distance) and leaves little of interest in the frame. If your camera is capable, try a long exposure (30 sec or so) and highlight the tree with a torch. You might get some interestign effects that manage to evoke silence a bit better.', '2004-03-03 15:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
