(608032, 63014, 16648, '<td valign="top">i see a pic of an inanimate object. most such objects make no sound, and do not convey the concept of silence. this object is like those - not conveying the concept of silence (the opposite, as the owner is likley making noise right now). Does not fit challenge.</td>', 'i see a pic of an inanimate object. most such objects make no sound, and do not convey the concept of silence. this object is like those - not conveying the concept of silence (the opposite, as the owner is likley making noise right now). Does not fit challenge.', '2004-03-03 16:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
