(608035, 62862, 3087, '<td valign="top">Excellent representation of the theme.<br/>Visually, suffers from lighting and colour balance - could do with more even lighting over walls, softer, to reduce shine on heads, and less orangey.<br/>Also, because of low viewpoint you have a bit of a parallax thing going on which the lines of the frames really emphasise.<br/>I do like the two pictures on the wall - they kind of echo the two men beneath.<br/></td>', 'Excellent representation of the theme.Visually, suffers from lighting and colour balance - could do with more even lighting over walls, softer, to reduce shine on heads, and less orangey.Also, because of low viewpoint you have a bit of a parallax thing going on which the lines of the frames really emphasise.I do like the two pictures on the wall - they kind of echo the two men beneath.', '2004-03-03 16:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(608036, 62694, 10339, '<td valign="top">The bright sign just to the left of the grave marker detracts.</td>', 'The bright sign just to the left of the grave marker detracts.', '2004-03-03 16:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
