(608312, 63121, 15207, '<td valign="top">I love the colour of this feather. I really love this image for this challenge. The only thing to note is that some people who vote may not scroll down to the bottom to see the whole image (I hope this doesn''t happen... but I''m sure it does). I really love the composition though and wouldn''t change a thing. It really stands out.</td>', 'I love the colour of this feather. I really love this image for this challenge. The only thing to note is that some people who vote may not scroll down to the bottom to see the whole image (I hope this doesn''t happen... but I''m sure it does). I really love the composition though and wouldn''t change a thing. It really stands out.', '2004-03-03 19:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(608313, 62594, 15207, '<td valign="top">I love the colours in this photo and the composition is really nice. Good luck!</td>', 'I love the colours in this photo and the composition is really nice. Good luck!', '2004-03-03 19:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(608314, 62361, 15207, '<td valign="top">Wow... so desolate and barren. It just harkens the word silence. I hope you do well in this challenge.</td>', 'Wow... so desolate and barren. It just harkens the word silence. I hope you do well in this challenge.', '2004-03-03 19:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(608316, 62516, 15207, '<td valign="top">This one really stands out for me. I can totally picture being there in the dark alone with everything still and quiet. A great capture for this challenge.</td>', 'This one really stands out for me. I can totally picture being there in the dark alone with everything still and quiet. A great capture for this challenge.', '2004-03-03 19:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(608317, 63120, 15207, '<td valign="top">I love the desolate nature of this photo. I think it''s one of the better ones in this challenge. The only thing to note is that you may want to increase the size of the image (to about 500 pixels wide) in future challenges. It always seems like the larger photos do better. Good luck with this one.</td>', 'I love the desolate nature of this photo. I think it''s one of the better ones in this challenge. The only thing to note is that you may want to increase the size of the image (to about 500 pixels wide) in future challenges. It always seems like the larger photos do better. Good luck with this one.', '2004-03-03 19:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(608320, 63070, 15207, '<td valign="top">Man... this one really does capture that isolated, deserted corner of the winter world. I also like that (unlike others in this challenge) you actully have a strong subject and you made the composition interesting. Good luck!</td>', 'Man... this one really does capture that isolated, deserted corner of the winter world. I also like that (unlike others in this challenge) you actully have a strong subject and you made the composition interesting. Good luck!', '2004-03-03 19:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(608322, 62459, 15207, '<td valign="top">A very effective shot - well done.</td>', 'A very effective shot - well done.', '2004-03-03 19:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(608323, 62918, 10943, '<td valign="top">Awesome....10</td>', 'Awesome....10', '2004-03-03 19:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(608324, 62806, 15207, '<td valign="top">This one made me laugh. Thanks for adding some humour to this challenge. It''s very well shot - just incredible lighting. An excellent capture and I love the sepia-type tone.</td>', 'This one made me laugh. Thanks for adding some humour to this challenge. It''s very well shot - just incredible lighting. An excellent capture and I love the sepia-type tone.', '2004-03-03 19:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(608326, 62217, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Just a pity it''s not quite straight.</td>', 'Nice.  Just a pity it''s not quite straight.', '2004-03-03 19:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(608327, 62667, 15207, '<td valign="top">I like that you took the time to really think about composition - so many others in this challenge took images in cemeteries with no subject or sense of composition. I hope you do well on this one. I love it in black and white.</td>', 'I like that you took the time to really think about composition - so many others in this challenge took images in cemeteries with no subject or sense of composition. I hope you do well on this one. I love it in black and white.', '2004-03-03 19:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(608328, 62618, 10818, '<td valign="top">A very very cute photo...nicley done...the double frame conflicts with the best part of the photo....the little girl.  Good luck to ya.</td>', 'A very very cute photo...nicley done...the double frame conflicts with the best part of the photo....the little girl.  Good luck to ya.', '2004-03-03 19:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(608329, 63119, 15207, '<td valign="top">I can just picture the silence in this scene. A great capture and well composed.</td>', 'I can just picture the silence in this scene. A great capture and well composed.', '2004-03-03 19:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(608333, 62558, 10943, '<td valign="top">Awww, why so small?</td>', 'Awww, why so small?', '2004-03-03 19:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(608335, 63097, 10818, '<td valign="top">VEry pretty and clear photo....conveys silence well...nice job.</td>', 'VEry pretty and clear photo....conveys silence well...nice job.', '2004-03-03 19:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(608343, 62586, 10943, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2004-03-03 19:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(608355, 62976, 13152, '<td valign="top">This is a terrific shot, but better for the theme of noise!</td>', 'This is a terrific shot, but better for the theme of noise!', '2004-03-03 19:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(608356, 62779, 10943, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!  Haha, that''s just what I want to do to my alarm clock some days!  Nice photo.  9</td>', 'LOL!!!  Haha, that''s just what I want to do to my alarm clock some days!  Nice photo.  9', '2004-03-03 19:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(608364, 62288, 13152, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, but not particularly evocative of silence.</td>', 'Gorgeous, but not particularly evocative of silence.', '2004-03-03 19:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(608379, 62344, 13152, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Holman Hunt would like the way the light comes through the ears.</td>', 'Nice shot. Holman Hunt would like the way the light comes through the ears.', '2004-03-03 19:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(608386, 63064, 10799, '<td valign="top">To me the hamock really says silence..... it looks inviting and draws me into the photo.  The colors are very pretty.</td>', 'To me the hamock really says silence..... it looks inviting and draws me into the photo.  The colors are very pretty.', '2004-03-03 20:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(608387, 62520, 3735, '<td valign="top">I wish i could give you a 20</td>', 'I wish i could give you a 20', '2004-03-03 20:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(608388, 62408, 13152, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, but the treatment fights it.</td>', 'I like the subject, but the treatment fights it.', '2004-03-03 20:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(608389, 63064, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo. The composition and color are beautiful. I especially like the smoothness and colors in the water. However, nothing in the image specifically denotes silence. With my luck some bozo would be revving up a leaf blower or chainsaw somewhere nearby.</td>', 'This is an excellent photo. The composition and color are beautiful. I especially like the smoothness and colors in the water. However, nothing in the image specifically denotes silence. With my luck some bozo would be revving up a leaf blower or chainsaw somewhere nearby.', '2004-03-03 20:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(608392, 63085, 10799, '<td valign="top">but then it is not silent anymore..... I get the expression and love the creativity.... I debated this issue with myself while trying to come up with a topic and thought it might not really be silence.... YOU did a great job.</td>', 'but then it is not silent anymore..... I get the expression and love the creativity.... I debated this issue with myself while trying to come up with a topic and thought it might not really be silence.... YOU did a great job.', '2004-03-03 20:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(608393, 63102, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is really good! I''ll bet he doesn''t say much.</td>', 'This is really good! I''ll bet he doesn''t say much.', '2004-03-03 20:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(608398, 63064, 13152, '<td valign="top">Where do you live then?!</td>', 'Where do you live then?!', '2004-03-03 20:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(608401, 63085, 16479, '<td valign="top">nice shot....i like the lighting and the shadow....</td>', 'nice shot....i like the lighting and the shadow....', '2004-03-03 20:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(608403, 62726, 17890, '<td valign="top">got the feeling of a very SILENT room</td>', 'got the feeling of a very SILENT room', '2004-03-03 20:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(608407, 62693, 13152, '<td valign="top">This really does say silence. A beautifully controlled shot.</td>', 'This really does say silence. A beautifully controlled shot.', '2004-03-03 20:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(608410, 63014, 14614, '<td valign="top">the drool get this shot an extra point ;)<br/>Close in, well lit, and a bit ikky.</td>', 'the drool get this shot an extra point ;)Close in, well lit, and a bit ikky.', '2004-03-03 20:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(608411, 62563, 13152, '<td valign="top">This is such a delicate and evocative image that one can feel the quiet (and the cold).</td>', 'This is such a delicate and evocative image that one can feel the quiet (and the cold).', '2004-03-03 20:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(608414, 62683, 14614, '<td valign="top">(why the parenthetical comment?)</td>', '(why the parenthetical comment?)', '2004-03-03 20:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(608415, 62594, 13152, '<td valign="top">Rich and still. Love the colour. Good luck.</td>', 'Rich and still. Love the colour. Good luck.', '2004-03-03 20:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(608417, 62866, 13152, '<td valign="top">Wonderful concept and execution. The expressions are priceless.</td>', 'Wonderful concept and execution. The expressions are priceless.', '2004-03-03 20:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(608419, 62237, 14614, '<td valign="top">What happended to the size?  This is just too small for me to get a sense of the shot.</td>', 'What happended to the size?  This is just too small for me to get a sense of the shot.', '2004-03-03 20:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(608423, 62852, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like the central pose and the back view.  I found the blinds distracting (perhaps a narrower dof?) and the floor too bright.  These two elements set a contemporary mood -- out of place for the figure and title.</td>', 'I like the central pose and the back view.  I found the blinds distracting (perhaps a narrower dof?) and the floor too bright.  These two elements set a contemporary mood -- out of place for the figure and title.', '2004-03-03 20:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(608426, 62474, 13152, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. The composition is very satisfying.  Seems a sort of existential quiet.</td>', 'I really like this shot. The composition is very satisfying.  Seems a sort of existential quiet.', '2004-03-03 20:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(608427, 62211, 14557, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking shot, but a Silent outboard motor...</td>', 'Breathtaking shot, but a Silent outboard motor...', '2004-03-03 20:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(608428, 63080, 14614, '<td valign="top">I wish this picture was bigger.  It''s hard to get a sense of your shot (it looks like it''s got a great composition) Sorry</td>', 'I wish this picture was bigger.  It''s hard to get a sense of your shot (it looks like it''s got a great composition) Sorry', '2004-03-03 20:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(608429, 63069, 14557, '<td valign="top">Amen.</td>', 'Amen.', '2004-03-03 20:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(608430, 63004, 13152, '<td valign="top">Very brave and refreshing. You''ll get clobbered, though.</td>', 'Very brave and refreshing. You''ll get clobbered, though.', '2004-03-03 20:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(608431, 62912, 14557, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-03-03 20:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(608432, 63006, 13152, '<td valign="top">Expected more empty stadia, but I doubt if they would have been as good as this. Can customers sit on the rocky tiers as well?</td>', 'Expected more empty stadia, but I doubt if they would have been as good as this. Can customers sit on the rocky tiers as well?', '2004-03-03 20:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(608433, 62449, 14192, '<td valign="top">Very good photo - it conveyed silence for me.  Good choice going with B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very good photo - it conveyed silence for me.  Good choice going with B&W.', '2004-03-03 20:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(608435, 63020, 13152, '<td valign="top">Classic. I want to be there.</td>', 'Classic. I want to be there.', '2004-03-03 20:43:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(608436, 63035, 14557, '<td valign="top">Nice compsition. I like that the object of the shot is off center.</td>', 'Nice compsition. I like that the object of the shot is off center.', '2004-03-03 20:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(608438, 62360, 14192, '<td valign="top">I like the light and shadows, but for me it doesn''t tie in with the theme.</td>', 'I like the light and shadows, but for me it doesn''t tie in with the theme.', '2004-03-03 20:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(608439, 62991, 13152, '<td valign="top">Delectable shadows. Is this long exposure by moonlight?</td>', 'Delectable shadows. Is this long exposure by moonlight?', '2004-03-03 20:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(608440, 63108, 14557, '<td valign="top">Great sepia tone. That and the weathering of the wood give an impression of a deserted playground, abandoned and silent.</td>', 'Great sepia tone. That and the weathering of the wood give an impression of a deserted playground, abandoned and silent.', '2004-03-03 20:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(608442, 62365, 14192, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and its relation to the theme of silence.  I think its too bright - but I''m guessing that was your intent here.</td>', 'I like the composition and its relation to the theme of silence.  I think its too bright - but I''m guessing that was your intent here.', '2004-03-03 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(608444, 62985, 13152, '<td valign="top">Stark and uncomfortably strong, but seems a bit of an odd shape under the sheet.</td>', 'Stark and uncomfortably strong, but seems a bit of an odd shape under the sheet.', '2004-03-03 20:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(608445, 62477, 13152, '<td valign="top">Did you build this? Very nice! Reminds me of some of the book sculptures made by the Icelandic artist Sigurdur Gudmundsson. My only complaint is the clumsy title.</td>', 'Did you build this? Very nice! Reminds me of some of the book sculptures made by the Icelandic artist Sigurdur Gudmundsson. My only complaint is the clumsy title.', '2004-03-03 20:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(608447, 62582, 6667, '<td valign="top">Hey,  Does it really, realy  work?!!!  I got the opposite situation and am desperate! BOL  Just a litttle fuzzy for my taste.</td>', 'Hey,  Does it really, realy  work?!!!  I got the opposite situation and am desperate! BOL  Just a litttle fuzzy for my taste.', '2004-03-03 20:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(608448, 62520, 15381, '<td valign="top">love me some political overtones...and becaue its funny...not because its the greatest photo 10</td>', 'love me some political overtones...and becaue its funny...not because its the greatest photo 10', '2004-03-03 20:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(608449, 62918, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice picture except I would have left off the cement ledge.</td>', 'Nice picture except I would have left off the cement ledge.', '2004-03-03 20:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(608450, 62677, 13152, '<td valign="top">Very stylish and masterfully controlled, to so perfectly maintain the perpendicular. I like the ''not writing'' silence, too. One tiny gripe is the sharpened point in the upper left.</td>', 'Very stylish and masterfully controlled, to so perfectly maintain the perpendicular. I like the ''not writing'' silence, too. One tiny gripe is the sharpened point in the upper left.', '2004-03-03 20:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(608453, 62501, 13152, '<td valign="top">Nice colour and frames within frames.</td>', 'Nice colour and frames within frames.', '2004-03-03 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(608454, 62659, 15381, '<td valign="top">definetly feel the road trip for sure...or long journey but not feeling silence at all...still good photo and well composed</td>', 'definetly feel the road trip for sure...or long journey but not feeling silence at all...still good photo and well composed', '2004-03-03 20:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(608455, 62762, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice but perhaps composition from another angle would have helped.</td>', 'Nice but perhaps composition from another angle would have helped.', '2004-03-03 20:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(608457, 62979, 14836, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Great tree.</td>', 'Very nice composition. Great tree.', '2004-03-03 20:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(608458, 62905, 13152, '<td valign="top">Very strong graphics. Like the two pictures in one.</td>', 'Very strong graphics. Like the two pictures in one.', '2004-03-03 20:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(608459, 62357, 17228, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but tough to pull off. Image looks pretty dark, not enough light being reflected by shiny metal needle... a larger light source or reflector next time? Would of been cool if you could have captured several rapid images of the needle falling/hitting floor. What I''m trying to say is that it looks more like a "still life" of a needle rather than the silence of a "pin dropping". Keep it up!</td>', 'Good idea, but tough to pull off. Image looks pretty dark, not enough light being reflected by shiny metal needle... a larger light source or reflector next time? Would of been cool if you could have captured several rapid images of the needle falling/hitting floor. What I''m trying to say is that it looks more like a "still life" of a needle rather than the silence of a "pin dropping". Keep it up!', '2004-03-03 20:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(608460, 62665, 14836, '<td valign="top">Good idea. A little harsh in lighting though.</td>', 'Good idea. A little harsh in lighting though.', '2004-03-03 20:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(608461, 63040, 14836, '<td valign="top">Very nice but would have cropped this one at the top.</td>', 'Very nice but would have cropped this one at the top.', '2004-03-03 20:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(608462, 62694, 14192, '<td valign="top">Too dark and chaotic.</td>', 'Too dark and chaotic.', '2004-03-03 21:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(608463, 63110, 14836, '<td valign="top">What is this ? Can''t figure out the details of this pic. I think there is a shadow of someone somewhere.</td>', 'What is this ? Can''t figure out the details of this pic. I think there is a shadow of someone somewhere.', '2004-03-03 21:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(608465, 63060, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice but I would have left out the hydro lines in this one.</td>', 'Nice but I would have left out the hydro lines in this one.', '2004-03-03 21:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(608466, 62305, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2004-03-03 21:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(608467, 62956, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and grainy effect. Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice colors and grainy effect. Nice composition.', '2004-03-03 21:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(608468, 63125, 14192, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but not right for this contest.</td>', 'Nice photo, but not right for this contest.', '2004-03-03 21:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(608469, 62292, 17228, '<td valign="top">OK, so maybe I don''t have a Master''s Degree in Psychology, but I''m at a total loss at what this has to do with silence or even it''s hidden meaning!  :)     I''m sure the photographer had an idea of what he wanted to express, but it didn''t translate well for this viewer. Too cerebral for me!</td>', 'OK, so maybe I don''t have a Master''s Degree in Psychology, but I''m at a total loss at what this has to do with silence or even it''s hidden meaning!  :)     I''m sure the photographer had an idea of what he wanted to express, but it didn''t translate well for this viewer. Too cerebral for me!', '2004-03-03 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(608470, 62926, 13152, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but as someone that would like all guns silenced I find this singularly unappealing. I guess it is propaganda that will get a better reception in the States.</td>', 'Sorry, but as someone that would like all guns silenced I find this singularly unappealing. I guess it is propaganda that will get a better reception in the States.', '2004-03-03 21:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(608471, 62220, 14836, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Love the glow reflection at the bottom.</td>', 'Nice composition. Love the glow reflection at the bottom.', '2004-03-03 21:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(608472, 63077, 14557, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. "Silent Love?"</td>', 'Nice shot. "Silent Love?"', '2004-03-03 21:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(608473, 63038, 14836, '<td valign="top">NIce composition</td>', 'NIce composition', '2004-03-03 21:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(608474, 63053, 15934, '<td valign="top">I felt this was a snapshot taken from a ski lift.  Beautiful scenary, but needs a little more in the composition department.</td>', 'I felt this was a snapshot taken from a ski lift.  Beautiful scenary, but needs a little more in the composition department.', '2004-03-03 21:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(608475, 62259, 14836, '<td valign="top">Great composition and angle</td>', 'Great composition and angle', '2004-03-03 21:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(608476, 62927, 14192, '<td valign="top">I like the thought here and the composition.  His back to the photo is good and his profile against the  large and foreboding building and concrete give a sense of solitude.  Very good job.</td>', 'I like the thought here and the composition.  His back to the photo is good and his profile against the  large and foreboding building and concrete give a sense of solitude.  Very good job.', '2004-03-03 21:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(608478, 62301, 14836, '<td valign="top">There is something about tomb stones that are interesting to look at. Not to be morbid. I like this in black and white.</td>', 'There is something about tomb stones that are interesting to look at. Not to be morbid. I like this in black and white.', '2004-03-03 21:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(608479, 62558, 14192, '<td valign="top">Photo is too small and lacks sharpness.</td>', 'Photo is too small and lacks sharpness.', '2004-03-03 21:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(608480, 63065, 15934, '<td valign="top">I may be dating myself, but I thought this would have been better with a traditional chalkboard.  Or do they make kids cut n'' paste "I will not talk" a hundred times now? :)</td>', 'I may be dating myself, but I thought this would have been better with a traditional chalkboard.  Or do they make kids cut n'' paste "I will not talk" a hundred times now? :)', '2004-03-03 21:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(608482, 62492, 15934, '<td valign="top">I really really like this picture!</td>', 'I really really like this picture!', '2004-03-03 21:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(608483, 62677, 14836, '<td valign="top">Cool ! My favorite so far. I like the blue hue on this one. Great shadows. A 9.</td>', 'Cool ! My favorite so far. I like the blue hue on this one. Great shadows. A 9.', '2004-03-03 21:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(608484, 62684, 14836, '<td valign="top">Too bad for the floor in this shot.</td>', 'Too bad for the floor in this shot.', '2004-03-03 21:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(608485, 62577, 15934, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit flat, and when I think the of the miserable hours I''ve spent on planes, "Silence" doesn''t come to mind.  I do like the colorful wingtip.</td>', 'Seems a bit flat, and when I think the of the miserable hours I''ve spent on planes, "Silence" doesn''t come to mind.  I do like the colorful wingtip.', '2004-03-03 21:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(608486, 62684, 14192, '<td valign="top">Cute subject, but don''t like the composition.  The flloor in the picture detracts from your intent here.</td>', 'Cute subject, but don''t like the composition.  The flloor in the picture detracts from your intent here.', '2004-03-03 21:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(608487, 62245, 6667, '<td valign="top">Of all the many enties I have viewed so far, this one, without a doubt nails the theme: What drives us to silence?  A silent tribute for the ultimate sacrifice.  BOL  As a matter of personal taste,  I would like to see a much crisper focus and a more pronounced contrast,  especailly in the stars and service bars (but they are gold aren''t they?)  The softness doesn''t fit here.  But again. . . that is only my opinion.</td>', 'Of all the many enties I have viewed so far, this one, without a doubt nails the theme: What drives us to silence?  A silent tribute for the ultimate sacrifice.  BOL  As a matter of personal taste,  I would like to see a much crisper focus and a more pronounced contrast,  especailly in the stars and service bars (but they are gold aren''t they?)  The softness doesn''t fit here.  But again. . . that is only my opinion.', '2004-03-03 21:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(608488, 62292, 15934, '<td valign="top">Had some trouble seeing the "silence" part of this.</td>', 'Had some trouble seeing the "silence" part of this.', '2004-03-03 21:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(608490, 62734, 14192, '<td valign="top">I like your use of a slow shutter to smooth the flow of water.  The soft light on the water also works well.</td>', 'I like your use of a slow shutter to smooth the flow of water.  The soft light on the water also works well.', '2004-03-03 21:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(608491, 63094, 14836, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Very interesting. Perfect for this challenge.</td>', 'Great composition. Very interesting. Perfect for this challenge.', '2004-03-03 21:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(608493, 63074, 17228, '<td valign="top">I liked the idea behind the shot, better than seeing lots of photos of tape over people''s mouths. A little extra time setting up the shot would have made for a stronger image (cut off shoe, background further away so as not to cast shadow directly behind spud, less light/more directional for more shadow and midtones on figure for improved modelling of shapes and details). Technical aspects can always be improved, it''s the IDEAS that can''t be taught...keep ''em comin''.   :)</td>', 'I liked the idea behind the shot, better than seeing lots of photos of tape over people''s mouths. A little extra time setting up the shot would have made for a stronger image (cut off shoe, background further away so as not to cast shadow directly behind spud, less light/more directional for more shadow and midtones on figure for improved modelling of shapes and details). Technical aspects can always be improved, it''s the IDEAS that can''t be taught...keep ''em comin''.   :)', '2004-03-03 21:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(608494, 63091, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot. Love the warm glow of the lights. Not quite getting the feeling of "silence" from this pic though.</td>', 'Nice night shot. Love the warm glow of the lights. Not quite getting the feeling of "silence" from this pic though.', '2004-03-03 21:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
