(608550, 62260, 14487, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea but I believe it''s poorly shot.  You can see the reflection in the wood from the flash and it''s almost too dark at the head.  A different angle and position would have made this shot a lot better.</td>', 'This is a good idea but I believe it''s poorly shot.  You can see the reflection in the wood from the flash and it''s almost too dark at the head.  A different angle and position would have made this shot a lot better.', '2004-03-03 22:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
