(608603, 62929, 14487, '<td valign="top">I knew some people would do graveyards, and I think this is one of the best.  It conveys sadness and grief without a word.  I only wish that the bottom right corner of the stone had not been cut off.</td>', 'I knew some people would do graveyards, and I think this is one of the best.  It conveys sadness and grief without a word.  I only wish that the bottom right corner of the stone had not been cut off.', '2004-03-03 22:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
