(608605, 63121, 14487, '<td valign="top">Creative, innovative, and beatifully shot.  This is very original and the use of blank space is brilliant.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Creative, innovative, and beatifully shot.  This is very original and the use of blank space is brilliant.  One of my top picks.', '2004-03-03 22:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
