(608607, 62603, 14487, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fade to the edges of the flower.  The detail in this shot is amazing and it seems to convey complete silence.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Beautiful fade to the edges of the flower.  The detail in this shot is amazing and it seems to convey complete silence.  One of my favorites.', '2004-03-03 22:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(608608, 62715, 14487, '<td valign="top">Good idea to take advantage of a sign.  I would only say that there''s significant blowout along the left side, and the lack of a clear edge on the logs blends them with the water a bit too much.  I like, however, how the branches frame the shot.  Nice touch.</td>', 'Good idea to take advantage of a sign.  I would only say that there''s significant blowout along the left side, and the lack of a clear edge on the logs blends them with the water a bit too much.  I like, however, how the branches frame the shot.  Nice touch.', '2004-03-03 22:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(608609, 62558, 14487, '<td valign="top">It''s good, but small.  Also, perhaps a shot where the ladder was more distance and the open space was more predominant would better convey silence.</td>', 'It''s good, but small.  Also, perhaps a shot where the ladder was more distance and the open space was more predominant would better convey silence.', '2004-03-03 22:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(608611, 62809, 14487, '<td valign="top">Obviously the graininess is intentional, and it''s a risky but good idea.  It really conveys a kind of mental struggling.</td>', 'Obviously the graininess is intentional, and it''s a risky but good idea.  It really conveys a kind of mental struggling.', '2004-03-03 22:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
