(608616, 62869, 14487, '<td valign="top">Good shot, it must have been challenging : )<br/>I would only have liked to see a more original angle, and I think a color photo would really bring out the emotion more.</td>', 'Good shot, it must have been challenging : )I would only have liked to see a more original angle, and I think a color photo would really bring out the emotion more.', '2004-03-03 22:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(608617, 62761, 14487, '<td valign="top">Good, original shot.  But, I wish we were closer to the statue.  It''s almost difficult to tell what it is.</td>', 'Good, original shot.  But, I wish we were closer to the statue.  It''s almost difficult to tell what it is.', '2004-03-03 22:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(608618, 62799, 14487, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the moon could have been captured better.  Also, obviously making it so bright made the lamp very bright, which a bit distracting.  Two focal points in a photo is confusing to the viewer.  Also, I wish the edges of the house were more defined and detailed.</td>', 'Good idea, but the moon could have been captured better.  Also, obviously making it so bright made the lamp very bright, which a bit distracting.  Two focal points in a photo is confusing to the viewer.  Also, I wish the edges of the house were more defined and detailed.', '2004-03-03 22:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(608620, 62855, 14487, '<td valign="top">Cool idea!  I think black and white would be good for this shot, but it''s not a very big deal.  The open space at the top adds perspective, too.  What''s in the bottom right corner, though?  A twig, perhaps?</td>', 'Cool idea!  I think black and white would be good for this shot, but it''s not a very big deal.  The open space at the top adds perspective, too.  What''s in the bottom right corner, though?  A twig, perhaps?', '2004-03-03 22:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(608622, 62495, 14487, '<td valign="top">Wow!  The rays are captured nicely, and somehow you managed to keep the sun from being too distracting.  I think it''s because it''s in the corner.  Anyway, I like this shot.</td>', 'Wow!  The rays are captured nicely, and somehow you managed to keep the sun from being too distracting.  I think it''s because it''s in the corner.  Anyway, I like this shot.', '2004-03-03 22:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(608623, 62443, 14487, '<td valign="top">I think you were going for an old-fashioned look with the sepia tone but I personally don''t like it.  Also, the shoes and hair look almost negative in their tone.  A good idea, but I don''t like the way it was shot.  It''s also difficult to discern what the cloth is in the top right, and it''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'I think you were going for an old-fashioned look with the sepia tone but I personally don''t like it.  Also, the shoes and hair look almost negative in their tone.  A good idea, but I don''t like the way it was shot.  It''s also difficult to discern what the cloth is in the top right, and it''s a bit distracting.', '2004-03-03 22:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(608624, 62587, 14487, '<td valign="top">Cool forest shot.  It''s almost perfect, but I wish you hadn''t centered a tree in the middle of the frame.  Without it, it would have created an empty, silence feel, but now the eye is drawn to the tree as if it has some special importance.  Good picture, though.</td>', 'Cool forest shot.  It''s almost perfect, but I wish you hadn''t centered a tree in the middle of the frame.  Without it, it would have created an empty, silence feel, but now the eye is drawn to the tree as if it has some special importance.  Good picture, though.', '2004-03-03 22:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(608626, 63016, 14487, '<td valign="top">I love the way you can see the shadows on the snow beneath.  The structures in the top right are distracting, however, as is the bush on the right.  Also, the angle muddled the lifts with the ones in front of them and it''s a bit confusing.</td>', 'I love the way you can see the shadows on the snow beneath.  The structures in the top right are distracting, however, as is the bush on the right.  Also, the angle muddled the lifts with the ones in front of them and it''s a bit confusing.', '2004-03-03 22:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(608628, 62912, 14487, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, but I can''t tell what''s hiding behind the hump in the middle.  Also, the trees lead the eye in kind of an arc, which is confusing because there''s no real subject or focal point.</td>', 'I like this picture, but I can''t tell what''s hiding behind the hump in the middle.  Also, the trees lead the eye in kind of an arc, which is confusing because there''s no real subject or focal point.', '2004-03-03 22:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(608631, 62852, 14487, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  I love the consistent tone of the robe and seat, as well as the horizontal stripes of the shade contrasting with the verticle ones on the wood floor.  I don''t know if this would look better black and white, but it''s one of my favorites.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  I love the consistent tone of the robe and seat, as well as the horizontal stripes of the shade contrasting with the verticle ones on the wood floor.  I don''t know if this would look better black and white, but it''s one of my favorites.', '2004-03-03 22:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(608633, 62308, 14487, '<td valign="top">You must have raced to take this photo!  The empty space is nice, especially with the fence at the bottom adding perspective.  What I don''t like is that the clouds end and there''s empty sky, which seems to convey an unknown meaning.  I think it would have been better with an empty sky or a completely cloud-filled one.</td>', 'You must have raced to take this photo!  The empty space is nice, especially with the fence at the bottom adding perspective.  What I don''t like is that the clouds end and there''s empty sky, which seems to convey an unknown meaning.  I think it would have been better with an empty sky or a completely cloud-filled one.', '2004-03-03 22:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(608634, 62934, 14487, '<td valign="top">I was waiting for a finger over the lips shot.  I like the blurriness and the uniqueness of the model.  The only criticism I have is the line of light along the middle, it frames the subject but it''s a bit blown out.</td>', 'I was waiting for a finger over the lips shot.  I like the blurriness and the uniqueness of the model.  The only criticism I have is the line of light along the middle, it frames the subject but it''s a bit blown out.', '2004-03-03 22:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(608636, 62427, 14487, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but I think it wasn''t executed very well.  The big column in the middle seems to be there for a reason, but I can''t imagine why.  A "No Talking" or "Quiet" sign on this would make it understandable, but a blank white column doesn''t seem to have much meaning.  It also would have been nice to play with the sunbeams a bit more.</td>', 'A good idea, but I think it wasn''t executed very well.  The big column in the middle seems to be there for a reason, but I can''t imagine why.  A "No Talking" or "Quiet" sign on this would make it understandable, but a blank white column doesn''t seem to have much meaning.  It also would have been nice to play with the sunbeams a bit more.', '2004-03-03 22:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(608639, 63104, 14487, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, silence in nature.  It''s like a fight over land, with a clear dividing line down the middle.  The only thing I would have liked would be a shore or something similar, to add perspective.</td>', 'Cool photo, silence in nature.  It''s like a fight over land, with a clear dividing line down the middle.  The only thing I would have liked would be a shore or something similar, to add perspective.', '2004-03-03 22:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
