(608936, 62994, 10883, '<td valign="top">Hmm... first off, the colors in this picture do not appeal to me, secondly the blood does not look real by a longshot.  If we are to belive that she has been stabbed/cut then it would have been better see some "evidence" of that.</td>', 'Hmm... first off, the colors in this picture do not appeal to me, secondly the blood does not look real by a longshot.  If we are to belive that she has been stabbed/cut then it would have been better see some "evidence" of that.', '2004-03-04 07:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(608938, 62999, 17879, '<td valign="top">1</td>', '1', '2004-03-04 07:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(608940, 62902, 16477, '<td valign="top">very different  concept, framing could use little tweaking but at first looks  gives the feeling of silence and emptyness</td>', 'very different  concept, framing could use little tweaking but at first looks  gives the feeling of silence and emptyness', '2004-03-04 07:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(608941, 62691, 17879, '<td valign="top">Easy 1</td>', 'Easy 1', '2004-03-04 07:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(608945, 62691, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea but the overall shot leaves me really wanting.  I can barely make out the tree in the top and yes my monitor is calibrated.  The grassy area is dull and not very pleasing to the eye.  A 3</td>', 'Not a bad idea but the overall shot leaves me really wanting.  I can barely make out the tree in the top and yes my monitor is calibrated.  The grassy area is dull and not very pleasing to the eye.  A 3', '2004-03-04 07:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(608948, 62838, 12448, '<td valign="top">The silent scream!  Wonderful capture of the fish, Koi I believe?  At first it''s a little difficult to tell where the shot was taken then I see the tiny ripple next to his mouth.  A bit of straightening on this shot and if you could have captured the other fin on the right it would be a really cool shot.  As is a 6</td>', 'The silent scream!  Wonderful capture of the fish, Koi I believe?  At first it''s a little difficult to tell where the shot was taken then I see the tiny ripple next to his mouth.  A bit of straightening on this shot and if you could have captured the other fin on the right it would be a really cool shot.  As is a 6', '2004-03-04 07:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(608949, 63072, 16477, '<td valign="top">That'' Silence  for me, perfect 10</td>', 'That'' Silence  for me, perfect 10', '2004-03-04 07:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(608951, 62470, 12448, '<td valign="top">A very telling story.  A nice shot but a lot of distraction with the background of trees to the right.  Maybe a tighter crop on the right?  I love the use of the black and white on this shot, a touch more contrast would really make this shot work for me.  As is a 7</td>', 'A very telling story.  A nice shot but a lot of distraction with the background of trees to the right.  Maybe a tighter crop on the right?  I love the use of the black and white on this shot, a touch more contrast would really make this shot work for me.  As is a 7', '2004-03-04 07:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(608955, 62839, 16676, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I can feel the quiet atmosphere.</td>', 'Good composition. I can feel the quiet atmosphere.', '2004-03-04 08:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(608957, 63120, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery but the picture itself is WAY too small.  You might want to have it in 640x480 next time.</td>', 'Nice scenery but the picture itself is WAY too small.  You might want to have it in 640x480 next time.', '2004-03-04 08:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(608961, 62875, 10883, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.<br/> <br/>It might have been better to take the picture at dusk or dawn when the light conditions are much more interesting.  The light in the front part of the picture does not work for me.  There is also much noise present in the picture.  It is most noticable in the crosses and in the night sky.<br/>Good perspective though!</td>', 'Interesting subject. It might have been better to take the picture at dusk or dawn when the light conditions are much more interesting.  The light in the front part of the picture does not work for me.  There is also much noise present in the picture.  It is most noticable in the crosses and in the night sky.Good perspective though!', '2004-03-04 08:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(608974, 63014, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very clear and sharp. I do like the way the colors are presented here, especially against the pure white background. I see you have also mastered the lighting perfectly, revealing only minimal shadows. Exactly as you would find in stock photography catalogs. The inclusion of the saliva running down just adds so much more impact.</td>', 'Very clear and sharp. I do like the way the colors are presented here, especially against the pure white background. I see you have also mastered the lighting perfectly, revealing only minimal shadows. Exactly as you would find in stock photography catalogs. The inclusion of the saliva running down just adds so much more impact.', '2004-03-04 08:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(608978, 62594, 15919, '<td valign="top">Peachful and quiet, the prototype image for the challenge.  Like the strong red color in the othervise monotonal image.</td>', 'Peachful and quiet, the prototype image for the challenge.  Like the strong red color in the othervise monotonal image.', '2004-03-04 08:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(608982, 62220, 15919, '<td valign="top">Think the image might need a litle more sharpness.  The border (or frame) I think is way to much.</td>', 'Think the image might need a litle more sharpness.  The border (or frame) I think is way to much.', '2004-03-04 09:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
