(609008, 62413, 14614, '<td valign="top">a very soft focus helps send your silent message - To increase the impact of the shot for me, I''d like to see the background less busy as that would send a stronger silent message.  A bit more light on the main subject might be interesting to try</td>', 'a very soft focus helps send your silent message - To increase the impact of the shot for me, I''d like to see the background less busy as that would send a stronger silent message.  A bit more light on the main subject might be interesting to try', '2004-03-04 09:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(609009, 62978, 14614, '<td valign="top">On of my favorites. I like the expression on the subject, the way the white clothes stand out against the background and they way they contrast with all the sharp stone.  I''d suggest cropping either right or left to move the subject out of center of the frame.</td>', 'On of my favorites. I like the expression on the subject, the way the white clothes stand out against the background and they way they contrast with all the sharp stone.  I''d suggest cropping either right or left to move the subject out of center of the frame.', '2004-03-04 09:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(609010, 62488, 14614, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured silence here.  One of my favorites.  To up the score from me, I''d like the horizon leveled.</td>', 'You''ve captured silence here.  One of my favorites.  To up the score from me, I''d like the horizon leveled.', '2004-03-04 09:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(609013, 62487, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in the challenge.  To up the score from me I''d like to see a narrower dof (less crisp background), a bit more light on the subjects, umm bum.  You''ve done a wonderful job with symetry to a point, I''d like to have the fence even as well as the arms/hands and the lotus position of the knees.  As is it really sends the message of silence</td>', 'One of my favorites in the challenge.  To up the score from me I''d like to see a narrower dof (less crisp background), a bit more light on the subjects, umm bum.  You''ve done a wonderful job with symetry to a point, I''d like to have the fence even as well as the arms/hands and the lotus position of the knees.  As is it really sends the message of silence', '2004-03-04 09:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(609016, 62516, 14614, '<td valign="top">This is my second view of this shot -- there''s a haunting quality to it.  Aethetically it one of my favorites.  Somehow the bicycle under the lamp makes the shot.  I''d suggest cropping out the blurry foreground and the lights on the far left.</td>', 'This is my second view of this shot -- there''s a haunting quality to it.  Aethetically it one of my favorites.  Somehow the bicycle under the lamp makes the shot.  I''d suggest cropping out the blurry foreground and the lights on the far left.', '2004-03-04 09:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
