(609119, 62777, 16095, '<td valign="top">this is such a great statement--an orchard in winter-no friut-no blooms...Dormant. I like how you balanced the image with the mountain area in left corner &amp; clouds in right.</td>', 'this is such a great statement--an orchard in winter-no friut-no blooms...Dormant. I like how you balanced the image with the mountain area in left corner & clouds in right.', '2004-03-04 10:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
