(609149, 62252, 14986, '<td valign="top">What this one really looks like to me has nothing to do with silence.  It looks like I''ve forgotten my sunglasses and am simply shielding my eyes with my hand.</td>', 'What this one really looks like to me has nothing to do with silence.  It looks like I''ve forgotten my sunglasses and am simply shielding my eyes with my hand.', '2004-03-04 10:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
