(609164, 62217, 16095, '<td valign="top">i really admire this image-- technically it may need some a hint of contrast adjustments to make the white pop</td>', 'i really admire this image-- technically it may need some a hint of contrast adjustments to make the white pop', '2004-03-04 10:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(609165, 62892, 14986, '<td valign="top">Silence is there.   Technically  there is nothing here to hold my interest.  Just a few drab trees against a drab sky (maybe color would work better?)</td>', 'Silence is there.   Technically  there is nothing here to hold my interest.  Just a few drab trees against a drab sky (maybe color would work better?)', '2004-03-04 10:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(609166, 62879, 16402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. By far the best "silence" landscape I''ve seen so far. Expsoure seems just a tad to bright, but composition and contrast are excellent.</td>', 'Beautiful. By far the best "silence" landscape I''ve seen so far. Expsoure seems just a tad to bright, but composition and contrast are excellent.', '2004-03-04 10:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(609167, 62932, 16095, '<td valign="top">this is a good idea and the image area is used to it''s advantage, though the hearing devices look too organic for the cold white paper..</td>', 'this is a good idea and the image area is used to it''s advantage, though the hearing devices look too organic for the cold white paper..', '2004-03-04 10:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(609168, 63095, 15407, '<td valign="top">Beautiful &amp; Majestic image,  yet I''ve heard roaring winds &amp; the sounds of avalanches on mountains like this which for me keeps this shot from completely conveying silence.</td>', 'Beautiful & Majestic image,  yet I''ve heard roaring winds & the sounds of avalanches on mountains like this which for me keeps this shot from completely conveying silence.', '2004-03-04 10:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(609169, 63015, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I just don''t get the "story" of this photo.  I see used candles and flowers (?) in a hole in the snow.  Maybe there''s something here I''m just not getting.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I just don''t get the "story" of this photo.  I see used candles and flowers (?) in a hole in the snow.  Maybe there''s something here I''m just not getting.', '2004-03-04 10:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(609170, 63014, 3102, '<td valign="top">The drool is a cute addition... :)  I like the simplicity of this one!</td>', 'The drool is a cute addition... :)  I like the simplicity of this one!', '2004-03-04 10:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(609171, 62260, 16402, '<td valign="top">Highlight on guitar is distracting.</td>', 'Highlight on guitar is distracting.', '2004-03-04 10:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(609172, 63089, 15407, '<td valign="top">Oh NO it''s ''that time again!  Made me laugh &amp; got the extra point. Technically it''s a bit tough to get the ''WOW'' effect with a simple subject such as this.</td>', 'Oh NO it''s ''that time again!  Made me laugh & got the extra point. Technically it''s a bit tough to get the ''WOW'' effect with a simple subject such as this.', '2004-03-04 10:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(609174, 62932, 15407, '<td valign="top">Without these , there is only silence...</td>', 'Without these , there is only silence...', '2004-03-04 10:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(609175, 63064, 3102, '<td valign="top">A great shot in general, although it''s rather pixelated.  If this was a bit sharper, it would be a 9-10 in my book!</td>', 'A great shot in general, although it''s rather pixelated.  If this was a bit sharper, it would be a 9-10 in my book!', '2004-03-04 10:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(609177, 62437, 16402, '<td valign="top">I like this but there just seems to be something, I''m not sure what, missing. Something that makes it "pop!" So, that probably doesn''t help much, but ... Still a nice job.</td>', 'I like this but there just seems to be something, I''m not sure what, missing. Something that makes it "pop!" So, that probably doesn''t help much, but ... Still a nice job.', '2004-03-04 10:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(609178, 63115, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful architecture.  I like the theme and title of this image... great shot :)</td>', 'beautiful architecture.  I like the theme and title of this image... great shot :)', '2004-03-04 10:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(609179, 62249, 16402, '<td valign="top">Very nice interpretation, but seems just a bit too dark to me.</td>', 'Very nice interpretation, but seems just a bit too dark to me.', '2004-03-04 10:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(609181, 62871, 14986, '<td valign="top">I thought of this idea, since I''m a Realtor.   I think it''s difficult to convey the feeling of a room in a photo.   This one does okay and I really like the light coming in on the floor.  This might have been more effective with some moving boxes or something...maybe a piece of furniture covered up?</td>', 'I thought of this idea, since I''m a Realtor.   I think it''s difficult to convey the feeling of a room in a photo.   This one does okay and I really like the light coming in on the floor.  This might have been more effective with some moving boxes or something...maybe a piece of furniture covered up?', '2004-03-04 10:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(609182, 62603, 16402, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture but doesn''t particularly say "silence" to me.</td>', 'Beautiful picture but doesn''t particularly say "silence" to me.', '2004-03-04 10:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(609183, 63125, 15407, '<td valign="top">I worked at ''The Geysers'' in California and suffered a hearing loss (silence) because of the LOUD roar they sometimes produced. I don''t think that this Geyser would have ever produced the Same ROAR! Compelling composure, Wondering now if it was a roaring wind or blast that came through the scene in times past that produced the snags?</td>', 'I worked at ''The Geysers'' in California and suffered a hearing loss (silence) because of the LOUD roar they sometimes produced. I don''t think that this Geyser would have ever produced the Same ROAR! Compelling composure, Wondering now if it was a roaring wind or blast that came through the scene in times past that produced the snags?', '2004-03-04 10:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(609184, 62683, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of adding explanations in titles, in all honesty... let the photo speak for itself :)</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of adding explanations in titles, in all honesty... let the photo speak for itself :)', '2004-03-04 10:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(609185, 62854, 16402, '<td valign="top">Wish window light were not so blown out but I know all us photographers often have to work with the exposure range we have before us.</td>', 'Wish window light were not so blown out but I know all us photographers often have to work with the exposure range we have before us.', '2004-03-04 10:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(609186, 62594, 15407, '<td valign="top">AH but I imagine hearing the wave''s (well ripples) laping at the hull.  I do like the way the colors jump out through the fog!  Well done.</td>', 'AH but I imagine hearing the wave''s (well ripples) laping at the hull.  I do like the way the colors jump out through the fog!  Well done.', '2004-03-04 10:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(609187, 62683, 15934, '<td valign="top">I liked the photo, but think it is a bad idea to give instructions in the title.</td>', 'I liked the photo, but think it is a bad idea to give instructions in the title.', '2004-03-04 10:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(609188, 62893, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the tones in this shot and I like the pose.  I think it would have been better without the sunglasses, however.</td>', 'I like the tones in this shot and I like the pose.  I think it would have been better without the sunglasses, however.', '2004-03-04 10:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(609190, 62830, 15407, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet its not when whatever uses those tracks comes smokin'' down the line.</td>', 'I''ll bet its not when whatever uses those tracks comes smokin'' down the line.', '2004-03-04 11:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(609191, 62477, 14986, '<td valign="top">Would be interested in knowing how you did this shot.  Cool effect.</td>', 'Would be interested in knowing how you did this shot.  Cool effect.', '2004-03-04 11:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(609192, 63113, 15407, '<td valign="top">Make me hear "CRACK" really loud on tghe other hand it doesn''t make for much ''music''<br/></td>', 'Make me hear "CRACK" really loud on tghe other hand it doesn''t make for much ''music''', '2004-03-04 11:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(609193, 62260, 15407, '<td valign="top">but it makes for a nice sounding drum...  the lighting on the body is a bit too harsh.</td>', 'but it makes for a nice sounding drum...  the lighting on the body is a bit too harsh.', '2004-03-04 11:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
