(609197, 63068, 15407, '<td valign="top">just wait untill they land on you window sill when you''re trying to sleep!</td>', 'just wait untill they land on you window sill when you''re trying to sleep!', '2004-03-04 11:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(609198, 62580, 15919, '<td valign="top">This is a very comic and good image.  Gives you some rare feeling of the atmosphere.  Also its sharp and the exposure and contrast seems to be absolutely right.  It might be interesting to try to make look more grainy and make some scratches to make it look old.</td>', 'This is a very comic and good image.  Gives you some rare feeling of the atmosphere.  Also its sharp and the exposure and contrast seems to be absolutely right.  It might be interesting to try to make look more grainy and make some scratches to make it look old.', '2004-03-04 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
