(609339, 62425, 16095, '<td valign="top">this isn''t dramatic enough...the lighting is making your nice composition seem dull</td>', 'this isn''t dramatic enough...the lighting is making your nice composition seem dull', '2004-03-04 12:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(609340, 63095, 16095, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful image, but wouldn''t convey silence without title</td>', 'this is a beautiful image, but wouldn''t convey silence without title', '2004-03-04 12:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(609341, 62292, 16095, '<td valign="top">not sure where silence comes into play, picture seems a little too bright</td>', 'not sure where silence comes into play, picture seems a little too bright', '2004-03-04 12:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(609342, 62684, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus/lighting and thoughtful pose. Would like to see what model is actually doing off frame. Arm cropped off at wrist now makes hand look like an undiscernable flesh-colored chin support. Needs t more arm so viewer''s mind can complete the mental picture puzzle. Background kinda distracts rather than helps, wood floor doesn''t lend enough contrast to bring out shape of hand. Good potential, keep it up!  :)</td>', 'Nice soft focus/lighting and thoughtful pose. Would like to see what model is actually doing off frame. Arm cropped off at wrist now makes hand look like an undiscernable flesh-colored chin support. Needs t more arm so viewer''s mind can complete the mental picture puzzle. Background kinda distracts rather than helps, wood floor doesn''t lend enough contrast to bring out shape of hand. Good potential, keep it up!  :)', '2004-03-04 12:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(609343, 62336, 15407, '<td valign="top">It looks as if the tight crop on the top of the barn may have been necessary to maintain the ''tone'' of the picture which distracts some for me.<br/></td>', 'It looks as if the tight crop on the top of the barn may have been necessary to maintain the ''tone'' of the picture which distracts some for me.', '2004-03-04 12:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
