(609346, 62361, 17926, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition.  Photo is very sharp, great DOF, I like how even the thinner "capillary" type branches are still clearly visible.  The fog gives a perfect soft lighting effect to the entire photo, it gives a sense of center with the whiter areas while it gradually darkens shaping a type of "frame" towards the edges.</td>', 'Awesome composition.  Photo is very sharp, great DOF, I like how even the thinner "capillary" type branches are still clearly visible.  The fog gives a perfect soft lighting effect to the entire photo, it gives a sense of center with the whiter areas while it gradually darkens shaping a type of "frame" towards the edges.', '2004-03-04 12:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(609349, 62949, 17228, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  You''d better hope your photo doesn''t take top honors, or she might accidentally see it proudly displayed on the dpchallenge homepage!!!  ;)</td>', 'Ouch!  You''d better hope your photo doesn''t take top honors, or she might accidentally see it proudly displayed on the dpchallenge homepage!!!  ;)', '2004-03-04 12:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(609350, 62948, 16095, '<td valign="top">this is a cute idea, the photo lacks technical quality.  Flash makes image cold, when it really is warm and cozy...use a flood,sun or flashlight, it makes for a more diffused glow</td>', 'this is a cute idea, the photo lacks technical quality.  Flash makes image cold, when it really is warm and cozy...use a flood,sun or flashlight, it makes for a more diffused glow', '2004-03-04 12:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
