(609354, 62927, 17926, '<td valign="top">I love the lines of this photo.  And the small range of color''s adds a painting type feel to a very sharp pictured; From the blacks, to blues, to grays and whites.  Well done.</td>', 'I love the lines of this photo.  And the small range of color''s adds a painting type feel to a very sharp pictured; From the blacks, to blues, to grays and whites.  Well done.', '2004-03-04 12:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
