(609358, 62854, 15407, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the R\roof of the main portion of the Hut  is interesting as I would expect to see more of the scene illuminated from what appears to be a bright light on a pole rather than the Moon... although it may just be the way it sneaks through.  Its too bad that the light coming from the back of the Hut is so intense.  Is that the mountainside behind the trees or the night sky?</td>', 'The lighting on the R\roof of the main portion of the Hut  is interesting as I would expect to see more of the scene illuminated from what appears to be a bright light on a pole rather than the Moon... although it may just be the way it sneaks through.  Its too bad that the light coming from the back of the Hut is so intense.  Is that the mountainside behind the trees or the night sky?', '2004-03-04 12:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(609362, 62535, 16095, '<td valign="top">this photo has quality problems, the idea is to make technically good images that convey silence..not sure if photo would convey silence w/o title</td>', 'this photo has quality problems, the idea is to make technically good images that convey silence..not sure if photo would convey silence w/o title', '2004-03-04 12:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
