(609391, 63127, 16095, '<td valign="top">cute idea, but flash will ruin a photo every time. The idea is too make a technically good image as well as meet challenge criteria.  Next time try a flood lamp,lamp w/o lampshade or natural sunlight, you will find your images look 110% better than w/ a flash</td>', 'cute idea, but flash will ruin a photo every time. The idea is too make a technically good image as well as meet challenge criteria.  Next time try a flood lamp,lamp w/o lampshade or natural sunlight, you will find your images look 110% better than w/ a flash', '2004-03-04 13:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
