(609787, 62654, 17055, '<td valign="top">Love the positioning of the bear. Gives you the feel he has just looked at the viewer directly. Nice honey colors.</td>', 'Love the positioning of the bear. Gives you the feel he has just looked at the viewer directly. Nice honey colors.', '2004-03-04 17:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
