(609802, 62691, 10746, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell what this is.</td>', 'Can''t tell what this is.', '2004-03-04 17:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(609814, 62535, 17296, '<td valign="top">I realize it''s hard to light someone who''s asleep, but I think the lighting in this photo makes it a little flat. I also think the noise is distracting. Perhaps if your camera produces lesser quality images in dark environments you should make the final image smaller... just a suggestion. But not too small to really see the subject.</td>', 'I realize it''s hard to light someone who''s asleep, but I think the lighting in this photo makes it a little flat. I also think the noise is distracting. Perhaps if your camera produces lesser quality images in dark environments you should make the final image smaller... just a suggestion. But not too small to really see the subject.', '2004-03-04 18:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(609816, 62959, 17296, '<td valign="top">This photo is cute, but maybe a little over sharpened? Very cute though.</td>', 'This photo is cute, but maybe a little over sharpened? Very cute though.', '2004-03-04 18:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
