(609828, 63121, 17296, '<td valign="top">I think this is great. Although the picture really says "soft" or "fluffy" to me more than "silence" I scored it highly.</td>', 'I think this is great. Although the picture really says "soft" or "fluffy" to me more than "silence" I scored it highly.', '2004-03-04 18:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(609831, 62842, 17296, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. A little gruesome... I think the darkness of the eyes adds to the feel of the photo. Good job.</td>', 'Nice photo. A little gruesome... I think the darkness of the eyes adds to the feel of the photo. Good job.', '2004-03-04 18:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(609842, 62516, 15242, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I''d have maybe cropped out the light on the left.</td>', 'Great shot.  I''d have maybe cropped out the light on the left.', '2004-03-04 18:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(609844, 62976, 17296, '<td valign="top">Really cool composition, but I didn''t score it high because it doesn''t say "silence" to me. Sea Gulls are loud when they''re fighting for food and you''re obviously in a motor boat...nice shot though...</td>', 'Really cool composition, but I didn''t score it high because it doesn''t say "silence" to me. Sea Gulls are loud when they''re fighting for food and you''re obviously in a motor boat...nice shot though...', '2004-03-04 18:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(609845, 63108, 15242, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I like the coloring.  It truly says silence</td>', 'Great shot! I like the coloring.  It truly says silence', '2004-03-04 18:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(609846, 62292, 17296, '<td valign="top">I do not get this photo. I''m not sure how it fits into "silence". Perhaps I am missing a deeper meaning. I''m also not fond of the composition.</td>', 'I do not get this photo. I''m not sure how it fits into "silence". Perhaps I am missing a deeper meaning. I''m also not fond of the composition.', '2004-03-04 18:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(609848, 62956, 10124, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot. I like how it''s kinda grainy. Attractive girl, silent expression. Very nice. Although, that green color cast is horrible. Fix that up and this would be a great shot. I actually took the liberty of doing this and it looks much better. PM me and I can email it to you if you want.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot. I like how it''s kinda grainy. Attractive girl, silent expression. Very nice. Although, that green color cast is horrible. Fix that up and this would be a great shot. I actually took the liberty of doing this and it looks much better. PM me and I can email it to you if you want.', '2004-03-04 18:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(609849, 62958, 509, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and texture.  The right angles and positioning are interesting as well.  Although it doesn''t "speak" silence to me, this is still a good photo.</td>', 'Great lighting and texture.  The right angles and positioning are interesting as well.  Although it doesn''t "speak" silence to me, this is still a good photo.', '2004-03-04 18:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(609850, 62328, 509, '<td valign="top">Less lighting on the background of the needle might give this more impact, though the shallow depth of field is a decent alternative.  Nice work</td>', 'Less lighting on the background of the needle might give this more impact, though the shallow depth of field is a decent alternative.  Nice work', '2004-03-04 18:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(609851, 62544, 15242, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I like the B&amp;W.</td>', 'Nice shot, I like the B&W.', '2004-03-04 18:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(609852, 62994, 17296, '<td valign="top">Ok, gruesome. Because of the altered color it doesn''t look like a Basic Editing submission, although I''m sure it qualifies. I don''t mind this photo''s gruesomeness, but the neck injury could stand to look more realistic and the blood looks like finger paint to me.</td>', 'Ok, gruesome. Because of the altered color it doesn''t look like a Basic Editing submission, although I''m sure it qualifies. I don''t mind this photo''s gruesomeness, but the neck injury could stand to look more realistic and the blood looks like finger paint to me.', '2004-03-04 18:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(609853, 62443, 17296, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of the color of this photograph and the noise in the dark areas is unattractive.</td>', 'I''m not fond of the color of this photograph and the noise in the dark areas is unattractive.', '2004-03-04 18:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(609855, 62999, 17296, '<td valign="top">The glass in the foreground is out of focus and the background appears to be in focus. Is this photo to represent a poison of some type?</td>', 'The glass in the foreground is out of focus and the background appears to be in focus. Is this photo to represent a poison of some type?', '2004-03-04 18:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(609856, 62948, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this has more value to you, the photographer, but I wouldn''t expect it to do too well here.  More even lighting might help to take away the shadowing on the left wall.  Rotating the image a little clockwise would also better frame the shot.  Overall this appears to me like a snapshot, which isn''t necessarily negative, but isn''t all that interesting to an audience.</td>', 'I''m sure this has more value to you, the photographer, but I wouldn''t expect it to do too well here.  More even lighting might help to take away the shadowing on the left wall.  Rotating the image a little clockwise would also better frame the shot.  Overall this appears to me like a snapshot, which isn''t necessarily negative, but isn''t all that interesting to an audience.', '2004-03-04 18:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(609857, 62954, 17296, '<td valign="top">There would be nothing quiet about my death if I found myself caught up in this barbed wire! I think the photo could use more of a tonal range.</td>', 'There would be nothing quiet about my death if I found myself caught up in this barbed wire! I think the photo could use more of a tonal range.', '2004-03-04 18:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
