(609892, 62305, 17890, '<td valign="top">good</td>', 'good', '2004-03-04 19:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(609902, 62337, 5792, '<td valign="top">Elementary my dear Watson...<br/> <br/>This hue of blue sky over a Eucalyptus tree photographed in February obviously indicates this crime could only have been committed at non-other than Boyce Arboretum near Superior, Arizona by an outsider from a city like San Diego.<br/> <br/>The photographer would have to come from a place where Eucalyptus is commonplace. He would not expect to find this unusual flora in Arizona. Therefore he would take a picture of it.<br/> <br/>The perpetrator is a lone, male photographer aged 45-70. This is indicated because there is no one else pictured in the frame and only middle-aged and older men take pictures of tall trees.<br/> <br/>Fess up! You did it, didn''t you?<br/> <br/>Sherlock  (Besides, I think I have photographed that exact tree)</td>', 'Elementary my dear Watson... This hue of blue sky over a Eucalyptus tree photographed in February obviously indicates this crime could only have been committed at non-other than Boyce Arboretum near Superior, Arizona by an outsider from a city like San Diego. The photographer would have to come from a place where Eucalyptus is commonplace. He would not expect to find this unusual flora in Arizona. Therefore he would take a picture of it. The perpetrator is a lone, male photographer aged 45-70. This is indicated because there is no one else pictured in the frame and only middle-aged and older men take pictures of tall trees. Fess up! You did it, didn''t you? Sherlock  (Besides, I think I have photographed that exact tree)', '2004-03-04 19:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
