(610620, 62503, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good perspective but the sun is not very convincing.  Maybe its a litle to contrasted.  Think the whitebalance is also a litle to cool.  Would have liked to see litle more red and orange insted of blue and purple.</td>', 'Good perspective but the sun is not very convincing.  Maybe its a litle to contrasted.  Think the whitebalance is also a litle to cool.  Would have liked to see litle more red and orange insted of blue and purple.', '2004-03-05 08:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(610622, 62986, 15919, '<td valign="top">Colors of the flower shines well throug and you are getting the texture of the trees.  Think maybe litle more colorsaturation and maybe more contrast could make this image better.</td>', 'Colors of the flower shines well throug and you are getting the texture of the trees.  Think maybe litle more colorsaturation and maybe more contrast could make this image better.', '2004-03-05 08:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(610623, 63096, 6624, '<td valign="top">nicely done but not of great interest</td>', 'nicely done but not of great interest', '2004-03-05 08:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(610626, 62344, 6624, '<td valign="top">actually sheep are pretty noisy, fun shot, too bad the crop at the top of the head is  so severe and although the backlit effect is fun it is a little too much</td>', 'actually sheep are pretty noisy, fun shot, too bad the crop at the top of the head is  so severe and although the backlit effect is fun it is a little too much', '2004-03-05 08:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(610628, 62386, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice angle for the shot but it feels oddly boxed in for me</td>', 'nice angle for the shot but it feels oddly boxed in for me', '2004-03-05 08:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(610629, 62958, 6624, '<td valign="top">wonderful textures and colors (especially the green of the window blinds and the yellow of the frame)  there is too much dark shadow for me</td>', 'wonderful textures and colors (especially the green of the window blinds and the yellow of the frame)  there is too much dark shadow for me', '2004-03-05 08:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(610630, 62667, 6624, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting but doesn''t quite work for me - I wonder if a crop at the bottom to emphasize the "endlessness"  would have made it stronger</td>', 'This is very interesting but doesn''t quite work for me - I wonder if a crop at the bottom to emphasize the "endlessness"  would have made it stronger', '2004-03-05 08:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(610631, 62879, 6624, '<td valign="top">very nice - for me it would have worked more if the very dark trunks on the left were echoed by the fence/guardrail at the right having a little more substance/dark themselves, it feels a bit unbalanced</td>', 'very nice - for me it would have worked more if the very dark trunks on the left were echoed by the fence/guardrail at the right having a little more substance/dark themselves, it feels a bit unbalanced', '2004-03-05 08:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(610633, 62838, 6624, '<td valign="top">What fun to catch it at that moment, it is the moment when it makes fish noises though...</td>', 'What fun to catch it at that moment, it is the moment when it makes fish noises though...', '2004-03-05 08:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(610634, 63125, 6624, '<td valign="top">very nice, a little soft for me overall</td>', 'very nice, a little soft for me overall', '2004-03-05 08:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(610635, 62365, 6624, '<td valign="top">lovely sofgt focus, certainly meets challenge, I wonder if she really sleeps with the lipstick on?</td>', 'lovely sofgt focus, certainly meets challenge, I wonder if she really sleeps with the lipstick on?', '2004-03-05 08:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(610636, 62580, 6624, '<td valign="top">wonderful clarity and detail, lots to find in this image and it certainly meets the challenge</td>', 'wonderful clarity and detail, lots to find in this image and it certainly meets the challenge', '2004-03-05 08:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(610638, 62484, 6624, '<td valign="top">well placed image, good tear stains, the light at the top is a bit bothersome, and for me, it is the antithesis of silence because you are capturing an inner turmoil and silece implies some measure of peace</td>', 'well placed image, good tear stains, the light at the top is a bit bothersome, and for me, it is the antithesis of silence because you are capturing an inner turmoil and silece implies some measure of peace', '2004-03-05 08:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(610639, 62425, 6624, '<td valign="top">the skin tones are nice and it meets the challenge, especially nice detail of the lips</td>', 'the skin tones are nice and it meets the challenge, especially nice detail of the lips', '2004-03-05 08:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(610640, 62862, 6624, '<td valign="top">amusing and pleasant, meets the challenge</td>', 'amusing and pleasant, meets the challenge', '2004-03-05 08:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(610641, 62684, 6624, '<td valign="top">pleadsant, the quiet lighting is nice, for me the "juxtaposition" of the floorboards and the face is startling -and it detracts from the lovely profile quite a bit</td>', 'pleadsant, the quiet lighting is nice, for me the "juxtaposition" of the floorboards and the face is startling -and it detracts from the lovely profile quite a bit', '2004-03-05 08:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(610674, 62934, 17228, '<td valign="top">Looks like hand is ghosted image due to movement/slow shutter speed. Good idea with edge lighting around head for separation from background, although it''s been blown out into total white. Liked that one eye is hidden from view.  Keep it up.  :)</td>', 'Looks like hand is ghosted image due to movement/slow shutter speed. Good idea with edge lighting around head for separation from background, although it''s been blown out into total white. Liked that one eye is hidden from view.  Keep it up.  :)', '2004-03-05 10:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(610678, 62530, 17228, '<td valign="top">RUN FORREST! I mean....running deer IN the forest!!!!  Nicely composed action shot! Since it''s a break in the silence, I''ll assume it''s no longer silent, which unfortunately is the theme of this challenge, so this photo doesn''t really work in that regard. Works in so many other ways though.  :)</td>', 'RUN FORREST! I mean....running deer IN the forest!!!!  Nicely composed action shot! Since it''s a break in the silence, I''ll assume it''s no longer silent, which unfortunately is the theme of this challenge, so this photo doesn''t really work in that regard. Works in so many other ways though.  :)', '2004-03-05 10:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(610681, 62784, 17228, '<td valign="top">Really like how you composed pic with mountain peak converging in center frame. Too bad there wasn''t a lone tree standing by itself at the top with less distracting trees throughout. Large tree on left seems to take some of the focus away from the peak. Good idea, but your models weren''t willing.  ;)</td>', 'Really like how you composed pic with mountain peak converging in center frame. Too bad there wasn''t a lone tree standing by itself at the top with less distracting trees throughout. Large tree on left seems to take some of the focus away from the peak. Good idea, but your models weren''t willing.  ;)', '2004-03-05 10:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(610683, 62245, 17442, '<td valign="top">I really like the imagery this evokes, but it needs more contrast.  The background is so dark it takes away from, rather than lending to, the image.</td>', 'I really like the imagery this evokes, but it needs more contrast.  The background is so dark it takes away from, rather than lending to, the image.', '2004-03-05 10:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(610685, 63036, 17442, '<td valign="top">It would be interesting to see if the same image feels different when the trees are in bloom.</td>', 'It would be interesting to see if the same image feels different when the trees are in bloom.', '2004-03-05 10:44:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(610686, 62427, 17442, '<td valign="top">I think a different angle would be more interesting.  One where the pillar is not so omnipresent.</td>', 'I think a different angle would be more interesting.  One where the pillar is not so omnipresent.', '2004-03-05 10:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(610687, 62694, 17442, '<td valign="top">The image is to dark.</td>', 'The image is to dark.', '2004-03-05 10:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(610692, 62691, 10943, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is an interesting photograph, but I don''t see how it directly relates to the challenge.</td>', 'Ok, this is an interesting photograph, but I don''t see how it directly relates to the challenge.', '2004-03-05 11:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(610696, 63121, 17442, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, to much white space.</td>', 'Interesting image, to much white space.', '2004-03-05 11:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(610700, 62253, 10943, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo!  Somehow this doesn''t speak silence to me, though...there is an element of silence perhaps, but it doesn''t convey the concept of silence.  Still, nice work.  6</td>', 'Excellent photo!  Somehow this doesn''t speak silence to me, though...there is an element of silence perhaps, but it doesn''t convey the concept of silence.  Still, nice work.  6', '2004-03-05 11:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(610701, 62425, 10943, '<td valign="top">Ok, this is silence, but not terribly original.  Still, good focus and color.  6</td>', 'Ok, this is silence, but not terribly original.  Still, good focus and color.  6', '2004-03-05 11:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(610702, 62487, 10943, '<td valign="top">Nice work</td>', 'Nice work', '2004-03-05 11:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(610704, 62237, 18098, '<td valign="top">Good Hue, cute wet nose, if only he could talk!  Interesting photo, dogs and animals are always so candid and fun!!</td>', 'Good Hue, cute wet nose, if only he could talk!  Interesting photo, dogs and animals are always so candid and fun!!', '2004-03-05 11:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(610706, 63077, 10943, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a cool pic.  Nice idea.  It''s a fresh change from most of the mundane "same old, same old" pics for this challenge.  7 for something new.</td>', 'Now that''s a cool pic.  Nice idea.  It''s a fresh change from most of the mundane "same old, same old" pics for this challenge.  7 for something new.', '2004-03-05 11:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(610709, 62842, 10943, '<td valign="top">That''s rather profound, but it gives me the creeps.</td>', 'That''s rather profound, but it gives me the creeps.', '2004-03-05 11:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(610710, 63033, 17148, '<td valign="top">Very simple pictue, but sometimes that''s all you need. I thnk this piture is perfect for the challenge. 7</td>', 'Very simple pictue, but sometimes that''s all you need. I thnk this piture is perfect for the challenge. 7', '2004-03-05 11:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(610711, 62586, 17228, '<td valign="top">One can only wonder how very cool this pic would have been if a brilliant blue sky with clouds was perfectly reflected in the water, making the duck look as though it were bathing in the heavens.  :)<br/>Not sure if a floating duck immediately translates "silence" for me. Distracting rock at upper right could have been cropped out. A polorizing filter (but who has one of those, right?)  might have helped water from looking lifeless and washed out. Would be interesting to blowout water to total white with some photo editing and print to see what a duck looks like floating on textured paper. Keep pluggin'' away.</td>', 'One can only wonder how very cool this pic would have been if a brilliant blue sky with clouds was perfectly reflected in the water, making the duck look as though it were bathing in the heavens.  :)Not sure if a floating duck immediately translates "silence" for me. Distracting rock at upper right could have been cropped out. A polorizing filter (but who has one of those, right?)  might have helped water from looking lifeless and washed out. Would be interesting to blowout water to total white with some photo editing and print to see what a duck looks like floating on textured paper. Keep pluggin'' away.', '2004-03-05 11:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(610714, 62477, 17148, '<td valign="top">Incredible, very time consuming I''m sure. 9</td>', 'Incredible, very time consuming I''m sure. 9', '2004-03-05 11:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(610718, 63104, 17228, '<td valign="top">A good textured abstract. Doesn''t quite say "silence" for me, athough I appreciate the effort to capture something less generic than most others.  :)  Add some colors gradations and filters in photoshop could make for a very cool artsy piece indeed.</td>', 'A good textured abstract. Doesn''t quite say "silence" for me, athough I appreciate the effort to capture something less generic than most others.  :)  Add some colors gradations and filters in photoshop could make for a very cool artsy piece indeed.', '2004-03-05 11:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(610719, 62976, 17148, '<td valign="top">For some reason I don''t think when you took this shot it was silent at all, those birds must have been squwaking like crazy, other than that the photo is excelent, don''t think it fits this catigory, maybe should have entered it in the free March study. 5</td>', 'For some reason I don''t think when you took this shot it was silent at all, those birds must have been squwaking like crazy, other than that the photo is excelent, don''t think it fits this catigory, maybe should have entered it in the free March study. 5', '2004-03-05 11:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(610720, 62691, 17148, '<td valign="top">Creepy</td>', 'Creepy', '2004-03-05 11:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(610723, 62813, 17148, '<td valign="top">That''s funny</td>', 'That''s funny', '2004-03-05 11:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(610724, 62326, 16126, '<td valign="top">The impression you create is very nice. Could have improved by slight rotation CW.</td>', 'The impression you create is very nice. Could have improved by slight rotation CW.', '2004-03-05 11:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(610725, 62902, 17148, '<td valign="top">I would have like to see more of the person, was there no more room to move the camera back, other than that good pic. 6</td>', 'I would have like to see more of the person, was there no more room to move the camera back, other than that good pic. 6', '2004-03-05 11:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(610726, 62245, 17148, '<td valign="top">Very strong</td>', 'Very strong', '2004-03-05 11:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(610727, 62260, 17148, '<td valign="top">No strings huh? 6</td>', 'No strings huh? 6', '2004-03-05 11:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(610728, 63064, 16126, '<td valign="top">Focus is slightly off, the hut seems out of focus. Larger DOF maybe? Colors are great, and a good composition.</td>', 'Focus is slightly off, the hut seems out of focus. Larger DOF maybe? Colors are great, and a good composition.', '2004-03-05 11:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(610729, 62250, 15919, '<td valign="top">It may be comic but I dont find it to capture the atmosphere of silence</td>', 'It may be comic but I dont find it to capture the atmosphere of silence', '2004-03-05 11:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(610731, 62684, 16106, '<td valign="top">I like  the subject , but the  backround hurts the photo. The strong diagonal where the baseboard meets the floor seems to shoot out of her head and creates a dynamic that is at odds with the quiet composure of the reader. While I like the tight crop, and belive that I know she is happily reading, if you don''t show the book some people will wonder what she is looking at. A polarizing filter would have taken care of the glare off the floor that almost brings the floor color to flesh tone and makes her profile hard to read. Never the less you caught a lovely picture of quiet contentment, one the model will want in future years.</td>', 'I like  the subject , but the  backround hurts the photo. The strong diagonal where the baseboard meets the floor seems to shoot out of her head and creates a dynamic that is at odds with the quiet composure of the reader. While I like the tight crop, and belive that I know she is happily reading, if you don''t show the book some people will wonder what she is looking at. A polarizing filter would have taken care of the glare off the floor that almost brings the floor color to flesh tone and makes her profile hard to read. Never the less you caught a lovely picture of quiet contentment, one the model will want in future years.', '2004-03-05 11:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(610733, 62712, 17148, '<td valign="top">I don''t know, seems like a good idea but something just doesn''t work with it, no offence but it looks like you through this together in just under a min. Maybe a zoom in on the hand and leave everything else a bit blurred. 5</td>', 'I don''t know, seems like a good idea but something just doesn''t work with it, no offence but it looks like you through this together in just under a min. Maybe a zoom in on the hand and leave everything else a bit blurred. 5', '2004-03-05 11:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(610734, 62722, 9941, '<td valign="top">Interesting...one of the best "sleeping" shots in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting...one of the best "sleeping" shots in the challenge.', '2004-03-05 11:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(610736, 62847, 16126, '<td valign="top">The dark edge on the top slightly distracts from the power of the image. Boat off-center may have improved the composition. 7</td>', 'The dark edge on the top slightly distracts from the power of the image. Boat off-center may have improved the composition. 7', '2004-03-05 11:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(610737, 63090, 15919, '<td valign="top">Its seem a litle grainy but that dont have to be distracing when trying to capture some atmosphere.  On the other hand the lines (power lines?) are distracting and one of the thing that I think most photographer should try to avoid when taking pictures in the nature.  Also I find the border to thick.  Borders can make good images better but one has to be carful with them.</td>', 'Its seem a litle grainy but that dont have to be distracing when trying to capture some atmosphere.  On the other hand the lines (power lines?) are distracting and one of the thing that I think most photographer should try to avoid when taking pictures in the nature.  Also I find the border to thick.  Borders can make good images better but one has to be carful with them.', '2004-03-05 11:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(610738, 63062, 17148, '<td valign="top">Creative, but it looks a but fuzzy or out of focus. 5</td>', 'Creative, but it looks a but fuzzy or out of focus. 5', '2004-03-05 11:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(610740, 62478, 15919, '<td valign="top">I think that you´ve been trying to ad to much brightness into this image to make the forground visible but the lower sky gets unnatural.  Maybe you should have tryed to use some fill in flash.</td>', 'I think that you´ve been trying to ad to much brightness into this image to make the forground visible but the lower sky gets unnatural.  Maybe you should have tryed to use some fill in flash.', '2004-03-05 11:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(610741, 62211, 16126, '<td valign="top">The colors and the composition and the atmosphere are all great, but the power boat destroys the feeling of silence.</td>', 'The colors and the composition and the atmosphere are all great, but the power boat destroys the feeling of silence.', '2004-03-05 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(610742, 62852, 16106, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and the square crop does a nice job of renforcing the compactness of the sitter. The high lights off his head seem a bit blown out as if the backround with its varied and complex patterns and surfaces were your subject matter rather than the man. This peice almost work as a negative space study where what is in the center gives way to the surrounding area, but the balance between foreground and backround is too balanced, leaving my eye to run here and there rather than settling down to meditate on the form.</td>', 'I like the subject and the square crop does a nice job of renforcing the compactness of the sitter. The high lights off his head seem a bit blown out as if the backround with its varied and complex patterns and surfaces were your subject matter rather than the man. This peice almost work as a negative space study where what is in the center gives way to the surrounding area, but the balance between foreground and backround is too balanced, leaving my eye to run here and there rather than settling down to meditate on the form.', '2004-03-05 11:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(610744, 63085, 17228, '<td valign="top">Would love to have seen a closeup photo of this pin dropping/splashing in a spoon full of tomato soup just as it''s about to be eaten by a handlebar moustached restaurant patron! Nice lighting streaming across photo. Shiny metal objects (pins) only pic up lighting/color from their surroundings, large white reflector would have helped bring out silver color of pin. Pin is black otherwise. Blur at tip shows good action, good choice of shutter speed.</td>', 'Would love to have seen a closeup photo of this pin dropping/splashing in a spoon full of tomato soup just as it''s about to be eaten by a handlebar moustached restaurant patron! Nice lighting streaming across photo. Shiny metal objects (pins) only pic up lighting/color from their surroundings, large white reflector would have helped bring out silver color of pin. Pin is black otherwise. Blur at tip shows good action, good choice of shutter speed.', '2004-03-05 11:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(610746, 62365, 16106, '<td valign="top">Im sure you will get the comment that you took away too much contract or blew out the details.They will be wrong. You caught the moment of waking up next to someone you love very very well. The lipstick smile ( a bit too perfect for mornig, but it looks good) and the ring balance nicely and high keying catches the mood of mornig wake up perfectly. Nice job</td>', 'Im sure you will get the comment that you took away too much contract or blew out the details.They will be wrong. You caught the moment of waking up next to someone you love very very well. The lipstick smile ( a bit too perfect for mornig, but it looks good) and the ring balance nicely and high keying catches the mood of mornig wake up perfectly. Nice job', '2004-03-05 11:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(610747, 62546, 6624, '<td valign="top">an interesting angle but too little image for this viewer</td>', 'an interesting angle but too little image for this viewer', '2004-03-05 11:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(610748, 62645, 6624, '<td valign="top">a lot of grain/noise that is a real distraction</td>', 'a lot of grain/noise that is a real distraction', '2004-03-05 11:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(610749, 62329, 17228, '<td valign="top">This reminds me about that medical exam I''ve been putting off for months now.  ;)</td>', 'This reminds me about that medical exam I''ve been putting off for months now.  ;)', '2004-03-05 11:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(610750, 62308, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice effect, colors are a little unreal</td>', 'nice effect, colors are a little unreal', '2004-03-05 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(610753, 63091, 6624, '<td valign="top">very lacking in focus for this viewer</td>', 'very lacking in focus for this viewer', '2004-03-05 11:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(610754, 62937, 6624, '<td valign="top">doesn''t really say a whole lot and the flash on the duck tape is unfortunate</td>', 'doesn''t really say a whole lot and the flash on the duck tape is unfortunate', '2004-03-05 11:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(610755, 62925, 13759, '<td valign="top">This is interesting but don´t say silence to me without many words.</td>', 'This is interesting but don´t say silence to me without many words.', '2004-03-05 11:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(610757, 62799, 16106, '<td valign="top">A lot of ideas were repeated over and over in this challenge. I have been seeing a cabin in the woods, a cabin in the snow, a house in the night, ect. This however is well enough done that it becomes THE cabin in the woods. It sings a common song so well that it makes the song it''s own. The use of red foreground light to balance out the blue of the night sky , and the blown out lamp repeated in the blown out moon, create a still balance that make this a special shot.</td>', 'A lot of ideas were repeated over and over in this challenge. I have been seeing a cabin in the woods, a cabin in the snow, a house in the night, ect. This however is well enough done that it becomes THE cabin in the woods. It sings a common song so well that it makes the song it''s own. The use of red foreground light to balance out the blue of the night sky , and the blown out lamp repeated in the blown out moon, create a still balance that make this a special shot.', '2004-03-05 11:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(610758, 62970, 15407, '<td valign="top">I can hear the traffic behind you... or can I ?  The bay looks calm so not too much wind noise &amp; there is a peaceful calm about the picture.  It''s nearly monochromatic with ''Natures Black &amp; White filter. (well bluish).  I love that bay and the city by it... I think I can actually hear Otis Redding singing in the distance .... and that''s good!</td>', 'I can hear the traffic behind you... or can I ?  The bay looks calm so not too much wind noise & there is a peaceful calm about the picture.  It''s nearly monochromatic with ''Natures Black & White filter. (well bluish).  I love that bay and the city by it... I think I can actually hear Otis Redding singing in the distance .... and that''s good!', '2004-03-05 11:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(610759, 62394, 6624, '<td valign="top">this lacks a sense of direction/focus/statement for me</td>', 'this lacks a sense of direction/focus/statement for me', '2004-03-05 11:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(610760, 63028, 13759, '<td valign="top">The smile changes the rules of interpretation that the ambience gives.</td>', 'The smile changes the rules of interpretation that the ambience gives.', '2004-03-05 11:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(610763, 63040, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is very pretty and appealing, but I can hear the running water not silence</td>', 'this is very pretty and appealing, but I can hear the running water not silence', '2004-03-05 11:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(610764, 62997, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors. Tree/shrub on right looks oddly cropped off frame, would have liked to see more of it in frame or none of it at all. The only real distraction for my eye and sense of balance. Nice.  :)</td>', 'Nice composition and colors. Tree/shrub on right looks oddly cropped off frame, would have liked to see more of it in frame or none of it at all. The only real distraction for my eye and sense of balance. Nice.  :)', '2004-03-05 11:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(610765, 63044, 13759, '<td valign="top">Definitely this is not a silence representation.</td>', 'Definitely this is not a silence representation.', '2004-03-05 11:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(610766, 63093, 13759, '<td valign="top">But... and what to say about silence?</td>', 'But... and what to say about silence?', '2004-03-05 11:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
