(610769, 62477, 16106, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this shot really answers the challenge. I don''t know if this is really in a place that is quiet. I do know that you chose a dynamic POV and got great colors. This is my favorite shot of the challenge. I don''t know why.</td>', 'I don''t know if this shot really answers the challenge. I don''t know if this is really in a place that is quiet. I do know that you chose a dynamic POV and got great colors. This is my favorite shot of the challenge. I don''t know why.', '2004-03-05 11:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
