(610814, 62998, 6667, '<td valign="top">This photo is right on the mark with the theme.  The bowed head and her attention say it all.  My own personal taste though:  border should have been left off or done in black.  It has a greenish cast on my screen.  DOF might have been more shallow focusing on her and the grave site.   I immediately get the idea from what is in the foreground and don''t need the details of the background.  The very best of luck.   You got a high rating from me.<br/> <br/>I have returned to this shot three times looking for anything to give it even a higher rating. . . I''ve gone about as far as I can go with an 8.</td>', 'This photo is right on the mark with the theme.  The bowed head and her attention say it all.  My own personal taste though:  border should have been left off or done in black.  It has a greenish cast on my screen.  DOF might have been more shallow focusing on her and the grave site.   I immediately get the idea from what is in the foreground and don''t need the details of the background.  The very best of luck.   You got a high rating from me. I have returned to this shot three times looking for anything to give it even a higher rating. . . I''ve gone about as far as I can go with an 8.', '2004-03-05 12:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
