(610934, 62301, 9311, '<td valign="top">By far the best cemetary scene in the challenge, and a fine photo in its own right. Wonderful perspective, both horiz and vert, with the eye moving with pleasure to take in the whole scene.  I love the the simple, honest voice you use here.  Really well done.</td>', 'By far the best cemetary scene in the challenge, and a fine photo in its own right. Wonderful perspective, both horiz and vert, with the eye moving with pleasure to take in the whole scene.  I love the the simple, honest voice you use here.  Really well done.', '2004-03-05 14:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(610937, 62361, 9311, '<td valign="top">Lovely effect and lighting here. GREAT mist!  I like the idea a lot and I am a sucker for natural scenes, especially those with trees! :)<br/> <br/>While I consider this to be one of the best photos in the entire challenge, there are two things that bother me about it - perhaps they are valid for you, too - they are personal taste.<br/> <br/>First, the corn stub rows draw the eye away from the tree, which distracts a tad.  Second, I prefer a landscape orientaion for shots of this nature - I can''t get over the idea of something too close for comfort just out of sight - not enough feeling of space for a serene feeling.  But that''s just me.  Paranoid:D<br/> <br/>Anyway, really grand shot.</td>', 'Lovely effect and lighting here. GREAT mist!  I like the idea a lot and I am a sucker for natural scenes, especially those with trees! :) While I consider this to be one of the best photos in the entire challenge, there are two things that bother me about it - perhaps they are valid for you, too - they are personal taste. First, the corn stub rows draw the eye away from the tree, which distracts a tad.  Second, I prefer a landscape orientaion for shots of this nature - I can''t get over the idea of something too close for comfort just out of sight - not enough feeling of space for a serene feeling.  But that''s just me.  Paranoid:D Anyway, really grand shot.', '2004-03-05 14:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(610940, 62492, 3569, '<td valign="top">Bottoms up my friend.  Nice mallards.</td>', 'Bottoms up my friend.  Nice mallards.', '2004-03-05 15:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(610941, 62245, 9311, '<td valign="top">Powerful idea here, and a strong image.  Really good lighting.  Do you think there would be more impact to the scene if the soldier''s face was shown?  Strong score from me. :)</td>', 'Powerful idea here, and a strong image.  Really good lighting.  Do you think there would be more impact to the scene if the soldier''s face was shown?  Strong score from me. :)', '2004-03-05 15:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
