(610945, 62594, 9311, '<td valign="top">A lovely picture here, with a delicious contrast of colorful boat and gray water/fog.<br/> <br/>There is something about the geometry of the objects, the land, the margins - the "feng shui?-  which is not quite perfect to my jaundiced eye.  I want to move that buoy!  I''m sure it is just me, but I wanted to mention it, in case you felt it too.<br/> <br/>Very strong score with me. :)</td>', 'A lovely picture here, with a delicious contrast of colorful boat and gray water/fog. There is something about the geometry of the objects, the land, the margins - the "feng shui?-  which is not quite perfect to my jaundiced eye.  I want to move that buoy!  I''m sure it is just me, but I wanted to mention it, in case you felt it too. Very strong score with me. :)', '2004-03-05 15:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
