(610963, 62516, 9668, '<td valign="top">Right side of the picture is distracting. I like the lighting, tone and shadows.</td>', 'Right side of the picture is distracting. I like the lighting, tone and shadows.', '2004-03-05 15:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(610964, 62847, 9311, '<td valign="top">Lovely sunset silhouette which sure shows serenity and silence.  <br/> <br/>  I have two suggestions which may make the picture better. First, either crop off, or straighten the horizon on the top of the pictue.  (I would get rid of it - simpler is better?)<br/> <br/>Second, try different crops to see if one works out that frames the scene well , but which doesn''t have the ship in the exact center of the frame.  Off-center objects please the eye a lot more.  :)</td>', 'Lovely sunset silhouette which sure shows serenity and silence.     I have two suggestions which may make the picture better. First, either crop off, or straighten the horizon on the top of the pictue.  (I would get rid of it - simpler is better?) Second, try different crops to see if one works out that frames the scene well , but which doesn''t have the ship in the exact center of the frame.  Off-center objects please the eye a lot more.  :)', '2004-03-05 15:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(610965, 62813, 16777, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, but unfortunately to much of the photo is blown out.  Slightly less exposure would have been Ideal I think.</td>', 'Love the idea, but unfortunately to much of the photo is blown out.  Slightly less exposure would have been Ideal I think.', '2004-03-05 15:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(610967, 62580, 16777, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop might have given this image more impact.</td>', 'A tighter crop might have given this image more impact.', '2004-03-05 15:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(610968, 62900, 9311, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the sunset-serenity shot! This time in portait mode and B&amp;W!!  But it definately works, and scores well with me.  The branches look a tad oversharpened?  also, the sea level is not quite level, I think?</td>', 'An interesting take on the sunset-serenity shot! This time in portait mode and B&W!!  But it definately works, and scores well with me.  The branches look a tad oversharpened?  also, the sea level is not quite level, I think?', '2004-03-05 15:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(610970, 63073, 16777, '<td valign="top">The fence is a little distracting,</td>', 'The fence is a little distracting,', '2004-03-05 15:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(610972, 62662, 16777, '<td valign="top">Seems to lack contrast, with the sun shining directly into the lens like that.  Not to crazy about the partial frame either.</td>', 'Seems to lack contrast, with the sun shining directly into the lens like that.  Not to crazy about the partial frame either.', '2004-03-05 15:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(610973, 62726, 9311, '<td valign="top">I like this original idea of your a lot, and I think you executed it very well.  I have a too-dark monitor, so I''d bet some may say there are some blown high-lights, but that stuff doesn''t bother me too much.  I like your use of lighting here.  This scores well with me :)</td>', 'I like this original idea of your a lot, and I think you executed it very well.  I have a too-dark monitor, so I''d bet some may say there are some blown high-lights, but that stuff doesn''t bother me too much.  I like your use of lighting here.  This scores well with me :)', '2004-03-05 15:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(610974, 62909, 9311, '<td valign="top">A good take on the death scene.  I do hope Woody Allen is not a member here! ;D<br/> <br/>I like the touch with the monitor, and the stark honest nature of the shot as well.  Good job,,scores well.</td>', 'A good take on the death scene.  I do hope Woody Allen is not a member here! ;D I like the touch with the monitor, and the stark honest nature of the shot as well.  Good job,,scores well.', '2004-03-05 15:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(610977, 63080, 9311, '<td valign="top">Very well composed silhouette shot - a beauty.  My only complaint is the small size of the picture on the screen. Well done and scores very high with me :)</td>', 'Very well composed silhouette shot - a beauty.  My only complaint is the small size of the picture on the screen. Well done and scores very high with me :)', '2004-03-05 15:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(610980, 62958, 9311, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, creative interpretaion.  Love the lighting effect, and the cropping is very intriguing, indeed.  Thank you for a refreshingly different entry!  Scores very highly with me :)</td>', 'Very interesting, creative interpretaion.  Love the lighting effect, and the cropping is very intriguing, indeed.  Thank you for a refreshingly different entry!  Scores very highly with me :)', '2004-03-05 15:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(610981, 62949, 6504, '<td valign="top">For humour, this is the best of all!!   Now let''s hope SHE doesn''t see the remark!</td>', 'For humour, this is the best of all!!   Now let''s hope SHE doesn''t see the remark!', '2004-03-05 15:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(610983, 62693, 9311, '<td valign="top">Very creative take on the challenge; very "cool" title. :D<br/> <br/>This beautiful abstract scores highly with me. :)</td>', 'Very creative take on the challenge; very "cool" title. :D This beautiful abstract scores highly with me. :)', '2004-03-05 15:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(610986, 62248, 9668, '<td valign="top">Don''t get the meaning of this. The black block seems distracting. If the old newspapers are the subject, I would like to be closer. Perspective seems a bit odd as well. Interesting shot.</td>', 'Don''t get the meaning of this. The black block seems distracting. If the old newspapers are the subject, I would like to be closer. Perspective seems a bit odd as well. Interesting shot.', '2004-03-05 15:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(610995, 62777, 9311, '<td valign="top">I have used snowy orchards for challenges myself!  <br/> <br/>I love the way you have used B&amp;W, the starkness of the bark against the snow, and all the glorious gradations of gray, and the long perspective.<br/> <br/> <br/>I like this picture a lot, but I think it can be improved because it "leans" to the right, I think.  <br/> <br/>The eye goes down the row, then has nowhere to go but slip off the right margin because of the pressure from the mountain.  If the mountain were centered, or there was another object to carry the eye back to the mountain, the symmetry of the scene would be a bit better.<br/> <br/>A beautiful shot, nontheless.</td>', 'I have used snowy orchards for challenges myself!   I love the way you have used B&W, the starkness of the bark against the snow, and all the glorious gradations of gray, and the long perspective.  I like this picture a lot, but I think it can be improved because it "leans" to the right, I think.   The eye goes down the row, then has nowhere to go but slip off the right margin because of the pressure from the mountain.  If the mountain were centered, or there was another object to carry the eye back to the mountain, the symmetry of the scene would be a bit better. A beautiful shot, nontheless.', '2004-03-05 16:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(610996, 62563, 9311, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot and have scored it highly!  Definitely communicates, silence, desolation, lonliness, and is an awesome display of gradations of silhouette.  I like the crop and blue tint as well.  Great job here!</td>', 'I like this shot a lot and have scored it highly!  Definitely communicates, silence, desolation, lonliness, and is an awesome display of gradations of silhouette.  I like the crop and blue tint as well.  Great job here!', '2004-03-05 16:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(611017, 62360, 16777, '<td valign="top">IMO this would have been more interesting had the model been looking toward the camera.</td>', 'IMO this would have been more interesting had the model been looking toward the camera.', '2004-03-05 16:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(611019, 62328, 16777, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. I''m wondering if it will have to be explained to some on this sight.;)</td>', 'I love this shot. I''m wondering if it will have to be explained to some on this sight.;)', '2004-03-05 16:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(611025, 63105, 245, '<td valign="top">funny! i would have tried to pull the at away from the corner a bit (and the fingers from the edge) but otherwise it''s a very strong composition<br/></td>', 'funny! i would have tried to pull the at away from the corner a bit (and the fingers from the edge) but otherwise it''s a very strong composition', '2004-03-05 16:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(611026, 63010, 245, '<td valign="top">the composition feels a bit awkward to me, i think the flower might look a bit nicer about 5-10% down and the the right</td>', 'the composition feels a bit awkward to me, i think the flower might look a bit nicer about 5-10% down and the the right', '2004-03-05 16:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
