(611057, 62986, 16095, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea, I think it could use a little more drama and contrast. What about standing on the tire looking down thru the hole and chains(rope)-possibly black &amp; white. Conveys quite/stillness nicely.</td>', 'This is a nice idea, I think it could use a little more drama and contrast. What about standing on the tire looking down thru the hole and chains(rope)-possibly black & white. Conveys quite/stillness nicely.', '2004-03-05 17:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(611058, 62779, 16982, '<td valign="top">There is a satisfying feel to this picture.  Does sepia work here?</td>', 'There is a satisfying feel to this picture.  Does sepia work here?', '2004-03-05 17:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(611060, 62413, 16095, '<td valign="top">this looks like it would smell lovely and i think this is has a calming affect, but not sure if would be recognized as silence with or w/o title.</td>', 'this looks like it would smell lovely and i think this is has a calming affect, but not sure if would be recognized as silence with or w/o title.', '2004-03-05 17:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(611062, 63038, 16982, '<td valign="top">The water reflections are lovely.  The slight imperfection in the water underneath the swan''s beak is the only thing that made me mark you down slightly.</td>', 'The water reflections are lovely.  The slight imperfection in the water underneath the swan''s beak is the only thing that made me mark you down slightly.', '2004-03-05 17:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(611064, 63024, 16095, '<td valign="top">i really enjoy this idea, it is refreshing from index finger over lips shot, but the right circlular mass is obtrusive and competes with the facial expression. The heavy border pulls my eye out instead of inward.</td>', 'i really enjoy this idea, it is refreshing from index finger over lips shot, but the right circlular mass is obtrusive and competes with the facial expression. The heavy border pulls my eye out instead of inward.', '2004-03-05 17:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(611065, 62734, 16982, '<td valign="top">I love these long-exposure waterfall shots.  The border was a good choice, as was black and white.</td>', 'I love these long-exposure waterfall shots.  The border was a good choice, as was black and white.', '2004-03-05 17:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(611067, 62677, 10943, '<td valign="top">Make it a ten...very nice quality, expression and thought. :-)</td>', 'Make it a ten...very nice quality, expression and thought. :-)', '2004-03-05 17:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(611068, 63039, 15838, '<td valign="top">good lighting great angle</td>', 'good lighting great angle', '2004-03-05 17:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(611069, 62707, 16095, '<td valign="top">this is technically a good shot but colors are a little dull.  I think this same shot would be nice if he were laying on white paper or something to simplify your main idea which is the headphones unplugged</td>', 'this is technically a good shot but colors are a little dull.  I think this same shot would be nice if he were laying on white paper or something to simplify your main idea which is the headphones unplugged', '2004-03-05 17:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(611070, 62735, 15838, '<td valign="top">very good 8</td>', 'very good 8', '2004-03-05 17:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(611071, 62305, 16095, '<td valign="top">i like that you used the older style clock because everyone knows how the "rrriiinnngggg" of those is sooooo annoying. My only complaint would be the graininess of shot.</td>', 'i like that you used the older style clock because everyone knows how the "rrriiinnngggg" of those is sooooo annoying. My only complaint would be the graininess of shot.', '2004-03-05 17:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(611073, 62954, 16095, '<td valign="top">like the idea but image seems overexposed, like choice of black/white, border pulls my eye out instead of in toward image.</td>', 'like the idea but image seems overexposed, like choice of black/white, border pulls my eye out instead of in toward image.', '2004-03-05 17:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(611077, 62976, 16982, '<td valign="top">Wow, quite breathtaking!  I''m not sure that I feel this is "silent" but it''s an excellent shot and worth showing to everyone.</td>', 'Wow, quite breathtaking!  I''m not sure that I feel this is "silent" but it''s an excellent shot and worth showing to everyone.', '2004-03-05 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(611078, 62861, 16095, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the PM, forgot that those guys come out at night...the flash makes image mundane..the snail is interesting, it would be enhanced by good difused lighting.</td>', 'Thanks for the PM, forgot that those guys come out at night...the flash makes image mundane..the snail is interesting, it would be enhanced by good difused lighting.', '2004-03-05 17:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(611079, 62477, 16982, '<td valign="top">Surely - SURELY - you did not stack up all of those books just for the competition?  It''s certainly amazing, as well as dizzying.</td>', 'Surely - SURELY - you did not stack up all of those books just for the competition?  It''s certainly amazing, as well as dizzying.', '2004-03-05 17:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(611081, 63040, 16982, '<td valign="top">A good choice of subject for the challenge.  If there was such a place nearby, a photgraph including a more close-up view of the branches would have worked well.</td>', 'A good choice of subject for the challenge.  If there was such a place nearby, a photgraph including a more close-up view of the branches would have worked well.', '2004-03-05 17:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(611084, 62900, 16982, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beatiful.  Horizon seems a fraction off horizontal but that is just a nitpick.  Very silent indeed!</td>', 'Absolutely beatiful.  Horizon seems a fraction off horizontal but that is just a nitpick.  Very silent indeed!', '2004-03-05 17:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(611086, 62654, 12252, '<td valign="top">Just not cute enough... On second thought, I''m being too harsh. Technically I can''t fault this picture at all. Lighting is good, framing right on, etc. It''s just that it doesn''t "move" me I suppose. I''m upgrading my vote, however. I was too harsh. I gave it a 1 and that wasn''t fair. I''m moving it all the way to 5.</td>', 'Just not cute enough... On second thought, I''m being too harsh. Technically I can''t fault this picture at all. Lighting is good, framing right on, etc. It''s just that it doesn''t "move" me I suppose. I''m upgrading my vote, however. I was too harsh. I gave it a 1 and that wasn''t fair. I''m moving it all the way to 5.', '2004-03-05 17:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(611088, 62927, 16982, '<td valign="top">A little bit blurry.</td>', 'A little bit blurry.', '2004-03-05 17:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(611091, 63075, 16982, '<td valign="top">Quite a dramatic sky.  Fits your title and the subject well.  Good colours.</td>', 'Quite a dramatic sky.  Fits your title and the subject well.  Good colours.', '2004-03-05 17:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(611092, 62211, 16982, '<td valign="top">This is the most incredible sunset I''ve ever seen!  Great photo!  Where did you take this?</td>', 'This is the most incredible sunset I''ve ever seen!  Great photo!  Where did you take this?', '2004-03-05 17:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(611098, 63048, 16982, '<td valign="top">Good contrast of foreground / background.  The haze could not be helped and it has robbed your well-framed background of some of its detail.</td>', 'Good contrast of foreground / background.  The haze could not be helped and it has robbed your well-framed background of some of its detail.', '2004-03-05 17:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(611100, 62677, 16982, '<td valign="top">I dread to think how difficult this must have been to set up, but it was worth it!  Wonderful lighting and shadows, oh yes and a good title.</td>', 'I dread to think how difficult this must have been to set up, but it was worth it!  Wonderful lighting and shadows, oh yes and a good title.', '2004-03-05 17:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(611105, 62773, 16982, '<td valign="top">Another good sky picture.  The ground, trees and grasses have come out nice and dark in the foreground.  All except for the thing in the bottom left that looks like a piece of plastic sheeting.  It''s too dark to be a distraction, though.  I like the silhouettes of the distant trees.</td>', 'Another good sky picture.  The ground, trees and grasses have come out nice and dark in the foreground.  All except for the thing in the bottom left that looks like a piece of plastic sheeting.  It''s too dark to be a distraction, though.  I like the silhouettes of the distant trees.', '2004-03-05 18:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(611107, 62902, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great leading line, love the bright toning and the human interest.</td>', 'Great leading line, love the bright toning and the human interest.', '2004-03-05 18:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(611108, 62520, 9136, '<td valign="top">I laughed out loud at this one! Good idea... 10.</td>', 'I laughed out loud at this one! Good idea... 10.', '2004-03-05 18:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(611109, 63018, 16982, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I won''t be the last to sense the similarity between this and a certain other photograph.  Your one is better, though!  I like the 3D appearance of the clouds.</td>', 'I''m sure I won''t be the last to sense the similarity between this and a certain other photograph.  Your one is better, though!  I like the 3D appearance of the clouds.', '2004-03-05 18:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(611111, 62645, 9136, '<td valign="top">The photo quality is really grainy.. I think it would of been better with a darker background.</td>', 'The photo quality is really grainy.. I think it would of been better with a darker background.', '2004-03-05 18:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(611112, 62442, 9136, '<td valign="top">The background is really bright and distracting, I like the idea behind this though.</td>', 'The background is really bright and distracting, I like the idea behind this though.', '2004-03-05 18:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(611114, 62994, 9136, '<td valign="top">This is way too disturbing and bright for me. Looks really fake too. 4.</td>', 'This is way too disturbing and bright for me. Looks really fake too. 4.', '2004-03-05 18:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(611116, 63097, 16982, '<td valign="top">How do people get these perfectly-in-focus shots of birds in flight?  I would love to know how you did this, it''s brilliant!</td>', 'How do people get these perfectly-in-focus shots of birds in flight?  I would love to know how you did this, it''s brilliant!', '2004-03-05 18:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(611117, 62871, 9136, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this... an empty house is definitley "silence". I wish the photo was slightly bigger though. 7.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this... an empty house is definitley "silence". I wish the photo was slightly bigger though. 7.', '2004-03-05 18:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(611118, 62310, 9136, '<td valign="top">Ugh. I hate the photo, but I love it at the same time. It''s a great photo in the sense of the clarity and the moment you caught it. But I hate it, because I''m a girl and I''m a wimp when it comes to these things. 8.</td>', 'Ugh. I hate the photo, but I love it at the same time. It''s a great photo in the sense of the clarity and the moment you caught it. But I hate it, because I''m a girl and I''m a wimp when it comes to these things. 8.', '2004-03-05 18:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(611119, 62986, 16982, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and framing.  I suspect that a photographer of your talent could have extracted a slightly more in-focus and brighter shot from this scene.</td>', 'Great lighting and framing.  I suspect that a photographer of your talent could have extracted a slightly more in-focus and brighter shot from this scene.', '2004-03-05 18:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(611120, 63029, 9136, '<td valign="top">Creative idea behind this... I would of liked to see a closer shot though. 8.</td>', 'Creative idea behind this... I would of liked to see a closer shot though. 8.', '2004-03-05 18:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
