(611139, 62905, 15920, '<td valign="top">A little more DOF would have made this a little sharper.  But, I still grinned, good idea.</td>', 'A little more DOF would have made this a little sharper.  But, I still grinned, good idea.', '2004-03-05 18:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(611142, 62488, 326, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I think this fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Well done.  I think this fits the challenge well.', '2004-03-05 18:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(611144, 62389, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a little grainy.  I also suspect that you might get hammered in the voting because people that live in warm climates won''t understand how quiet a beach is when there is still a little snow on the ground.  But, growing up in New England made that time of year my favorite time to be on a beach.  The only other thing might be to increase the size and not crop so tightly, maybe push out the right side of the picture a little?</td>', 'This is a little grainy.  I also suspect that you might get hammered in the voting because people that live in warm climates won''t understand how quiet a beach is when there is still a little snow on the ground.  But, growing up in New England made that time of year my favorite time to be on a beach.  The only other thing might be to increase the size and not crop so tightly, maybe push out the right side of the picture a little?', '2004-03-05 18:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(611148, 62892, 15920, '<td valign="top">Trees could have been a little sharper.</td>', 'Trees could have been a little sharper.', '2004-03-05 18:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(611151, 62990, 15920, '<td valign="top">The off angle crop threw me off a little, I expected teh pieces to be vertical and the trees to just be trees. The overblown sky didn''t help much, but I am assuming it was a grey day and that is the best you could get out of it.  I really like the POV, and the lack of an opponent, as from here, it really makes you look twice.  This is an enjoyable picture to look at.</td>', 'The off angle crop threw me off a little, I expected teh pieces to be vertical and the trees to just be trees. The overblown sky didn''t help much, but I am assuming it was a grey day and that is the best you could get out of it.  I really like the POV, and the lack of an opponent, as from here, it really makes you look twice.  This is an enjoyable picture to look at.', '2004-03-05 18:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(611154, 63128, 15920, '<td valign="top">Tape on the mouth overdoes this message.  For me, the work (which I assume is makeup) under the eyes and the sad expression on the model would have done it.  Other than that, this looks very well done to me with great lighting (maybe a little more focus on the eyes, but that is really an option for you, not a criticism.)</td>', 'Tape on the mouth overdoes this message.  For me, the work (which I assume is makeup) under the eyes and the sad expression on the model would have done it.  Other than that, this looks very well done to me with great lighting (maybe a little more focus on the eyes, but that is really an option for you, not a criticism.)', '2004-03-05 18:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(611155, 62408, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the blue color is overpowering and hurts this a little.</td>', 'Great idea, but the blue color is overpowering and hurts this a little.', '2004-03-05 18:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(611156, 63020, 15920, '<td valign="top">I hope this does very well.</td>', 'I hope this does very well.', '2004-03-05 18:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
