(611507, 62956, 13937, '<td valign="top">Nice use of window light.  The grain and noise add to this image.  Composition is very good.  The more I look at this image the more I like it.</td>', 'Nice use of window light.  The grain and noise add to this image.  Composition is very good.  The more I look at this image the more I like it.', '2004-03-05 23:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(611511, 62618, 13937, '<td valign="top">This is a cute image.  Color harmony is very good.  You''ve got a great model here.  I think I would like this better without the border, though.</td>', 'This is a cute image.  Color harmony is very good.  You''ve got a great model here.  I think I would like this better without the border, though.', '2004-03-05 23:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(611513, 63089, 4767, '<td valign="top">I even like the frame - and I HATE frames!  So it must be an excellent image.</td>', 'I even like the frame - and I HATE frames!  So it must be an excellent image.', '2004-03-05 23:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(611515, 62893, 13937, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what is missing here.  I don''t feel a connection with this image.  Maybe eye contact would draw me into it a little more.</td>', 'I don''t know what is missing here.  I don''t feel a connection with this image.  Maybe eye contact would draw me into it a little more.', '2004-03-05 23:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(611516, 62594, 4767, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but get help with your titles in the future!  6</td>', 'Nice photo, but get help with your titles in the future!  6', '2004-03-05 23:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(611518, 63095, 5792, '<td valign="top">God mountain detail. I wish the sky and foreground had more vibrant color. I wonder if this was taken with a Sony F707 or F717. The circular sky darkening defect on the left side of the image reminds me of a similar defect in my camera.</td>', 'God mountain detail. I wish the sky and foreground had more vibrant color. I wonder if this was taken with a Sony F707 or F717. The circular sky darkening defect on the left side of the image reminds me of a similar defect in my camera.', '2004-03-05 23:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(611519, 63085, 13937, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the focus appears to be directed more to the lower left corner of the image.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the focus appears to be directed more to the lower left corner of the image.', '2004-03-05 23:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(611520, 62976, 4767, '<td valign="top">Must be the first silent gull in the history of the world...   nice shot, though!<br/></td>', 'Must be the first silent gull in the history of the world...   nice shot, though!', '2004-03-06 00:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(611523, 62854, 5792, '<td valign="top">Very artsy photograph. I like the surrealism of this image.</td>', 'Very artsy photograph. I like the surrealism of this image.', '2004-03-06 00:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
