(611609, 62593, 17012, '<td valign="top">nice framing</td>', 'nice framing', '2004-03-06 04:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(611615, 62329, 15920, '<td valign="top">Not sure why this makes me think of silence, but it is a cool picture.  Interesting that you were able to get the light that far down the gutter.  One thing to try is to use the depth of field at the near end and let it blurr out in the distance rather than close by.</td>', 'Not sure why this makes me think of silence, but it is a cool picture.  Interesting that you were able to get the light that far down the gutter.  One thing to try is to use the depth of field at the near end and let it blurr out in the distance rather than close by.', '2004-03-06 05:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(611619, 62866, 17228, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and that there''s a story behind the picture. Nice how woman''s shadow leads you up to the child. Not the usual ''tape or index finger over the mouth'' shot. Thanks for giving us something different and interesting to look at.  :)   I''''m curious to see how this would look in B&amp;W also.</td>', 'I like the composition and that there''s a story behind the picture. Nice how woman''s shadow leads you up to the child. Not the usual ''tape or index finger over the mouth'' shot. Thanks for giving us something different and interesting to look at.  :)   I''''m curious to see how this would look in B&W also.', '2004-03-06 07:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(611621, 63018, 17228, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pastoral shot. Great composition and saturated colors.  I really appreciate the fact that you''ve taken a more subtle approach to the silence theme than most, I''m just not sure that the picture without the aid of your title immediately brings ''silence'' to my mind. Wish this challenge was for landscapes so I could have judged it higher.  :)</td>', 'Beautiful pastoral shot. Great composition and saturated colors.  I really appreciate the fact that you''ve taken a more subtle approach to the silence theme than most, I''m just not sure that the picture without the aid of your title immediately brings ''silence'' to my mind. Wish this challenge was for landscapes so I could have judged it higher.  :)', '2004-03-06 07:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(611622, 62237, 6624, '<td valign="top">adorable but too small to do itself justice</td>', 'adorable but too small to do itself justice', '2004-03-06 07:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(611623, 63076, 6624, '<td valign="top">a response which I know is very personal but there seems so much noise in a city that although you have presented it in its most peaceful time I still don''t find it "silent"</td>', 'a response which I know is very personal but there seems so much noise in a city that although you have presented it in its most peaceful time I still don''t find it "silent"', '2004-03-06 07:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(611624, 63080, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is quiet and peaceful, I wish that you had brought it all in closer</td>', 'this is quiet and peaceful, I wish that you had brought it all in closer', '2004-03-06 07:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(611625, 62558, 6624, '<td valign="top">small and a bit lacking in detail</td>', 'small and a bit lacking in detail', '2004-03-06 07:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(611626, 62577, 6624, '<td valign="top">I am a stickler for the challenge definition but I see and hear noise from the p[lane</td>', 'I am a stickler for the challenge definition but I see and hear noise from the p[lane', '2004-03-06 07:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(611627, 63028, 6624, '<td valign="top">whatever this was intended to do it didn''t work for me</td>', 'whatever this was intended to do it didn''t work for me', '2004-03-06 07:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(611628, 63000, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF. Thanks also for NOT including the entire headphones in the frame, allowing the viewer''s mind to ''fill in the rest''.  Many others would have included it all, making it look more like a product shot. My only problem is that these mystery headphones could have been unplugged from a stereo system rather than an MP3/CD player, which could make this scene quite the opposite of silent.  As you can see, it might raise more questions in the viewer''s mind than the obvious conclusion you had hoped for. But hey, don''t get me wrong, sometimes that''s a GOOD thing!  :)</td>', 'Nice DOF. Thanks also for NOT including the entire headphones in the frame, allowing the viewer''s mind to ''fill in the rest''.  Many others would have included it all, making it look more like a product shot. My only problem is that these mystery headphones could have been unplugged from a stereo system rather than an MP3/CD player, which could make this scene quite the opposite of silent.  As you can see, it might raise more questions in the viewer''s mind than the obvious conclusion you had hoped for. But hey, don''t get me wrong, sometimes that''s a GOOD thing!  :)', '2004-03-06 07:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(611630, 63078, 6624, '<td valign="top">the size of this makes it difficult to vote on but overall both the color and the focus are problematic</td>', 'the size of this makes it difficult to vote on but overall both the color and the focus are problematic', '2004-03-06 07:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(611631, 62248, 6624, '<td valign="top">I am mot sure that I understand your intent with this image - I hope that it will be clear in your comments about the image</td>', 'I am mot sure that I understand your intent with this image - I hope that it will be clear in your comments about the image', '2004-03-06 07:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(611632, 62478, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice light on the trees, the end of the season flowers are nice and it looks like a quiet place - the sharp angle detracts from the image for me, however</td>', 'nice light on the trees, the end of the season flowers are nice and it looks like a quiet place - the sharp angle detracts from the image for me, however', '2004-03-06 07:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(611633, 62850, 6624, '<td valign="top">I have difficulty in voting on an image that is a photograph of someone else''s work</td>', 'I have difficulty in voting on an image that is a photograph of someone else''s work', '2004-03-06 07:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(611635, 62842, 16053, '<td valign="top">excellent. Need I say more?</td>', 'excellent. Need I say more?', '2004-03-06 07:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(611637, 62442, 17228, '<td valign="top">Love the colored spotlights. Although the DOF you''ve chosen works great for drawing attention to the plug, there''s ALOT of ''stuff'' going on in the background: headphone''s cords, headband, earspeakers PLUS all their accompanying shadows. It made it difficult at first to figure out what WAS that thing in the background. Since the background is so VERY blurred, it could really benefit from "less is more'' perhaps, allowing the viewer to quickly make out a cleaner outline/shape of the headphones. A more ''generic'' looking/readily recognizable pair of headphones? Of course, that''s only MY opinion.  ;)   Good work.</td>', 'Love the colored spotlights. Although the DOF you''ve chosen works great for drawing attention to the plug, there''s ALOT of ''stuff'' going on in the background: headphone''s cords, headband, earspeakers PLUS all their accompanying shadows. It made it difficult at first to figure out what WAS that thing in the background. Since the background is so VERY blurred, it could really benefit from "less is more'' perhaps, allowing the viewer to quickly make out a cleaner outline/shape of the headphones. A more ''generic'' looking/readily recognizable pair of headphones? Of course, that''s only MY opinion.  ;)   Good work.', '2004-03-06 07:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(611638, 62308, 17228, '<td valign="top">I really like what you''ve captured here. The contrasting colors are great. It certainly looks "glorious". You almost expect to hear golden trumpets sounding, rather than golden silence. Nice.  :)</td>', 'I really like what you''ve captured here. The contrasting colors are great. It certainly looks "glorious". You almost expect to hear golden trumpets sounding, rather than golden silence. Nice.  :)', '2004-03-06 07:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(611640, 62217, 17228, '<td valign="top">I like the chance you took with this idea...a worthy effort. Without the title I''m not sure I would have immediately caught the meaning behind this photo though. Was there a reason you cropped off the edge of the war sticker? Keep at it!   :)</td>', 'I like the chance you took with this idea...a worthy effort. Without the title I''m not sure I would have immediately caught the meaning behind this photo though. Was there a reason you cropped off the edge of the war sticker? Keep at it!   :)', '2004-03-06 07:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
