(611644, 62848, 16053, '<td valign="top">A fine example of a nice subject. It''s alwas a pleasure to me to see such a nice photo that grabs the theme nicelly. Excellent DOF and focus. Its an 8 to me!</td>', 'A fine example of a nice subject. It''s alwas a pleasure to me to see such a nice photo that grabs the theme nicelly. Excellent DOF and focus. Its an 8 to me!', '2004-03-06 08:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
