(611676, 62327, 17228, '<td valign="top">I hope this phone was dead BEFORE it hit the water. If not, I have to admire the phone for "taking one for the team" by posing for this shot. Quite different! All it needed as a goldfish staring at it.  :)   Some distracting reflections and vertical lines weaken it some. Nice going!  :)</td>', 'I hope this phone was dead BEFORE it hit the water. If not, I have to admire the phone for "taking one for the team" by posing for this shot. Quite different! All it needed as a goldfish staring at it.  :)   Some distracting reflections and vertical lines weaken it some. Nice going!  :)', '2004-03-06 08:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(611683, 62715, 17228, '<td valign="top">NO WAKE is quite a bit different than NO NOISE with regards to boating. However, your photo would  have worked GREAT if you could have captured someone/yourself snoozing beneath/in front of the sign, making a visua connection/gag that the NO WAKE sign now doubles as a  "DO NOT DISTURB" request for the happily snoring person.</td>', 'NO WAKE is quite a bit different than NO NOISE with regards to boating. However, your photo would  have worked GREAT if you could have captured someone/yourself snoozing beneath/in front of the sign, making a visua connection/gag that the NO WAKE sign now doubles as a  "DO NOT DISTURB" request for the happily snoring person.', '2004-03-06 09:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(611686, 62484, 17228, '<td valign="top">I like the framing/composition of your shot.  Good capture of emotion. The theme is silence, but the very title of your photo makes me think there IS no silence for this poor girl. I think your shot would have worked well for another challenge, but SILENCE just doesn''t seem to due it justice.  Keep it up!  :)</td>', 'I like the framing/composition of your shot.  Good capture of emotion. The theme is silence, but the very title of your photo makes me think there IS no silence for this poor girl. I think your shot would have worked well for another challenge, but SILENCE just doesn''t seem to due it justice.  Keep it up!  :)', '2004-03-06 09:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(611688, 62458, 17228, '<td valign="top">I''ll have to assume this is a hearing aid, never having worn one or seen one of these newer models. Not much detail in green parts shadows. Could use better fill lighting/reflectors to help in that regard. Silver battery has turned too dark because of that as well and seems to have picked up a green cast from the green earpiece.</td>', 'I''ll have to assume this is a hearing aid, never having worn one or seen one of these newer models. Not much detail in green parts shadows. Could use better fill lighting/reflectors to help in that regard. Silver battery has turned too dark because of that as well and seems to have picked up a green cast from the green earpiece.', '2004-03-06 09:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(611717, 62443, 10510, '<td valign="top">This looks like a beautiful piece of art.  Hope you sell prints - I will buy one!  10</td>', 'This looks like a beautiful piece of art.  Hope you sell prints - I will buy one!  10', '2004-03-06 09:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
