(611908, 62866, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is interetsing because it communicates silence in there ways: 1-Silence is needed to concentrate on reading. 2-The door silences the crying baby. 3-The "No Solicitors" sign silences interruptions by unwanted peddlers.<br/> <br/>Nicely done.</td>', 'This is interetsing because it communicates silence in there ways: 1-Silence is needed to concentrate on reading. 2-The door silences the crying baby. 3-The "No Solicitors" sign silences interruptions by unwanted peddlers. Nicely done.', '2004-03-06 15:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
