(611930, 62385, 10124, '<td valign="top">the angles of the lines in this shot draw you deeper into the picture. nice composition.</td>', 'the angles of the lines in this shot draw you deeper into the picture. nice composition.', '2004-03-06 15:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(611931, 62925, 12813, '<td valign="top">great hair, let me say</td>', 'great hair, let me say', '2004-03-06 15:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(611932, 63099, 17228, '<td valign="top">Well, it certainly makes for a good stock photo where everything needs to be painfully spelled out for the viewer!  ;)  Nice composition and varied/multiple light sources. Lots of other entries with same basic idea, but yours was done with a bit more care and technical ability.</td>', 'Well, it certainly makes for a good stock photo where everything needs to be painfully spelled out for the viewer!  ;)  Nice composition and varied/multiple light sources. Lots of other entries with same basic idea, but yours was done with a bit more care and technical ability.', '2004-03-06 15:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(611934, 62813, 12813, '<td valign="top">great execution,</td>', 'great execution,', '2004-03-06 15:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(611936, 62986, 5792, '<td valign="top">The scene is great for this challenge, especially that silence is conveyed by the unused swings, but it unfortunately has a lot of snapshot quality to it. If you could have repositioned yourself to hide the buildings and fense in the background this would work better. The light object on the far right is also distracting to your composition.</td>', 'The scene is great for this challenge, especially that silence is conveyed by the unused swings, but it unfortunately has a lot of snapshot quality to it. If you could have repositioned yourself to hide the buildings and fense in the background this would work better. The light object on the far right is also distracting to your composition.', '2004-03-06 15:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(611937, 62349, 17228, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite hit me with the idea of ''silence''. A basketball beneath the backboard would have helped, leaving me to ponder why the ball was there alone or what had interrupted the game. Nice attemp at framing the backboard with the two groups of trees on either side, but would have preferred if they were equal distance from the subject. You don''t see too many real-life frames off-balance like this, if you know what I mean.  ;)  Good idea with potential. Keep it up!</td>', 'Doesn''t quite hit me with the idea of ''silence''. A basketball beneath the backboard would have helped, leaving me to ponder why the ball was there alone or what had interrupted the game. Nice attemp at framing the backboard with the two groups of trees on either side, but would have preferred if they were equal distance from the subject. You don''t see too many real-life frames off-balance like this, if you know what I mean.  ;)  Good idea with potential. Keep it up!', '2004-03-06 15:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(611938, 63078, 5792, '<td valign="top">The idea of this image is right. An empty playground conveys a feeling of silence and your composition even your choice of color is generally good. The small size and overall image quality hurt this picture for voting.</td>', 'The idea of this image is right. An empty playground conveys a feeling of silence and your composition even your choice of color is generally good. The small size and overall image quality hurt this picture for voting.', '2004-03-06 15:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(611939, 63064, 5792, '<td valign="top">The color and composition of this image is excellent, but poor focus and what appears to be mottled image sky noise hurts this otherwise wonderful shot.</td>', 'The color and composition of this image is excellent, but poor focus and what appears to be mottled image sky noise hurts this otherwise wonderful shot.', '2004-03-06 15:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(611940, 62437, 10634, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the color and the DOF is just right... 10</td>', 'Very nice. I like the color and the DOF is just right... 10', '2004-03-06 15:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(611941, 62220, 17228, '<td valign="top">Could use a bit more edge delineation/rim lighting (at least on one additional side of candle) to help viewer find their bearings. I''ll have to assume that the lower dull light is the flame''s reflection on some sort of surface. Too many things to guess at here on a subject that should be easy to distinguish.... kinda cool in it''s own abstract way, but rather distracting at the same time. Needs more visual info if you''re going to convince viewers that THIS is the ultimate vision of silence.  :)</td>', 'Could use a bit more edge delineation/rim lighting (at least on one additional side of candle) to help viewer find their bearings. I''ll have to assume that the lower dull light is the flame''s reflection on some sort of surface. Too many things to guess at here on a subject that should be easy to distinguish.... kinda cool in it''s own abstract way, but rather distracting at the same time. Needs more visual info if you''re going to convince viewers that THIS is the ultimate vision of silence.  :)', '2004-03-06 15:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(611942, 63014, 10634, '<td valign="top">My personal favorite of this challenge... probably because I have 4 kids and know what a binky means... 10</td>', 'My personal favorite of this challenge... probably because I have 4 kids and know what a binky means... 10', '2004-03-06 15:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(611943, 62736, 10634, '<td valign="top">Not the most original idea, but the best executed of the bunch... 10</td>', 'Not the most original idea, but the best executed of the bunch... 10', '2004-03-06 15:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(611944, 62310, 10634, '<td valign="top">Now that is Nature red in tooth and claw, Great capture... 10</td>', 'Now that is Nature red in tooth and claw, Great capture... 10', '2004-03-06 15:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(611945, 62895, 5792, '<td valign="top">The angle, content and composition of this image is good. A train with flowers growing around the wheels works well for this challenge. Oversharpening it to produce a very bad case of the "jaggies" should not have been done. There are several places across the image with overexposed, burned in areas too.  This is distracting to an otherwise excellent picture.</td>', 'The angle, content and composition of this image is good. A train with flowers growing around the wheels works well for this challenge. Oversharpening it to produce a very bad case of the "jaggies" should not have been done. There are several places across the image with overexposed, burned in areas too.  This is distracting to an otherwise excellent picture.', '2004-03-06 15:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(611946, 62245, 10634, '<td valign="top">May have been better in color, but otherwise perfect... 10</td>', 'May have been better in color, but otherwise perfect... 10', '2004-03-06 15:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(611947, 62734, 10634, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful place. The B&amp;W really makes this photo... 10</td>', 'Such a beautiful place. The B&W really makes this photo... 10', '2004-03-06 15:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(611948, 62487, 10634, '<td valign="top">Unique idea. Very nice photo... 9</td>', 'Unique idea. Very nice photo... 9', '2004-03-06 15:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(611949, 62546, 10634, '<td valign="top">Unique angle, good concept, just seems a little too centered for my taste.</td>', 'Unique angle, good concept, just seems a little too centered for my taste.', '2004-03-06 15:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(611950, 62357, 10634, '<td valign="top">A difficult shot. Better focus on the pin is needed. Maybe better lighting and DOF. Did you try tracking the pin as it fell? That may have helped with the focus. A good idea and a great attempt, though!</td>', 'A difficult shot. Better focus on the pin is needed. Maybe better lighting and DOF. Did you try tracking the pin as it fell? That may have helped with the focus. A good idea and a great attempt, though!', '2004-03-06 15:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(611951, 62373, 10634, '<td valign="top">Good idea, great capture... 9</td>', 'Good idea, great capture... 9', '2004-03-06 15:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(611953, 62329, 10634, '<td valign="top">Different, certainly doesn''t make any noise, and considering the subject it''s a great capture, but it just doesn''t hold any interest for me... 5</td>', 'Different, certainly doesn''t make any noise, and considering the subject it''s a great capture, but it just doesn''t hold any interest for me... 5', '2004-03-06 16:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(611954, 62493, 10634, '<td valign="top">Very pretty snake and a nice capture</td>', 'Very pretty snake and a nice capture', '2004-03-06 16:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(611956, 62839, 10634, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Adorable baby...5</td>', 'Nice capture. Adorable baby...5', '2004-03-06 16:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(611958, 62963, 10634, '<td valign="top">The focus really ruins this shot. The B&amp;W was a good choice and this was a really nice capture of an idea that was used quite a bit in this challenge. It just seems blurry to me and that is its one downfall...5</td>', 'The focus really ruins this shot. The B&W was a good choice and this was a really nice capture of an idea that was used quite a bit in this challenge. It just seems blurry to me and that is its one downfall...5', '2004-03-06 16:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(611959, 62734, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice use of foreground rocks to partially frame image. I like the luminescent quality of the white water. I do find the sky very bland and, although it would change the proportions of the image, I personally prefer less of that sky/ bare tree line included. 7</td>', 'Nice use of foreground rocks to partially frame image. I like the luminescent quality of the white water. I do find the sky very bland and, although it would change the proportions of the image, I personally prefer less of that sky/ bare tree line included. 7', '2004-03-06 16:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(611960, 63077, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love this and have viewed it several times since I did my initial voting (10) and now my voting fine tuning (10). Whilst the traditional technical measures of a "good" image (such as composition, background etc) aren''t the best they could be, this image packs an incredible punch, regardless. It conveys silence and the reality of living in a silent world very very strongly. I also love the feeling of connection with your subjects. An exceptional image and my joint-favourite this challenge.</td>', 'I love this and have viewed it several times since I did my initial voting (10) and now my voting fine tuning (10). Whilst the traditional technical measures of a "good" image (such as composition, background etc) aren''t the best they could be, this image packs an incredible punch, regardless. It conveys silence and the reality of living in a silent world very very strongly. I also love the feeling of connection with your subjects. An exceptional image and my joint-favourite this challenge.', '2004-03-06 16:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(611963, 62361, 3087, '<td valign="top">I am really attracted to this image - the lighting is beautiful. Very ethereal and it the image very strongly connotes to me that fantasy world, fairy world, ghost world that is a figment of my imagination but that seems almost real when I''m on the edge of dreaming. 10</td>', 'I am really attracted to this image - the lighting is beautiful. Very ethereal and it the image very strongly connotes to me that fantasy world, fairy world, ghost world that is a figment of my imagination but that seems almost real when I''m on the edge of dreaming. 10', '2004-03-06 16:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(611964, 62978, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait and an excellent choice for this challenge. My only suggestion would be that it might better suit a portrait orientation. I find that the two empty areas to the sides of him don''t really strengthen composition.</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait and an excellent choice for this challenge. My only suggestion would be that it might better suit a portrait orientation. I find that the two empty areas to the sides of him don''t really strengthen composition.', '2004-03-06 16:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(611965, 62477, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like this - though I think it''s the work of art itself I''m admiring as much as your image of it. It''s a great idea for the challenge though. Cropping at top is slightly out, not that this has an impact on my scoring or anything.</td>', 'I really like this - though I think it''s the work of art itself I''m admiring as much as your image of it. It''s a great idea for the challenge though. Cropping at top is slightly out, not that this has an impact on my scoring or anything.', '2004-03-06 16:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(611966, 62813, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cute and good choice to push the contrast so high! Like your choice to go for an off-centre composition. Those eyes are just great!</td>', 'Cute and good choice to push the contrast so high! Like your choice to go for an off-centre composition. Those eyes are just great!', '2004-03-06 16:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(611967, 62594, 3087, '<td valign="top">The colours of the boat really sing out against the misty water and sky. Great composition too and I like the little dot of that bouy - it''s like a full stop after the flourish of a signature (written right to left). 9</td>', 'The colours of the boat really sing out against the misty water and sky. Great composition too and I like the little dot of that bouy - it''s like a full stop after the flourish of a signature (written right to left). 9', '2004-03-06 16:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(611968, 62677, 3087, '<td valign="top">The angle of view gives a really teetering kind of feel to this - almost makes me feel like I do when I am standing at the top of a high staircase. Vertigo! I like the light and shadow and blue tones. This is a great abstract interpretation of the challenge. 9</td>', 'The angle of view gives a really teetering kind of feel to this - almost makes me feel like I do when I am standing at the top of a high staircase. Vertigo! I like the light and shadow and blue tones. This is a great abstract interpretation of the challenge. 9', '2004-03-06 16:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(611970, 62842, 3087, '<td valign="top">Somewhat disturbing but also rather mesmeric. The angle and close up creates a strong composition. Harsh lighting and high contrast suit the subject. 8</td>', 'Somewhat disturbing but also rather mesmeric. The angle and close up creates a strong composition. Harsh lighting and high contrast suit the subject. 8', '2004-03-06 16:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(611971, 63052, 10818, '<td valign="top">Wow...that phone is ugly...I would unplug it too  :  )<br/> <br/>Nice shot though....good luck to ya !</td>', 'Wow...that phone is ugly...I would unplug it too  :  ) Nice shot though....good luck to ya !', '2004-03-06 16:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(611973, 62736, 15260, '<td valign="top">excellent contrast with b&amp;w... good job. tough i think the idea is not very original, it was well executed.</td>', 'excellent contrast with b&w... good job. tough i think the idea is not very original, it was well executed.', '2004-03-06 16:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(611974, 62459, 10818, '<td valign="top">Very realistic shot of ...well ..life and things that happen, as disturbing as it is.</td>', 'Very realistic shot of ...well ..life and things that happen, as disturbing as it is.', '2004-03-06 16:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(611975, 62665, 15260, '<td valign="top">great idea !!! original</td>', 'great idea !!! original', '2004-03-06 16:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(611977, 63125, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a bleak and fascination landscape. Particularly like that snaking blue shadow that pulls me in from the foreground. Great composition. 8</td>', 'What a bleak and fascination landscape. Particularly like that snaking blue shadow that pulls me in from the foreground. Great composition. 8', '2004-03-06 16:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(611978, 63077, 10818, '<td valign="top">Nice photo......i guess i would say I "love" it.  Sepia works real well....good luck.</td>', 'Nice photo......i guess i would say I "love" it.  Sepia works real well....good luck.', '2004-03-06 16:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(611979, 63018, 3087, '<td valign="top">Title seems too long - with this image you don''t need to try and justify how it fits into the challenge - if anyone fails to see the fit perhaps they just don''t appreciate the powers of a beautiful landscape in aiding silent meditation/ contemplation! 8</td>', 'Title seems too long - with this image you don''t need to try and justify how it fits into the challenge - if anyone fails to see the fit perhaps they just don''t appreciate the powers of a beautiful landscape in aiding silent meditation/ contemplation! 8', '2004-03-06 16:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(611980, 62618, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very sweet. Great eye contact, and I love the touch of a smile that you have caught. I want to know what the secret might be!<br/>Would prefer sharper focus and a portrait orientation - the space at the two sides seems wasted and yet it feels tight for space above her head - and lighting is a little harsh for my tastes. 8</td>', 'Very sweet. Great eye contact, and I love the touch of a smile that you have caught. I want to know what the secret might be!Would prefer sharper focus and a portrait orientation - the space at the two sides seems wasted and yet it feels tight for space above her head - and lighting is a little harsh for my tastes. 8', '2004-03-06 16:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(611981, 62991, 3087, '<td valign="top">A touch too blue overall but very serene, love the curving line of the fence and the long shadow of the tree. 8</td>', 'A touch too blue overall but very serene, love the curving line of the fence and the long shadow of the tree. 8', '2004-03-06 16:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(611983, 62900, 3087, '<td valign="top">A striking image and I love your choice not to be restricted by the rule of thirds - giving the majority of the frame over to that sky really enhances the composition and makes the two silhouettes seem tinier in the vastness. The light from the clouds is wonderful though, in places, a touch too much so, in that it overpowers the beautiful rays filtering out through the clouds. Good move to include those bare foreground branches - it does add something I think. Overall a lovely image! 9</td>', 'A striking image and I love your choice not to be restricted by the rule of thirds - giving the majority of the frame over to that sky really enhances the composition and makes the two silhouettes seem tinier in the vastness. The light from the clouds is wonderful though, in places, a touch too much so, in that it overpowers the beautiful rays filtering out through the clouds. Good move to include those bare foreground branches - it does add something I think. Overall a lovely image! 9', '2004-03-06 16:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(611984, 63121, 3087, '<td valign="top">Serenity. Empty spaces. Softness. And the sound of a feather falling . . . silence. 9</td>', 'Serenity. Empty spaces. Softness. And the sound of a feather falling . . . silence. 9', '2004-03-06 16:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(611985, 62665, 3087, '<td valign="top">Yeah yeah I''m a sucker for interesting use of low DOF. 8</td>', 'Yeah yeah I''m a sucker for interesting use of low DOF. 8', '2004-03-06 16:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(611988, 62593, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful framing - I love the way the tree trunk, foliage and foreground grass all coalesce into one flowing frame. And I like the way her silhouette fuses into that mass too and yet is separate from it. The snow on the ground is essential as it provides a balancing white area to that of the sky, an area which is nicely interrupted by the tree. Overall, the image is one of contemplation in a quiet corner. 8</td>', 'Wonderful framing - I love the way the tree trunk, foliage and foreground grass all coalesce into one flowing frame. And I like the way her silhouette fuses into that mass too and yet is separate from it. The snow on the ground is essential as it provides a balancing white area to that of the sky, an area which is nicely interrupted by the tree. Overall, the image is one of contemplation in a quiet corner. 8', '2004-03-06 16:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(611990, 63103, 10943, '<td valign="top">Now that''s cool.....7 for something more interesting than some of the mundane photos I''ve been sifting through.</td>', 'Now that''s cool.....7 for something more interesting than some of the mundane photos I''ve been sifting through.', '2004-03-06 16:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(611991, 63121, 16095, '<td valign="top">this is a nice example of how simplicity can be used effectively. Only complaint would be border disrupts the calm white background.</td>', 'this is a nice example of how simplicity can be used effectively. Only complaint would be border disrupts the calm white background.', '2004-03-06 16:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(611998, 62487, 3087, '<td valign="top">Definitely conveys that serene and quiet moment.</td>', 'Definitely conveys that serene and quiet moment.', '2004-03-06 17:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(611999, 63062, 18130, '<td valign="top">avoid the seam in the leather, reflection on hat</td>', 'avoid the seam in the leather, reflection on hat', '2004-03-06 17:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(612003, 62917, 17081, '<td valign="top">snapshot, and I can practically hear them growling!</td>', 'snapshot, and I can practically hear them growling!', '2004-03-06 17:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(612006, 63059, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an unusual image. Interesting use of colour and lighting. In terms of composition, I like the use of negative space, but would position the face just a touch further in from the edge of the frame.</td>', 'What an unusual image. Interesting use of colour and lighting. In terms of composition, I like the use of negative space, but would position the face just a touch further in from the edge of the frame.', '2004-03-06 17:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(612008, 62485, 3087, '<td valign="top">Strangely appealing, excellent composition - feels so balanced. Nice use of light and DOF. Great abstract, though using recognisable items which clearly relate to challenge theme.</td>', 'Strangely appealing, excellent composition - feels so balanced. Nice use of light and DOF. Great abstract, though using recognisable items which clearly relate to challenge theme.', '2004-03-06 17:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(612012, 62484, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the "shapes" in this - the triangle within her bent arm and face, the oval of her face, the checkered print shirt. Her eyes looking upwards certainly make me think that she is focused on what''s going on in her head - we often look upwards when thinking. Expression on her face good too. Don''t like textured surface of background wall at all though.</td>', 'I like the "shapes" in this - the triangle within her bent arm and face, the oval of her face, the checkered print shirt. Her eyes looking upwards certainly make me think that she is focused on what''s going on in her head - we often look upwards when thinking. Expression on her face good too. Don''t like textured surface of background wall at all though.', '2004-03-06 17:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(612013, 62692, 3087, '<td valign="top">From the thumbnail I did think this would be a rather mundane image but your unusual viewpoint has certainly added interest - there is a strong feeling of scale. There is also a wonderful feeling of longevity conveyed by the texture on the foreground tombstone. The clear blue sky makes a great backdrop to the solid earthy stone.</td>', 'From the thumbnail I did think this would be a rather mundane image but your unusual viewpoint has certainly added interest - there is a strong feeling of scale. There is also a wonderful feeling of longevity conveyed by the texture on the foreground tombstone. The clear blue sky makes a great backdrop to the solid earthy stone.', '2004-03-06 17:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(612014, 62408, 11440, '<td valign="top">nice bike</td>', 'nice bike', '2004-03-06 17:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(612017, 62877, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and texture and nice silhouette shape and pose. I think he''s a touch too close to the top of the frame though - I''d say he could do with being as far from the top edge as he is from the right edge. A great silhouette though, very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful light and texture and nice silhouette shape and pose. I think he''s a touch too close to the top of the frame though - I''d say he could do with being as far from the top edge as he is from the right edge. A great silhouette though, very nice.', '2004-03-06 17:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(612019, 63094, 3087, '<td valign="top">The sense of scale here is incredible and that feeling of the size of the room, together with the solidity of those walls, really does convey silence to me. Pose is perfect - am curious as to whether it''s genuine (candid) or modelled.</td>', 'The sense of scale here is incredible and that feeling of the size of the room, together with the solidity of those walls, really does convey silence to me. Pose is perfect - am curious as to whether it''s genuine (candid) or modelled.', '2004-03-06 17:46:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(612021, 62957, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not sure about lighting but the content is strong. You have managed to get quite some anguish into that expression. Your frame is so narrow as to look more like a cropping error than a deliberate border. I''d widen or remove it, personally.</td>', 'Not sure about lighting but the content is strong. You have managed to get quite some anguish into that expression. Your frame is so narrow as to look more like a cropping error than a deliberate border. I''d widen or remove it, personally.', '2004-03-06 17:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(612022, 63001, 3087, '<td valign="top">An interesting landscape and I like the reflections of the sun in the wetness of the vehicle tracks.</td>', 'An interesting landscape and I like the reflections of the sun in the wetness of the vehicle tracks.', '2004-03-06 17:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(612023, 62217, 3087, '<td valign="top">He he I saw these guys on Richard and Judy one evening when I was home poorly recently. They are so funny (R&amp;J) and their guests were pretty weird too - the chappies I mean. Nice split screen thingy going on here and the statue peeking out is kind of cool...</td>', 'He he I saw these guys on Richard and Judy one evening when I was home poorly recently. They are so funny (R&J) and their guests were pretty weird too - the chappies I mean. Nice split screen thingy going on here and the statue peeking out is kind of cool...', '2004-03-06 17:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(612024, 63052, 13305, '<td valign="top">Sorry , these days most phones have a ringer off setting and/or a do not disturb feature on the line.  The picture in general is ok, but no exciting.  Perhaps if there were and activity you didn''t want interuppted in the bacground.</td>', 'Sorry , these days most phones have a ringer off setting and/or a do not disturb feature on the line.  The picture in general is ok, but no exciting.  Perhaps if there were and activity you didn''t want interuppted in the bacground.', '2004-03-06 17:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(612026, 62365, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lipstick in bed? Tsch Tsch! ;) Nice image, not sure it needs so much lightening/ desat but I can see the idea behind that. She looks very peaceful.</td>', 'Lipstick in bed? Tsch Tsch! ;) Nice image, not sure it needs so much lightening/ desat but I can see the idea behind that. She looks very peaceful.', '2004-03-06 17:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(612028, 62563, 3087, '<td valign="top">The silence of decay, destruction, desolation. Very moving.</td>', 'The silence of decay, destruction, desolation. Very moving.', '2004-03-06 17:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(612031, 62459, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hard hitting, beautifully composed, well lit, good background, high impact.</td>', 'Hard hitting, beautifully composed, well lit, good background, high impact.', '2004-03-06 18:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(612032, 62844, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and you''ve really caught the colour of that night sky.</td>', 'Nice lighting and you''ve really caught the colour of that night sky.', '2004-03-06 18:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(612033, 62360, 13305, '<td valign="top">Silenced? I''m not sure I get your intention.   The photo itself is not bad, the BW makes it somewhat striking and the naked lady certainly grabs my attention.  If this was a bit of fetish play, seems there would be more clues to what has happened. 3</td>', 'Silenced? I''m not sure I get your intention.   The photo itself is not bad, the BW makes it somewhat striking and the naked lady certainly grabs my attention.  If this was a bit of fetish play, seems there would be more clues to what has happened. 3', '2004-03-06 18:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(612036, 63102, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective and close crop and that texture is fascinating.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective and close crop and that texture is fascinating.', '2004-03-06 18:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(612039, 63022, 3087, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t need the title to tell me how it fits, but yes, I can. Nice lighting. None of the verticals seem vertical though.</td>', 'Doesn''t need the title to tell me how it fits, but yes, I can. Nice lighting. None of the verticals seem vertical though.', '2004-03-06 18:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(612040, 63033, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - I''ve never seen a sign like that. I don''t quite understand what denotes a Deaf Child Area - is the sign put up wherever there is one local deaf child? The sign is too close to edge of frame but otherwise I like the image.</td>', 'Nice idea - I''ve never seen a sign like that. I don''t quite understand what denotes a Deaf Child Area - is the sign put up wherever there is one local deaf child? The sign is too close to edge of frame but otherwise I like the image.', '2004-03-06 18:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(612044, 62994, 13305, '<td valign="top">Not that it''s a bad image,  I simply refuse to reward depictions of violence.</td>', 'Not that it''s a bad image,  I simply refuse to reward depictions of violence.', '2004-03-06 18:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(612050, 62492, 13305, '<td valign="top">Having exhausted possibilities in Iran and Iraq, the president and CIA seek other evidence of WMDs.   <br/>I''m not sure what duck feeding has to do with silence, but an interesting photo. 3</td>', 'Having exhausted possibilities in Iran and Iraq, the president and CIA seek other evidence of WMDs.   I''m not sure what duck feeding has to do with silence, but an interesting photo. 3', '2004-03-06 18:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(612054, 63089, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oh god yes.... the calm before the storm, so to speak.</td>', 'Oh god yes.... the calm before the storm, so to speak.', '2004-03-06 18:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(612055, 62271, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shapes, angles, textures, shadows, lines and DOF.</td>', 'Wonderful shapes, angles, textures, shadows, lines and DOF.', '2004-03-06 18:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(612056, 62981, 3087, '<td valign="top">... "there''s no one here but us chickens" ...<br/>Great scene - I wonder if a non-centred composition would be stronger?</td>', '... "there''s no one here but us chickens" ...Great scene - I wonder if a non-centred composition would be stronger?', '2004-03-06 18:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(612058, 62424, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely! And I like the dark background with lighting only on the model. Not sure about the balance of empty space at the top - either more or less would work better I think and also feel it would be more appropriate if she wasn''t partially cropped out.</td>', 'Lovely! And I like the dark background with lighting only on the model. Not sure about the balance of empty space at the top - either more or less would work better I think and also feel it would be more appropriate if she wasn''t partially cropped out.', '2004-03-06 18:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(612060, 62799, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great to capture the moonlight and the artificial houselight so well. I like the red, white and blue colour graduation.</td>', 'Great to capture the moonlight and the artificial houselight so well. I like the red, white and blue colour graduation.', '2004-03-06 18:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(612062, 62338, 3087, '<td valign="top">The pleasures of reading in a quiet, snug corner on a cold winter day... 8</td>', 'The pleasures of reading in a quiet, snug corner on a cold winter day... 8', '2004-03-06 18:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(612063, 62979, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great foreground detail, love the triangular wedge of blue sea and the tree is a simply fascinating subject. For once the empty sky is just perfect for the shot.</td>', 'Great foreground detail, love the triangular wedge of blue sea and the tree is a simply fascinating subject. For once the empty sky is just perfect for the shot.', '2004-03-06 18:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(612064, 62659, 13305, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Less sky and more road.  There is too much stuff at the horizon to convey "Road into silence", make your horizon further away.</td>', 'Interesting. Less sky and more road.  There is too much stuff at the horizon to convey "Road into silence", make your horizon further away.', '2004-03-06 18:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(612065, 62645, 16636, '<td valign="top">great idea but far to grainy  for my liking and it''s a shame all of the plane is not in view</td>', 'great idea but far to grainy  for my liking and it''s a shame all of the plane is not in view', '2004-03-06 18:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(612066, 62761, 13305, '<td valign="top">Not a bad image, but not very original either.</td>', 'Not a bad image, but not very original either.', '2004-03-06 18:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(612067, 62580, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is great - kind of like a slice of history - the decor of the room, the comfy slippers. English grandpa on a quiet Sunday afternoon kind of feel... (though I''m assuming from the paper that this is infact American).</td>', 'This is great - kind of like a slice of history - the decor of the room, the comfy slippers. English grandpa on a quiet Sunday afternoon kind of feel... (though I''m assuming from the paper that this is infact American).', '2004-03-06 18:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(612069, 62956, 3087, '<td valign="top">The silence of waiting... can seem so very long... well captures though colours seem too saturated to me.</td>', 'The silence of waiting... can seem so very long... well captures though colours seem too saturated to me.', '2004-03-06 18:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(612070, 63110, 13305, '<td valign="top">Intersting as an abstract, but I don''t get enough visual information to figure out what this has to do with silence.</td>', 'Intersting as an abstract, but I don''t get enough visual information to figure out what this has to do with silence.', '2004-03-06 18:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(612076, 62245, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is very poignant. Absence = silence - a permanent, jarring silence. A beautifully simple image with such a depth of feeling. I like the choice to make the bearer anonymous.</td>', 'This is very poignant. Absence = silence - a permanent, jarring silence. A beautifully simple image with such a depth of feeling. I like the choice to make the bearer anonymous.', '2004-03-06 18:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(612077, 62683, 13305, '<td valign="top">Not bad. The BW makes the moment more poignant.  My problem is, that this seems to imply violence, and I''m not rewarding violence with high ratings. 3</td>', 'Not bad. The BW makes the moment more poignant.  My problem is, that this seems to imply violence, and I''m not rewarding violence with high ratings. 3', '2004-03-06 18:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(612078, 62424, 13305, '<td valign="top">Cute kid,  the border distracts me more than adding to the photo.  A little more background detail would make the photo look less posed. Like what''s she trying to keep us quiet about.</td>', 'Cute kid,  the border distracts me more than adding to the photo.  A little more background detail would make the photo look less posed. Like what''s she trying to keep us quiet about.', '2004-03-06 18:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(612080, 62958, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is arresting - the choice to include so much empty wall really works well. I''m not sure about the looming shadow at top left but perhaps it adds contrast. The vivid colours of the window frame and blind are quite startling.</td>', 'This is arresting - the choice to include so much empty wall really works well. I''m not sure about the looming shadow at top left but perhaps it adds contrast. The vivid colours of the window frame and blind are quite startling.', '2004-03-06 18:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(612082, 63127, 13305, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, good exposure, good skin tones.  The border neither adds or distracts.  A better composition might be include the person holding the child sleeping also.</td>', 'Cute kid, good exposure, good skin tones.  The border neither adds or distracts.  A better composition might be include the person holding the child sleeping also.', '2004-03-06 19:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(612083, 62386, 3087, '<td valign="top">Does feel very desolate, like the black and white. Feels a bit too centred to me - maybe spin to your left a touch so the bin and light are further right in the frame?</td>', 'Does feel very desolate, like the black and white. Feels a bit too centred to me - maybe spin to your left a touch so the bin and light are further right in the frame?', '2004-03-06 19:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(612084, 62970, 13305, '<td valign="top">Beautiful panorama, but you''re trying to tell me this is silent? Composition, more foreground and less sky.  5</td>', 'Beautiful panorama, but you''re trying to tell me this is silent? Composition, more foreground and less sky.  5', '2004-03-06 19:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(612085, 62927, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fascinating environment - a real abstract of lines, colours and textures - and amidst it all a lone, slumped figure looking absolutely worn out or dejected. Only negative is that the large white wall is somewhat overpowering next to the other blocks of blue and grey.</td>', 'Fascinating environment - a real abstract of lines, colours and textures - and amidst it all a lone, slumped figure looking absolutely worn out or dejected. Only negative is that the large white wall is somewhat overpowering next to the other blocks of blue and grey.', '2004-03-06 19:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(612087, 63081, 5891, '<td valign="top">a difficult shot well captured</td>', 'a difficult shot well captured', '2004-03-06 19:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(612088, 63128, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Lighting feels rather uneven - strongest on her cheek and neck - perhaps needs to be positioned differently and slightly diffused, though harsh does fit with content.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Lighting feels rather uneven - strongest on her cheek and neck - perhaps needs to be positioned differently and slightly diffused, though harsh does fit with content.', '2004-03-06 19:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
