(612442, 63074, 3746, '<td valign="top">A beautifully thought out picture, it really captures the fraustration we all must feel living in a world of silence and hopelessness. The stark contrast between the subject and the background is a parallel between the fight that we, as people, must undertake daily just to try and make it through our traumatic lives, this picture really touches me on many levels.. I think I am going to cry.. I have to give this a ten...<br/> <br/>Actually, on second thoughts its a potato without a mouth.. have a three instead.    marksimms</td>', 'A beautifully thought out picture, it really captures the fraustration we all must feel living in a world of silence and hopelessness. The stark contrast between the subject and the background is a parallel between the fight that we, as people, must undertake daily just to try and make it through our traumatic lives, this picture really touches me on many levels.. I think I am going to cry.. I have to give this a ten... Actually, on second thoughts its a potato without a mouth.. have a three instead.    marksimms', '2004-03-07 03:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
