(612656, 62998, 3087, '<td valign="top">One can certainly understand the silent contemplation - and the silence of absence of the deceased. The circles of the wreaths give added visual interest. It''s minor but I do feel that the umbrella shouldn''t be cropped by the edge of the frame. If it were completely included, it would feel more like she''s 100% in this situation, in this little snapshot of time, instead that escaping umbrella is a link to what''s outside the frame. I know that''s weird but I think having the key subject wholly enclosed by the frame would benefit the strength of the message.</td>', 'One can certainly understand the silent contemplation - and the silence of absence of the deceased. The circles of the wreaths give added visual interest. It''s minor but I do feel that the umbrella shouldn''t be cropped by the edge of the frame. If it were completely included, it would feel more like she''s 100% in this situation, in this little snapshot of time, instead that escaping umbrella is a link to what''s outside the frame. I know that''s weird but I think having the key subject wholly enclosed by the frame would benefit the strength of the message.', '2004-03-07 10:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
