(612670, 63080, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and the fisher''s lone silhouette really conveys solitude.</td>', 'Nice composition, and the fisher''s lone silhouette really conveys solitude.', '2004-03-07 10:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(612671, 62594, 12857, '<td valign="top">GREAT SHOT,  NICE COLORS.  FITS THE CHALLENGE. <br/>DC</td>', 'GREAT SHOT,  NICE COLORS.  FITS THE CHALLENGE. DC', '2004-03-07 10:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(612672, 63018, 12857, '<td valign="top">THIS ALMOST DOESNT LOOK REAL.   THE SCALE AND DIVISION OF THE PHOTO IS PERFECT!!</td>', 'THIS ALMOST DOESNT LOOK REAL.   THE SCALE AND DIVISION OF THE PHOTO IS PERFECT!!', '2004-03-07 10:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(612673, 62288, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like a painting - the shades of white and palest blue are very calming. Like the eye contact.</td>', 'Like a painting - the shades of white and palest blue are very calming. Like the eye contact.', '2004-03-07 10:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(612674, 62488, 12857, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL SHOT.  FOR ME NOT HAVING A SINGLE RIPPLE ON THE WATER PORTRAYS THE SILENCE.</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL SHOT.  FOR ME NOT HAVING A SINGLE RIPPLE ON THE WATER PORTRAYS THE SILENCE.', '2004-03-07 10:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(612675, 62301, 3087, '<td valign="top">The leading lines and patterns of the clean white stones are very striking. The composition feels balanced by the position of the tallest tree off to one side, weighted further by the fir next to it. The sky has enough texture to add interest. Black and white really enhances this image.</td>', 'The leading lines and patterns of the clean white stones are very striking. The composition feels balanced by the position of the tallest tree off to one side, weighted further by the fir next to it. The sky has enough texture to add interest. Black and white really enhances this image.', '2004-03-07 10:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(612678, 63014, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea... the lighting seems too strong though - I would prefer if the clear handle was more firmly defined by light/ shadow. Would also prefer if the pacifier were either more accurately centred or more obviously off-centre within the composition.</td>', 'Nice idea... the lighting seems too strong though - I would prefer if the clear handle was more firmly defined by light/ shadow. Would also prefer if the pacifier were either more accurately centred or more obviously off-centre within the composition.', '2004-03-07 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(612679, 63094, 12857, '<td valign="top">THE SCALE MADE THIS WORK.  GREAT JOB  8 <br/>DC</td>', 'THE SCALE MADE THIS WORK.  GREAT JOB  8 DC', '2004-03-07 10:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(612682, 62385, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like the mood of this image, created by the lighting and the reflections of it upon damp stonework. In terms of composition it''s the right hand side that holds all the interest for me and I prefer the image overall once a good third or more of the image has been chopped off from the left.</td>', 'I really like the mood of this image, created by the lighting and the reflections of it upon damp stonework. In terms of composition it''s the right hand side that holds all the interest for me and I prefer the image overall once a good third or more of the image has been chopped off from the left.', '2004-03-07 10:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(612684, 62544, 3087, '<td valign="top">Conveys emptiness, solitude, a quietness that is full of sorrow rather than peace and relaxation. Black and white definitely enhances that perception. The textures of the wood, metal and ground are nicely captured.</td>', 'Conveys emptiness, solitude, a quietness that is full of sorrow rather than peace and relaxation. Black and white definitely enhances that perception. The textures of the wood, metal and ground are nicely captured.', '2004-03-07 10:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(612686, 62387, 3087, '<td valign="top">Whilst I do sometimes like the mood that harsh lighting can add to an image, I think it''s overdone in this case. I do like the composition - the angle of his face and finger and the cropping choice work well.</td>', 'Whilst I do sometimes like the mood that harsh lighting can add to an image, I think it''s overdone in this case. I do like the composition - the angle of his face and finger and the cropping choice work well.', '2004-03-07 10:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(612689, 62248, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the sodden, abandoned papers. Although the textures and lines of the surrounding paving and bin are interesting I think I''d prefer to see a closer study of that fascinating texture within the main subject - I''d like to see an image zooming in on that detail.</td>', 'I like the sodden, abandoned papers. Although the textures and lines of the surrounding paving and bin are interesting I think I''d prefer to see a closer study of that fascinating texture within the main subject - I''d like to see an image zooming in on that detail.', '2004-03-07 10:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(612690, 62239, 15919, '<td valign="top">Well lit but seems litle out of focus or blurred</td>', 'Well lit but seems litle out of focus or blurred', '2004-03-07 10:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(612691, 62599, 3087, '<td valign="top">Overkill on blue toning... doesn''t add a thing for me, actually it detracts. Image otherwise is strong.</td>', 'Overkill on blue toning... doesn''t add a thing for me, actually it detracts. Image otherwise is strong.', '2004-03-07 10:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(612692, 63107, 1570, '<td valign="top">i like the picture but not the idea of a cute little dawggy wearing a muzzle... i do hope you only use(d) it as a photographic prop... nice black and white, nice composition, conveys emotion well... 8.<br/></td>', 'i like the picture but not the idea of a cute little dawggy wearing a muzzle... i do hope you only use(d) it as a photographic prop... nice black and white, nice composition, conveys emotion well... 8.', '2004-03-07 10:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(612694, 63113, 3087, '<td valign="top">A great subject and certainly makes one wonder about the story behind it but isn''t presented very creatively - visually there is little impact to the image.</td>', 'A great subject and certainly makes one wonder about the story behind it but isn''t presented very creatively - visually there is little impact to the image.', '2004-03-07 10:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(612695, 62932, 3087, '<td valign="top">Certainly very on message but not a particularly appealing image.</td>', 'Certainly very on message but not a particularly appealing image.', '2004-03-07 10:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(612696, 62389, 3087, '<td valign="top">An abandoned picnic table, which was once surrounded by the happy laughter and chatter of family picnic antics... black and white certainly helps convey the sense of age.</td>', 'An abandoned picnic table, which was once surrounded by the happy laughter and chatter of family picnic antics... black and white certainly helps convey the sense of age.', '2004-03-07 10:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(612699, 63107, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition in terms of darkness of ears, eyes, muzzle, nose and shadows.</td>', 'Beautiful composition in terms of darkness of ears, eyes, muzzle, nose and shadows.', '2004-03-07 10:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(612700, 62842, 2780, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo, I sure hope this is the winner and that people don''t vote it down for "gross" factor.  10</td>', 'Amazing photo, I sure hope this is the winner and that people don''t vote it down for "gross" factor.  10', '2004-03-07 10:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(612701, 62909, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hard-hitting, gritty, almost reportage style. Very good choice to go black and white.</td>', 'Hard-hitting, gritty, almost reportage style. Very good choice to go black and white.', '2004-03-07 10:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(612702, 63115, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''m not a religious person but this image certainly helps convey how the splendour of one''s surroundings can inspire one to greater intensity of worship.</td>', 'I''m not a religious person but this image certainly helps convey how the splendour of one''s surroundings can inspire one to greater intensity of worship.', '2004-03-07 10:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(612706, 62239, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic example of when not to focus. Great shot, 10.</td>', 'This is a fantastic example of when not to focus. Great shot, 10.', '2004-03-07 10:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(612709, 62683, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hard-hitting, gritty, reportage style. Black and white work well.</td>', 'Hard-hitting, gritty, reportage style. Black and white work well.', '2004-03-07 10:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(612710, 63053, 3087, '<td valign="top">Focus seems too soft. Content is great - I can imagine it''s a quiet kind of life staying in one of these isolated cabins.</td>', 'Focus seems too soft. Content is great - I can imagine it''s a quiet kind of life staying in one of these isolated cabins.', '2004-03-07 10:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(612711, 62893, 3087, '<td valign="top">I think this would benefit from a square composition - take off the left hand side so you''re cropping in to touch his head. There is still detail and texture from the wire fence behind his left shoulder but composition seems stronger.</td>', 'I think this would benefit from a square composition - take off the left hand side so you''re cropping in to touch his head. There is still detail and texture from the wire fence behind his left shoulder but composition seems stronger.', '2004-03-07 10:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(612713, 63121, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo for the challenge. 10</td>', 'Excellent photo for the challenge. 10', '2004-03-07 11:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(612715, 63099, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. It has that ''kosmikkreeper-style'' to it, which means it will probably place :) - 10</td>', 'Excellent photo. It has that ''kosmikkreeper-style'' to it, which means it will probably place :) - 10', '2004-03-07 11:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(612717, 62361, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great photo, The gradient of colours work really well and I like the centered composition. 10</td>', 'Great photo, The gradient of colours work really well and I like the centered composition. 10', '2004-03-07 11:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(612718, 62813, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot, 10</td>', 'Great shot, 10', '2004-03-07 11:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(612719, 62253, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture with really good composition and DoF too. 10</td>', 'This is a great capture with really good composition and DoF too. 10', '2004-03-07 11:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(612721, 63085, 10634, '<td valign="top">Depth of Field is off... pin needs to be sharper. Good idea and attempt, though... 5</td>', 'Depth of Field is off... pin needs to be sharper. Good idea and attempt, though... 5', '2004-03-07 11:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(612722, 62986, 10634, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot and I can see where you are coming from with the silence, but it just doesn''t Say silence to me... 5</td>', 'Very nice shot and I can see where you are coming from with the silence, but it just doesn''t Say silence to me... 5', '2004-03-07 11:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(612723, 62842, 10634, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, different perspective, nicely done... 9</td>', 'Very nice shot, different perspective, nicely done... 9', '2004-03-07 11:08:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(612724, 62956, 10634, '<td valign="top">A good idea done well... 9</td>', 'A good idea done well... 9', '2004-03-07 11:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(612725, 63121, 10634, '<td valign="top">Unique, attractive and technically perfect...9</td>', 'Unique, attractive and technically perfect...9', '2004-03-07 11:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(612726, 63064, 10634, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture... 9</td>', 'Beautiful capture... 9', '2004-03-07 11:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(612727, 62360, 10634, '<td valign="top">Unique idea, well done... 9</td>', 'Unique idea, well done... 9', '2004-03-07 11:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(612728, 62853, 10634, '<td valign="top">nice idea... 7</td>', 'nice idea... 7', '2004-03-07 11:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(612730, 63064, 3087, '<td valign="top">Focus too soft but like that hammock - a good place to find a bit of quiet...</td>', 'Focus too soft but like that hammock - a good place to find a bit of quiet...', '2004-03-07 11:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(612733, 62847, 3087, '<td valign="top">There''s another entry with a more spectacular sunset, with added interest from the silhouette of land and the inclusion of the sun. But that one is let down for me by the inclusion of a powered motor boat - not my idea of silence. Your image implies a more peaceful, silent journey, but for me, is let down by weak composition, tilted horizon and lack of additional interest. I''m also not sure that the centred position of the boat is the strongest choice.</td>', 'There''s another entry with a more spectacular sunset, with added interest from the silhouette of land and the inclusion of the sun. But that one is let down for me by the inclusion of a powered motor boat - not my idea of silence. Your image implies a more peaceful, silent journey, but for me, is let down by weak composition, tilted horizon and lack of additional interest. I''m also not sure that the centred position of the boat is the strongest choice.', '2004-03-07 11:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(612737, 62645, 13937, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I like the concept, but would like to see a cleaner image.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I like the concept, but would like to see a cleaner image.', '2004-03-07 11:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(612739, 62806, 13937, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a little less contrast on this image.  Your losing detail in the face and the props.</td>', 'I would like to see a little less contrast on this image.  Your losing detail in the face and the props.', '2004-03-07 11:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(612741, 62357, 13937, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but I would have liked to see a different background here.  The black seems to take over the entire image.</td>', 'This is a good idea, but I would have liked to see a different background here.  The black seems to take over the entire image.', '2004-03-07 11:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(612742, 62993, 13937, '<td valign="top">A nice, cozy idea.  Would like to see a little brighter image, though.  Just enough to bring in some detail on the couple.</td>', 'A nice, cozy idea.  Would like to see a little brighter image, though.  Just enough to bring in some detail on the couple.', '2004-03-07 11:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(612744, 63105, 3087, '<td valign="top">Kind of noir except it''s so blue! Very strange but certainly fascinating...</td>', 'Kind of noir except it''s so blue! Very strange but certainly fascinating...', '2004-03-07 11:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(612745, 62790, 3087, '<td valign="top">A peaceful bench on which to sit and contemplate - the composition works very well - the loose, natural shape of the bush really balances the highly detailed, solid arches. Don''t like border though.</td>', 'A peaceful bench on which to sit and contemplate - the composition works very well - the loose, natural shape of the bush really balances the highly detailed, solid arches. Don''t like border though.', '2004-03-07 11:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(612746, 62667, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice leading lines. However image feels tilted to the right. Sky is just too large an expanse of bland white for me. Good choice to go black and white.</td>', 'Nice leading lines. However image feels tilted to the right. Sky is just too large an expanse of bland white for me. Good choice to go black and white.', '2004-03-07 11:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(612747, 62899, 13937, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Your composition needs some work here.  Try putting the man in the lower left of the image so he has somewhere to walk to in the image.  Also the image is a little dark.</td>', 'Good idea.  Your composition needs some work here.  Try putting the man in the lower left of the image so he has somewhere to walk to in the image.  Also the image is a little dark.', '2004-03-07 11:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(612748, 62495, 3087, '<td valign="top">Feels rather skewed - verticals need to be more vertical. I like the rays of light filtering through onto her forehead.</td>', 'Feels rather skewed - verticals need to be more vertical. I like the rays of light filtering through onto her forehead.', '2004-03-07 11:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(612749, 63036, 3087, '<td valign="top">Gravestones striking but seem overexposed - yet tree trunks are so dark - perhaps taken at a time of day when the lighting was too harsh. Compositionally not very strong - the position of the trees within the frame doesn''t add to the image - why was it taken from this exact viewpoint? would turning a few degrees in one direction provide stronger shapes/ balance? What about getting lower down nearer the ground?</td>', 'Gravestones striking but seem overexposed - yet tree trunks are so dark - perhaps taken at a time of day when the lighting was too harsh. Compositionally not very strong - the position of the trees within the frame doesn''t add to the image - why was it taken from this exact viewpoint? would turning a few degrees in one direction provide stronger shapes/ balance? What about getting lower down nearer the ground?', '2004-03-07 11:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(612750, 62989, 13937, '<td valign="top">Nice image well composed.  Color balance is a little off.  image is a little too warm.</td>', 'Nice image well composed.  Color balance is a little off.  image is a little too warm.', '2004-03-07 11:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(612752, 62659, 3087, '<td valign="top">Certainly a strong leading line - I''d find the image more interesting if I could see more clearly where it lead to, although I appreciate that the fact it leads into a mist-shrouded distance is how it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Certainly a strong leading line - I''d find the image more interesting if I could see more clearly where it lead to, although I appreciate that the fact it leads into a mist-shrouded distance is how it meets the challenge.', '2004-03-07 11:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(612755, 62558, 13937, '<td valign="top">I like this, but would like to see the ladder off to the left of the image instead of in the center of the image.</td>', 'I like this, but would like to see the ladder off to the left of the image instead of in the center of the image.', '2004-03-07 11:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(612756, 63098, 3087, '<td valign="top">Too blue, too tilted, too over saturated in colour but an interesting set of textures.</td>', 'Too blue, too tilted, too over saturated in colour but an interesting set of textures.', '2004-03-07 11:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(612757, 63091, 13937, '<td valign="top">This has a nice, haunting feel to it.  It looks a little soft, though.</td>', 'This has a nice, haunting feel to it.  It looks a little soft, though.', '2004-03-07 11:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(612758, 62879, 18169, '<td valign="top">Love the picture, puts one at ease.</td>', 'Love the picture, puts one at ease.', '2004-03-07 11:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(612759, 62485, 18169, '<td valign="top">Blurry</td>', 'Blurry', '2004-03-07 11:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(612760, 62779, 13937, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I''m not sure I like the coloring of the image though.  Looks a little yellow.</td>', 'Good idea.  I''m not sure I like the coloring of the image though.  Looks a little yellow.', '2004-03-07 11:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(612762, 62862, 13937, '<td valign="top">A different interpretation of the challenge.  A Nice creative idea witha pretty powerful message.  Good composition.  The lighting could be better.  I''d like to see more light on the subjects faces.</td>', 'A different interpretation of the challenge.  A Nice creative idea witha pretty powerful message.  Good composition.  The lighting could be better.  I''d like to see more light on the subjects faces.', '2004-03-07 11:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(612763, 62667, 13937, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, Nice leading lines.  Looks like your comera is tilted, though.  Everything is leaning to the right in the image.</td>', 'Nice composition, Nice leading lines.  Looks like your comera is tilted, though.  Everything is leaning to the right in the image.', '2004-03-07 11:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(612764, 62902, 3087, '<td valign="top">Seems like the house/ stairways are more important than the subject who is cropped off and almost incidental.</td>', 'Seems like the house/ stairways are more important than the subject who is cropped off and almost incidental.', '2004-03-07 11:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(612766, 62220, 13937, '<td valign="top">INteresting interpretation of the challenge. Definately a peaceful image.  I''m not sure about your composition, though.  I think I would rather see the flame lower in the image.</td>', 'INteresting interpretation of the challenge. Definately a peaceful image.  I''m not sure about your composition, though.  I think I would rather see the flame lower in the image.', '2004-03-07 11:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(612767, 62986, 13937, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  I like the color.  I wuld like to see the swings a little lower in the image, though.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  I like the color.  I wuld like to see the swings a little lower in the image, though.', '2004-03-07 12:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(612768, 62308, 13937, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  I would like to see the fence line a little higher in the image, though.</td>', 'Very nice image.  I would like to see the fence line a little higher in the image, though.', '2004-03-07 12:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(612769, 63029, 13937, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept for this challenge.  I like the lighting and the composition.  I would like to see the image a little sharper, though.</td>', 'Interesting concept for this challenge.  I like the lighting and the composition.  I would like to see the image a little sharper, though.', '2004-03-07 12:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(612779, 62844, 16962, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, I like the light, sky, and trees pointin up in the background.  Mayve the tombstone is a bit too spotlighted.</td>', 'Neat shot, I like the light, sky, and trees pointin up in the background.  Mayve the tombstone is a bit too spotlighted.', '2004-03-07 12:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(612781, 62852, 16962, '<td valign="top">The lines in front are interesting, but maybe distracting.  I like the foot poking out.</td>', 'The lines in front are interesting, but maybe distracting.  I like the foot poking out.', '2004-03-07 12:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(612783, 63102, 16962, '<td valign="top">I like the frame and texture, nothing really grabs me much though.</td>', 'I like the frame and texture, nothing really grabs me much though.', '2004-03-07 12:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(612785, 62291, 16962, '<td valign="top">I like the camoflauge look, that and silence is their protection.</td>', 'I like the camoflauge look, that and silence is their protection.', '2004-03-07 12:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
