(612882, 62813, 17228, '<td valign="top">So YOU"RE the one they got the idea for that movie!  ;)   Nice work on the moth cutout, my only suggestion would be to use a black felt marker on the dark edges of the cutout to hide the white paper edge (bottom left of the moth''s abdomen. Paper sculturists do this all the time to hid the color of the paper on the edges). Perhaps that''s not the edge of the paper, but rather something you chose to include in the cutout? Either way, it makes the moth actually LOOK like it''s a cutout rather than realistic, which the rest of the moth really has going for it. A small critique to be sure, but I think it would have added to the "mystique" and seamless look of a very cool photo.  :)</td>', 'So YOU"RE the one they got the idea for that movie!  ;)   Nice work on the moth cutout, my only suggestion would be to use a black felt marker on the dark edges of the cutout to hide the white paper edge (bottom left of the moth''s abdomen. Paper sculturists do this all the time to hid the color of the paper on the edges). Perhaps that''s not the edge of the paper, but rather something you chose to include in the cutout? Either way, it makes the moth actually LOOK like it''s a cutout rather than realistic, which the rest of the moth really has going for it. A small critique to be sure, but I think it would have added to the "mystique" and seamless look of a very cool photo.  :)', '2004-03-07 14:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(612883, 62594, 15506, '<td valign="top">Love the composition.  Certainly looks quiet</td>', 'Love the composition.  Certainly looks quiet', '2004-03-07 14:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(612887, 62848, 13305, '<td valign="top">The definition of music is "Sound in time."  Good take on the challenge. Composition, (I) would include a hand with pen prepared to write.   Good photo. 8</td>', 'The definition of music is "Sound in time."  Good take on the challenge. Composition, (I) would include a hand with pen prepared to write.   Good photo. 8', '2004-03-07 14:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
