(612904, 63033, 13305, '<td valign="top">Poignant. Good take on the challenge, I think a little more contrast on the boy in relation to the background might give a little more impact, but that''s pretty minor.  10 You get my vote for best of competition.</td>', 'Poignant. Good take on the challenge, I think a little more contrast on the boy in relation to the background might give a little more impact, but that''s pretty minor.  10 You get my vote for best of competition.', '2004-03-07 15:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(612906, 62253, 17228, '<td valign="top">Great shot for wildlife theme, but as for silence, just looking at the picture without your title would give me no clue as to anything having to do with silence. Judging only from the picture, I can only assume that the "silent prey" is the SNOW???  ;)   There''s really no evidence to say otherwise unfortunately.  Don''t get me wrong, it''s a great action shot of an arctic fox, it''s just not an image that you can say, "I get a feeling of quiet/silence from this photo," even if it were merely named "UNTITLED". Keep up the good work.  :)</td>', 'Great shot for wildlife theme, but as for silence, just looking at the picture without your title would give me no clue as to anything having to do with silence. Judging only from the picture, I can only assume that the "silent prey" is the SNOW???  ;)   There''s really no evidence to say otherwise unfortunately.  Don''t get me wrong, it''s a great action shot of an arctic fox, it''s just not an image that you can say, "I get a feeling of quiet/silence from this photo," even if it were merely named "UNTITLED". Keep up the good work.  :)', '2004-03-07 15:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(612908, 63119, 17228, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and cool sepia tone. Yep, that car looks pretty much silent, alrighty!  Would have liked to see some different composition/angles possibly.  :)</td>', 'Nice shot and cool sepia tone. Yep, that car looks pretty much silent, alrighty!  Would have liked to see some different composition/angles possibly.  :)', '2004-03-07 15:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(612913, 62688, 17228, '<td valign="top">The subject of the shot are the headstones, so the trees at the top are distracting from that goal, crop ''em.  With only the headstones now left, my attention is drawn to the grave with the flowers, but it''s too far away to actually be the subject. You could either shoot that in the foreground, leaving the non-decorated headstones as background, or just shoot all non-decorated headstones with no emphasis on any of theme. Right now there''s nothing special about the closest headstone which might have been your focal point. B&amp;W could also help with the overall mood you''re trying to capture. Just my opinion, it''s free, so it for what''s it''s worth.  ;)</td>', 'The subject of the shot are the headstones, so the trees at the top are distracting from that goal, crop ''em.  With only the headstones now left, my attention is drawn to the grave with the flowers, but it''s too far away to actually be the subject. You could either shoot that in the foreground, leaving the non-decorated headstones as background, or just shoot all non-decorated headstones with no emphasis on any of theme. Right now there''s nothing special about the closest headstone which might have been your focal point. B&W could also help with the overall mood you''re trying to capture. Just my opinion, it''s free, so it for what''s it''s worth.  ;)', '2004-03-07 15:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(612914, 62712, 12131, '<td valign="top">Did you keep a straight face?  Good subject matter.</td>', 'Did you keep a straight face?  Good subject matter.', '2004-03-07 15:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(612915, 63124, 12131, '<td valign="top">If fits the challenge and I understand the image but it seems a little busy.  Theres a carpet and a reflection to say it''s indoors, another reflection and little twigish things to say it''s outdoors and the plug to show that you''ve silenced the beast.  It has me curious.  Nice, if a little confusing.</td>', 'If fits the challenge and I understand the image but it seems a little busy.  Theres a carpet and a reflection to say it''s indoors, another reflection and little twigish things to say it''s outdoors and the plug to show that you''ve silenced the beast.  It has me curious.  Nice, if a little confusing.', '2004-03-07 15:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(612916, 62427, 12131, '<td valign="top">That couch reminds me of the huge cushy chairs in our library.  I want to go there now and just take a nap.  Bad idea with a test coming up.  Looks quiet indeed.</td>', 'That couch reminds me of the huge cushy chairs in our library.  I want to go there now and just take a nap.  Bad idea with a test coming up.  Looks quiet indeed.', '2004-03-07 15:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(612917, 62385, 12131, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot.  Love the lighting and the tone.  Angle''s not bad either, it would almost work for off-screen expectation.</td>', 'Gorgeous shot.  Love the lighting and the tone.  Angle''s not bad either, it would almost work for off-screen expectation.', '2004-03-07 15:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(612919, 62449, 12131, '<td valign="top">That is a spooky image.  The snow deadens out sound even in my mind.</td>', 'That is a spooky image.  The snow deadens out sound even in my mind.', '2004-03-07 15:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(612920, 63033, 17228, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Wish the child was either looking toward camera or 3/4 pose looking off in thought. Lots of distracting elements in background. Shallow DOF would have helped to focus attention back to the subject of the shot, the boy and sign. Keep nearby tree on right out of frame, competes with vertical line of sign. A lower angle (child''s height) might have worked well here, too.  Liked your choice of B&amp;W here, try and edit for greater contrast and  impact. Keep it up!  :)</td>', 'Good idea. Wish the child was either looking toward camera or 3/4 pose looking off in thought. Lots of distracting elements in background. Shallow DOF would have helped to focus attention back to the subject of the shot, the boy and sign. Keep nearby tree on right out of frame, competes with vertical line of sign. A lower angle (child''s height) might have worked well here, too.  Liked your choice of B&W here, try and edit for greater contrast and  impact. Keep it up!  :)', '2004-03-07 15:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(612921, 63038, 12131, '<td valign="top">I wish swans were kind enough to let us pet them, this one looks so soft.  Beautiful lighting.  The water looks welcoming and calming.</td>', 'I wish swans were kind enough to let us pet them, this one looks so soft.  Beautiful lighting.  The water looks welcoming and calming.', '2004-03-07 15:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(612922, 62441, 14487, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea, I like the whole single color theme.  But the quality of the image is poor.</td>', 'This is a cool idea, I like the whole single color theme.  But the quality of the image is poor.', '2004-03-07 15:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(612923, 63049, 14487, '<td valign="top">This feels more like a general landscape shot than something for the theme silence.  But it''s done quite well.  I like how the trees frame the lift and the mountains in the background.</td>', 'This feels more like a general landscape shot than something for the theme silence.  But it''s done quite well.  I like how the trees frame the lift and the mountains in the background.', '2004-03-07 15:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(612925, 62662, 14487, '<td valign="top">Hey!  A non-monotone graveyard shot!  And it''s done quite well.  I love the way it conveys the feeling of death without depression...sort of a peaceful end.  You also managed to include the sun quite elegantly.  I''m not sure everyone will appreciate this shot, but it''s one of my favorites.</td>', 'Hey!  A non-monotone graveyard shot!  And it''s done quite well.  I love the way it conveys the feeling of death without depression...sort of a peaceful end.  You also managed to include the sun quite elegantly.  I''m not sure everyone will appreciate this shot, but it''s one of my favorites.', '2004-03-07 15:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(612926, 62503, 9668, '<td valign="top">Horizon is tilted, colors are excellent.</td>', 'Horizon is tilted, colors are excellent.', '2004-03-07 15:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(612928, 62477, 9668, '<td valign="top">Very cool, love the rainbow of books, did you have to stack those all up?</td>', 'Very cool, love the rainbow of books, did you have to stack those all up?', '2004-03-07 15:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(612929, 62310, 9668, '<td valign="top">Trash in the background is distracting. Excellent action capture.</td>', 'Trash in the background is distracting. Excellent action capture.', '2004-03-07 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(612930, 63001, 17228, '<td valign="top">Not much to catch viewer''s attention here. Really could use a focal point/subject. Treadmarks in sand/mud seem to be what''s in focus here with your extremely shallow DOF. They seem to dirty up the landscape rather than serve a purpose (lead the eye to any point of interest in the picture or make/take an interesting angle(diagonal) or shape(curve, S-shape) in the sand/mud. Find a single set of treadmarks, get down lower, greater DOF, and reduce visual clutter as much as possible. Keep on clickin''!  :)</td>', 'Not much to catch viewer''s attention here. Really could use a focal point/subject. Treadmarks in sand/mud seem to be what''s in focus here with your extremely shallow DOF. They seem to dirty up the landscape rather than serve a purpose (lead the eye to any point of interest in the picture or make/take an interesting angle(diagonal) or shape(curve, S-shape) in the sand/mud. Find a single set of treadmarks, get down lower, greater DOF, and reduce visual clutter as much as possible. Keep on clickin''!  :)', '2004-03-07 15:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(612931, 62477, 12827, '<td valign="top">I love the color proggession!  It fades to like a surreal effect.  I can''t stop looking at!<br/></td>', 'I love the color proggession!  It fades to like a surreal effect.  I can''t stop looking at!', '2004-03-07 15:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(612932, 63065, 9668, '<td valign="top">Sorry, doesn''t appeal to me. Composition seems a little wierd. The shirt is distracting to me. Just my opinion. I like the idea of it, I like the blur of her writing it and how it is mid action.</td>', 'Sorry, doesn''t appeal to me. Composition seems a little wierd. The shirt is distracting to me. Just my opinion. I like the idea of it, I like the blur of her writing it and how it is mid action.', '2004-03-07 15:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(612933, 62408, 9668, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Don''t get why it is in blue, maybe gives it more of a night/secritve look. Nice composition.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Don''t get why it is in blue, maybe gives it more of a night/secritve look. Nice composition.', '2004-03-07 16:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(612935, 62387, 9668, '<td valign="top">Exposer seems off, seems out of focus, I like the idea and story(guessing) behind it.</td>', 'Exposer seems off, seems out of focus, I like the idea and story(guessing) behind it.', '2004-03-07 16:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(612936, 62925, 17228, '<td valign="top">Kinda spooky picture. Makes the viewer wonder, "What the heck?!?!"  I''m not sure what your goal was here, but the face seems to be, well, FACELESS. Was that an accident or planned? Either way I like it''s potential. NO SHIRT, NO SERVICE....  NO FACE, NO SOUND. Would have liked to see gray cloth on right turned to complete black. A little rim/bounce lighting on left side of head to help detail/outline of hair. Slight lighting/detail on face keeps it from going into total darkness, which is what I''d have liked. Now, if all of this is not what you intended, ignore everything I''ve just said!  ;)    Keept it up!  :)</td>', 'Kinda spooky picture. Makes the viewer wonder, "What the heck?!?!"  I''m not sure what your goal was here, but the face seems to be, well, FACELESS. Was that an accident or planned? Either way I like it''s potential. NO SHIRT, NO SERVICE....  NO FACE, NO SOUND. Would have liked to see gray cloth on right turned to complete black. A little rim/bounce lighting on left side of head to help detail/outline of hair. Slight lighting/detail on face keeps it from going into total darkness, which is what I''d have liked. Now, if all of this is not what you intended, ignore everything I''ve just said!  ;)    Keept it up!  :)', '2004-03-07 16:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(612938, 63060, 9668, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t portray silence to me. I can see it as a morning road. Probably would have done better in the Signs challenge.</td>', 'Doesn''t portray silence to me. I can see it as a morning road. Probably would have done better in the Signs challenge.', '2004-03-07 16:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(612941, 62769, 17228, '<td valign="top">Chopped off subject (lamp). Not sure what''s going on here or if this has anything to do with silence in the photographer''s mind, but it''s sure lost me!  :)</td>', 'Chopped off subject (lamp). Not sure what''s going on here or if this has anything to do with silence in the photographer''s mind, but it''s sure lost me!  :)', '2004-03-07 16:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(612943, 62249, 17228, '<td valign="top">Subject''s silhouettes are lost in shadow of horizon. Can''t make out anything below skyline. Not sure if it''s my monitor or photographers that needs calibration!  :)</td>', 'Subject''s silhouettes are lost in shadow of horizon. Can''t make out anything below skyline. Not sure if it''s my monitor or photographers that needs calibration!  :)', '2004-03-07 16:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(612947, 62365, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the light white, peaceful look, well done!</td>', 'I like the light white, peaceful look, well done!', '2004-03-07 16:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(612948, 62688, 4008, '<td valign="top">A good job in chosing the endless gray rows with the position of the  two graves with the flowers and flag. Could maybe have been even stronger, to emphase the huge numbers, by cropping out the trees at the back and/or a slightly tilted point of view.</td>', 'A good job in chosing the endless gray rows with the position of the  two graves with the flowers and flag. Could maybe have been even stronger, to emphase the huge numbers, by cropping out the trees at the back and/or a slightly tilted point of view.', '2004-03-07 16:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(612949, 62357, 12131, '<td valign="top">Good catch.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'Good catch.  Nice lighting.', '2004-03-07 16:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(612950, 62488, 4008, '<td valign="top">Lovely mood, great clouds and reflections, good composition, a slight desaturation of the plants and grass in the front would have made it even better, in my opinion.</td>', 'Lovely mood, great clouds and reflections, good composition, a slight desaturation of the plants and grass in the front would have made it even better, in my opinion.', '2004-03-07 16:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(612951, 62563, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great mood, very graphic image.</td>', 'Great mood, very graphic image.', '2004-03-07 16:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(612952, 62546, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. I might have titled it "escape." It is as if you were looking in on someone life. Doesn''t particulary portray silence but it is still a cool shot.</td>', 'I like this shot. I might have titled it "escape." It is as if you were looking in on someone life. Doesn''t particulary portray silence but it is still a cool shot.', '2004-03-07 16:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(612953, 62895, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of view and the roses alongside the track, but the image looks overprocessed. There are a lot of jagged edges along straight lines, the lighter colors looks strange, almost glowing, and the whole image looks oversaturated. A bit too much of everything.</td>', 'I like the angle of view and the roses alongside the track, but the image looks overprocessed. There are a lot of jagged edges along straight lines, the lighter colors looks strange, almost glowing, and the whole image looks oversaturated. A bit too much of everything.', '2004-03-07 16:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(612954, 62361, 4008, '<td valign="top">great mood, strong image.</td>', 'great mood, strong image.', '2004-03-07 16:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(612955, 62976, 4008, '<td valign="top">Silence ? Great catch, but does not express silence to me.</td>', 'Silence ? Great catch, but does not express silence to me.', '2004-03-07 16:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(612956, 63064, 9668, '<td valign="top">High quality moment, medium quality picture.  Don''t get me wrong, this is a great shot the quality just seems too compressed. Colors are great, and composition.</td>', 'High quality moment, medium quality picture.  Don''t get me wrong, this is a great shot the quality just seems too compressed. Colors are great, and composition.', '2004-03-07 16:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(612957, 62561, 9668, '<td valign="top">The telephone/power pole(?) on the bottom is distracting. Different in green. Nice originality</td>', 'The telephone/power pole(?) on the bottom is distracting. Different in green. Nice originality', '2004-03-07 16:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(612960, 63121, 9668, '<td valign="top">Very original. I expect this to be in the top 10.</td>', 'Very original. I expect this to be in the top 10.', '2004-03-07 16:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(612962, 63120, 7706, '<td valign="top">I like this image, and I do feel that it really does represent this challenge. However it woule look so much nicer if it was a bit larger in size, so you could see more detail.</td>', 'I like this image, and I do feel that it really does represent this challenge. However it woule look so much nicer if it was a bit larger in size, so you could see more detail.', '2004-03-07 16:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(612964, 62979, 9668, '<td valign="top">Too much ground, not enouogh sky. (rule of thirds)<br/>Good shot and theme though.</td>', 'Too much ground, not enouogh sky. (rule of thirds)Good shot and theme though.', '2004-03-07 16:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(612991, 62784, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the stark shapes of the trees, particularly the bare trunks that are missing branches, but I think that composition is weak. There isn''t really an effective focal point and the image doesn''t feel that balanced. The scrub in the foreground also hold much less interest for me than those majestic trees behind it.</td>', 'I like the stark shapes of the trees, particularly the bare trunks that are missing branches, but I think that composition is weak. There isn''t really an effective focal point and the image doesn''t feel that balanced. The scrub in the foreground also hold much less interest for me than those majestic trees behind it.', '2004-03-07 17:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(612993, 63006, 3087, '<td valign="top">Whilst this is an interesting choice of subject matter and you''ve certainly found an unusual viewpoint, as well as ensured that the sunlight is in the right place to help bring out the right colours and details, I find the subject matter essentially doesn''t engage me in a way that makes me want to return and look at the image again and again.</td>', 'Whilst this is an interesting choice of subject matter and you''ve certainly found an unusual viewpoint, as well as ensured that the sunlight is in the right place to help bring out the right colours and details, I find the subject matter essentially doesn''t engage me in a way that makes me want to return and look at the image again and again.', '2004-03-07 17:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(612995, 62905, 3087, '<td valign="top">I do like the strong vertical between black and white and the dynamic shapes of the circular speaker cones. The more free-form curves of the snaking cord contrasts quite well with the more precise lines of the speaker. Doesn''t have an emotional punch for me - something that makes me come back to view it again and again, but it does appeal on a purely visual level.</td>', 'I do like the strong vertical between black and white and the dynamic shapes of the circular speaker cones. The more free-form curves of the snaking cord contrasts quite well with the more precise lines of the speaker. Doesn''t have an emotional punch for me - something that makes me come back to view it again and again, but it does appeal on a purely visual level.', '2004-03-07 17:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(612999, 62654, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and the pose certainly communicates the theme. But I am not connecting with your little bear - it feels a little too clinical and therefore just doesn''t hit me on an emotional level. It is beautifully taken though, nice lighting, framing etc.</td>', 'Great lighting and the pose certainly communicates the theme. But I am not connecting with your little bear - it feels a little too clinical and therefore just doesn''t hit me on an emotional level. It is beautifully taken though, nice lighting, framing etc.', '2004-03-07 17:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(613000, 63107, 10268, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t like the idea behind this picture.  The picture doesn''t really stand out on it''s own.</td>', 'I personally don''t like the idea behind this picture.  The picture doesn''t really stand out on it''s own.', '2004-03-07 17:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(613003, 62875, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of repetition to drive home the huge losses suffered. An absence that must surely feel like a huge, gaping and silent hole. Curious about the choice to photograph this at night, though it certainly provides an interesting change from blue and green. The line of crosses leading into the darkness is intriguing, visually.</td>', 'Great use of repetition to drive home the huge losses suffered. An absence that must surely feel like a huge, gaping and silent hole. Curious about the choice to photograph this at night, though it certainly provides an interesting change from blue and green. The line of crosses leading into the darkness is intriguing, visually.', '2004-03-07 17:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(613004, 63010, 3087, '<td valign="top">A looser interpretation of silence than many entries but nonetheless interesting. I like the white flowers against a white background.</td>', 'A looser interpretation of silence than many entries but nonetheless interesting. I like the white flowers against a white background.', '2004-03-07 17:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(613005, 62383, 3087, '<td valign="top">The withered flowers certainly reflect the absence of life that is the theme of the graveyard. A silence felt as a deep absence of future laughter and conversation with their loved one. An interesting study of a detail to bring home the wider memory of the cemetery.</td>', 'The withered flowers certainly reflect the absence of life that is the theme of the graveyard. A silence felt as a deep absence of future laughter and conversation with their loved one. An interesting study of a detail to bring home the wider memory of the cemetery.', '2004-03-07 17:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(613007, 62952, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the portrait - the way he''s stopped to contemplate whatever is on his mind - and the texture of the wood is wonderful. Overall composition isn''t that strong for me - his position horizontally within the frame seems unbalanced and the inclusion of the sky adds nothing for me.</td>', 'I like the portrait - the way he''s stopped to contemplate whatever is on his mind - and the texture of the wood is wonderful. Overall composition isn''t that strong for me - his position horizontally within the frame seems unbalanced and the inclusion of the sky adds nothing for me.', '2004-03-07 17:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(613008, 62726, 3087, '<td valign="top">I didn''t think much of this on first viewing but I certainly found myself coming back to it more than once during voting. (I perform a rough vote first and then run through the images a number of times to fine tune individual scores). This image certainly makes me wonder about the location, about the use of the space, about the empty chairs... I want to know whether the space is used regularly and is just experiencing a short lull or whether it''s been standing empty for some time. I like the way the line of chairs leads me back into the darkness.</td>', 'I didn''t think much of this on first viewing but I certainly found myself coming back to it more than once during voting. (I perform a rough vote first and then run through the images a number of times to fine tune individual scores). This image certainly makes me wonder about the location, about the use of the space, about the empty chairs... I want to know whether the space is used regularly and is just experiencing a short lull or whether it''s been standing empty for some time. I like the way the line of chairs leads me back into the darkness.', '2004-03-07 17:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(613009, 62456, 3087, '<td valign="top">The tight crop works very well to really bring home the impact of this message.</td>', 'The tight crop works very well to really bring home the impact of this message.', '2004-03-07 17:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(613010, 63070, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well, snow does muffle sound, so I guess your title could fit that way. For me though, most of the peaceful landscape entries simply offer ideal places in which to escape the noisiness of modern living and spend some quiet time. The rich blue of the distant water really lifts this.</td>', 'Well, snow does muffle sound, so I guess your title could fit that way. For me though, most of the peaceful landscape entries simply offer ideal places in which to escape the noisiness of modern living and spend some quiet time. The rich blue of the distant water really lifts this.', '2004-03-07 17:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(613012, 62237, 10883, '<td valign="top">The frame is nicely filled, but the pic is WAAAYYY too small.  Impossible to make out any detail.</td>', 'The frame is nicely filled, but the pic is WAAAYYY too small.  Impossible to make out any detail.', '2004-03-07 17:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(613015, 63006, 10883, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed image, the eye is drawn upwards.</td>', 'Very nicely composed image, the eye is drawn upwards.', '2004-03-07 17:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(613018, 63021, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, lighting doesn''t work for me - I just don''t like that red-orange colour of skin. It may not have been possible to throw more light on the subject, perhaps a higher ISO rating might have helped?</td>', 'Interesting image, lighting doesn''t work for me - I just don''t like that red-orange colour of skin. It may not have been possible to throw more light on the subject, perhaps a higher ISO rating might have helped?', '2004-03-07 17:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(613020, 62692, 10883, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture!  It looks better the longer you look at it.  I was about to vote a mediocre score but something drew me back to it.  Excellent scenery and composition!</td>', 'Very nice picture!  It looks better the longer you look at it.  I was about to vote a mediocre score but something drew me back to it.  Excellent scenery and composition!', '2004-03-07 17:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(613021, 62432, 3087, '<td valign="top">I have voted this image a 4 because it doesn''t have a hook to pull me in - either visually or emotionally. I understand the idea - an empty playing court which is silent now but will soon be heaving with noise and movement. So the idea itself works well. <br/>However the image lacks visual appeal. There isn''t really a focal point. Composition seems random (why did you choose to take it from that exact spot? what would it have looked like taken from other spots? what about getting lower to the ground? why did you position the pole/basket things where you did within the frame?) The background of kiddy play structure and mundane housing estate doesn''t add anything positive. I''d say that you have definitely got the right idea in terms of meeting the challenge theme but that this entry doesn''t manage to convey that theme whilst still offering an image that holds appeal in its own right. A question that may or may not be useful to you is this: Would this image be worth taking/ keeping/ sharing outside of this challenge? Would it mean anything/ hold any appeal? <br/>Please feel free to completely ignore all/ any of my comments, I''m just stating my ideas, nothing more.</td>', 'I have voted this image a 4 because it doesn''t have a hook to pull me in - either visually or emotionally. I understand the idea - an empty playing court which is silent now but will soon be heaving with noise and movement. So the idea itself works well. However the image lacks visual appeal. There isn''t really a focal point. Composition seems random (why did you choose to take it from that exact spot? what would it have looked like taken from other spots? what about getting lower to the ground? why did you position the pole/basket things where you did within the frame?) The background of kiddy play structure and mundane housing estate doesn''t add anything positive. I''d say that you have definitely got the right idea in terms of meeting the challenge theme but that this entry doesn''t manage to convey that theme whilst still offering an image that holds appeal in its own right. A question that may or may not be useful to you is this: Would this image be worth taking/ keeping/ sharing outside of this challenge? Would it mean anything/ hold any appeal? Please feel free to completely ignore all/ any of my comments, I''m just stating my ideas, nothing more.', '2004-03-07 17:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(613024, 62220, 16089, '<td valign="top">good border bad photo, too blurry</td>', 'good border bad photo, too blurry', '2004-03-07 17:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(613026, 62535, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is too grainy to really get the effect that I am guessing you are going for.  I might try either more light (which kids will more often than not sleep right through) or a tripod and longer exposure time.</td>', 'This is too grainy to really get the effect that I am guessing you are going for.  I might try either more light (which kids will more often than not sleep right through) or a tripod and longer exposure time.', '2004-03-07 17:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(613030, 62310, 16089, '<td valign="top">soooooooo good, I love snakes. great focus. 10</td>', 'soooooooo good, I love snakes. great focus. 10', '2004-03-07 17:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(613032, 62326, 15920, '<td valign="top">On the right side, the house is distracting.  Cropping at the trees(as you did on the left) would help that.  The tradeoff is obviously loosing the empty bench which makes this look even more silent.  A little more detail on the playgound equipment would have helped a little too, even at the expense of blowing out the sky a bit.</td>', 'On the right side, the house is distracting.  Cropping at the trees(as you did on the left) would help that.  The tradeoff is obviously loosing the empty bench which makes this look even more silent.  A little more detail on the playgound equipment would have helped a little too, even at the expense of blowing out the sky a bit.', '2004-03-07 17:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(613035, 62365, 16089, '<td valign="top">She isn''t really sleeping, is she?</td>', 'She isn''t really sleeping, is she?', '2004-03-07 17:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(613037, 63033, 15920, '<td valign="top">This could have been sharper with more contrast on the technical side.  On the composition side, this is one of the most meaningful photos in the competition that I have seen so far.  At that age, kids are unaware of the dangers of traffic, and deaf kids more so than usual.  I drive by signs like that all the time when in the US and never really see them.  Time to be a little more careful I think.</td>', 'This could have been sharper with more contrast on the technical side.  On the composition side, this is one of the most meaningful photos in the competition that I have seen so far.  At that age, kids are unaware of the dangers of traffic, and deaf kids more so than usual.  I drive by signs like that all the time when in the US and never really see them.  Time to be a little more careful I think.', '2004-03-07 17:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(613045, 62662, 9136, '<td valign="top">One of the best out of all the graveyard pictures I''ve seen. I like the light beam... 8.</td>', 'One of the best out of all the graveyard pictures I''ve seen. I like the light beam... 8.', '2004-03-07 18:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(613047, 62722, 9136, '<td valign="top">I think without the grain this would of been a nice photo.</td>', 'I think without the grain this would of been a nice photo.', '2004-03-07 18:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(613050, 62926, 10883, '<td valign="top">Not my taste, WAAAYYYY to patriotic...</td>', 'Not my taste, WAAAYYYY to patriotic...', '2004-03-07 18:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(613051, 63112, 10943, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo -- would make an awesome desktop pic.  Very nice color.  Great job. 10</td>', 'This is an excellent photo -- would make an awesome desktop pic.  Very nice color.  Great job. 10', '2004-03-07 18:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(613053, 63089, 10943, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity...7</td>', 'Nice clarity...7', '2004-03-07 18:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(613061, 62428, 13152, '<td valign="top">Lush tones and nice control of focus; a gem.</td>', 'Lush tones and nice control of focus; a gem.', '2004-03-07 19:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(613063, 63073, 17890, '<td valign="top">looks good</td>', 'looks good', '2004-03-07 19:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(613065, 62842, 13152, '<td valign="top">Brave. Very strong with convincing stiches and a broad range of political overtones. I don''t want to look at it, though.</td>', 'Brave. Very strong with convincing stiches and a broad range of political overtones. I don''t want to look at it, though.', '2004-03-07 19:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(613068, 63103, 17890, '<td valign="top">now i know what people do with those dolls from ikea</td>', 'now i know what people do with those dolls from ikea', '2004-03-07 19:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(613070, 63110, 13152, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but think it might be more applauded if you submitted it to an arts-based site like London Photographic Awards.</td>', 'I like this a lot, but think it might be more applauded if you submitted it to an arts-based site like London Photographic Awards.', '2004-03-07 19:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(613076, 62566, 17890, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2004-03-07 19:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(613078, 63064, 17890, '<td valign="top">beatufil picture</td>', 'beatufil picture', '2004-03-07 19:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(613081, 62734, 17890, '<td valign="top">good picture, but does not give the feeling of silence</td>', 'good picture, but does not give the feeling of silence', '2004-03-07 19:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(613084, 62877, 12475, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail. Solitary, internal silence; very effective for the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice detail. Solitary, internal silence; very effective for the challenge.', '2004-03-07 19:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(613087, 63115, 12475, '<td valign="top">The hush is audible! This is a beautiful shot, and the empty pews and contemplative mood work really well for the challenge, though it''s a bit too well lit for my slightly morbid taste. (I wonder how this would look in B&amp;W? Maybe a bit lonelier?)</td>', 'The hush is audible! This is a beautiful shot, and the empty pews and contemplative mood work really well for the challenge, though it''s a bit too well lit for my slightly morbid taste. (I wonder how this would look in B&W? Maybe a bit lonelier?)', '2004-03-07 19:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(613088, 62927, 12475, '<td valign="top">Silence in the city; that''s a tough challenge, and you met it very well. Lovely, lonely feeling.</td>', 'Silence in the city; that''s a tough challenge, and you met it very well. Lovely, lonely feeling.', '2004-03-07 19:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(613089, 62406, 16758, '<td valign="top">Nice colours</td>', 'Nice colours', '2004-03-07 19:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(613090, 62237, 16758, '<td valign="top">Perhaps more detail with a different angle?</td>', 'Perhaps more detail with a different angle?', '2004-03-07 19:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(613091, 62590, 16758, '<td valign="top">I feel more isolated than anything in this photo</td>', 'I feel more isolated than anything in this photo', '2004-03-07 19:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(613092, 63030, 12475, '<td valign="top">I could nitpick about the high contrast or the busy background, and I''d like a closer crop; but all in all this works extremely well because of the beauty of that face! No one that angelic could possibly snore. :) A very lovely capture.</td>', 'I could nitpick about the high contrast or the busy background, and I''d like a closer crop; but all in all this works extremely well because of the beauty of that face! No one that angelic could possibly snore. :) A very lovely capture.', '2004-03-07 19:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(613093, 62726, 12475, '<td valign="top">I love this idea for the challenge; this looks like a church or an old university, somewhere that''s only alive when people are there. Very good detail, perspective, tones.</td>', 'I love this idea for the challenge; this looks like a church or an old university, somewhere that''s only alive when people are there. Very good detail, perspective, tones.', '2004-03-07 19:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(613094, 63062, 12475, '<td valign="top">Despite the promise of your title (!) I don''t find much that''s compelling; the shot is too out of focus and plain. Good imagination, though!</td>', 'Despite the promise of your title (!) I don''t find much that''s compelling; the shot is too out of focus and plain. Good imagination, though!', '2004-03-07 19:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(613095, 62970, 13937, '<td valign="top">Nice image, not sureI see it fiyying in the challenge though.</td>', 'Nice image, not sureI see it fiyying in the challenge though.', '2004-03-07 19:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(613096, 62535, 12475, '<td valign="top">Good try, but this is way out of focus and grainy, and the weird angle isn''t helping here.</td>', 'Good try, but this is way out of focus and grainy, and the weird angle isn''t helping here.', '2004-03-07 19:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(613098, 62931, 12475, '<td valign="top">Heh; I can relate to the feeling behind this shot. I think it could be more effective, though, with a  closer focus on the baby''s face. The surrounding crib and toys aren''t as interesting.</td>', 'Heh; I can relate to the feeling behind this shot. I think it could be more effective, though, with a  closer focus on the baby''s face. The surrounding crib and toys aren''t as interesting.', '2004-03-07 19:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(613099, 62328, 16758, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective. Cute concept.</td>', 'Very nice perspective. Cute concept.', '2004-03-07 19:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(613100, 62691, 12475, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t work. I am trying to see what you wanted to do, but sorry, I can''t.</td>', 'This just doesn''t work. I am trying to see what you wanted to do, but sorry, I can''t.', '2004-03-07 19:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(613101, 62771, 13937, '<td valign="top">Nice image. very good lighting.</td>', 'Nice image. very good lighting.', '2004-03-07 19:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(613102, 62667, 16758, '<td valign="top">I feel a bit more contrast would be even better...</td>', 'I feel a bit more contrast would be even better...', '2004-03-07 19:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(613103, 62949, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is funny, but it is too much a snapshot. It''s not something people that don''t know her would want to spend a lot of time with.</td>', 'This is funny, but it is too much a snapshot. It''s not something people that don''t know her would want to spend a lot of time with.', '2004-03-07 19:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(613105, 63029, 12475, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea that''s about halfway toward working; I see the shears cutting some kind of wire, but that''s it. Not a very compelling composition.</td>', 'Interesting idea that''s about halfway toward working; I see the shears cutting some kind of wire, but that''s it. Not a very compelling composition.', '2004-03-07 19:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(613106, 62842, 16758, '<td valign="top">WOW</td>', 'WOW', '2004-03-07 19:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(613107, 63078, 12475, '<td valign="top">Too small... etc. I''d love to see this larger.</td>', 'Too small... etc. I''d love to see this larger.', '2004-03-07 19:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(613108, 62995, 13937, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  exposure is good as well as framing.  I''m struggling with whether it fits the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  exposure is good as well as framing.  I''m struggling with whether it fits the challenge.', '2004-03-07 19:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(613109, 62292, 12475, '<td valign="top">At least you are trying for something more than a cliche shot. But it''s not clear to me how this conveys silence. Might work better with less harsh light on the man, maybe black and white?</td>', 'At least you are trying for something more than a cliche shot. But it''s not clear to me how this conveys silence. Might work better with less harsh light on the man, maybe black and white?', '2004-03-07 19:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(613112, 62707, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is a funny idea; took me a minute to notice the unplugged player! I like the composition and the lighting on the table, but it''s a bit harsh on the man; almost looks like two different pictures.</td>', 'This is a funny idea; took me a minute to notice the unplugged player! I like the composition and the lighting on the table, but it''s a bit harsh on the man; almost looks like two different pictures.', '2004-03-07 19:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(613113, 63089, 12475, '<td valign="top">I get the idea, but it''s just not an interesting picture. Sorry!</td>', 'I get the idea, but it''s just not an interesting picture. Sorry!', '2004-03-07 19:58:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(613115, 63067, 13937, '<td valign="top">I like this approach to the challenge.  There is a possible double meaning to the "empty nest" Theme.</td>', 'I like this approach to the challenge.  There is a possible double meaning to the "empty nest" Theme.', '2004-03-07 19:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(613117, 62994, 12475, '<td valign="top">Well... it''s not my kind of art. It says nothing of value to me, and that''s just the truth.</td>', 'Well... it''s not my kind of art. It says nothing of value to me, and that''s just the truth.', '2004-03-07 20:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(613118, 62588, 12475, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the kitschy kitchenware! The shot is nice, and good choice for colors, but a little too centered, maybe.</td>', 'I appreciate the kitschy kitchenware! The shot is nice, and good choice for colors, but a little too centered, maybe.', '2004-03-07 20:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(613120, 63048, 13937, '<td valign="top">Ncould be lower in the image.<br/>ice scenic, I woould like to see it framed a little better, though.  Civilization</td>', 'Ncould be lower in the image.ice scenic, I woould like to see it framed a little better, though.  Civilization', '2004-03-07 20:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(613122, 62253, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is an almost surreally beautiful photo. I see it more as the ":silence of the hunt" since the prey isn''t in view. Just gorgeous.</td>', 'This is an almost surreally beautiful photo. I see it more as the ":silence of the hunt" since the prey isn''t in view. Just gorgeous.', '2004-03-07 20:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(613123, 62544, 13937, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I would like to see everything moved to the right in the image, though.  This will bring your leading lines deeper into the image</td>', 'Good idea.  I would like to see everything moved to the right in the image, though.  This will bring your leading lines deeper into the image', '2004-03-07 20:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(613125, 62790, 13937, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I like that you included  a bench in the photo.</td>', 'Nice idea.  I like that you included  a bench in the photo.', '2004-03-07 20:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(613126, 63078, 13937, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea.  There is an awful lot in the image, though.  <br/>aybe if you isolated one part of the playground.</td>', 'This is a good idea.  There is an awful lot in the image, though.  aybe if you isolated one part of the playground.', '2004-03-07 20:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(613130, 62853, 13937, '<td valign="top">Good idea, well lit and nice composition.</td>', 'Good idea, well lit and nice composition.', '2004-03-07 20:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(613132, 62679, 17203, '<td valign="top">Well, you topped my pin drop photo! Maybe a lower angle on the light to help bring out the background texture? The light falls off along the top- I''d have cropped that out, but well done overall.</td>', 'Well, you topped my pin drop photo! Maybe a lower angle on the light to help bring out the background texture? The light falls off along the top- I''d have cropped that out, but well done overall.', '2004-03-07 20:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(613137, 62503, 17203, '<td valign="top">This could have been one of the better sunset shots, but the horizon should be straight and the saturation has been increased to the point that the sun is banding.</td>', 'This could have been one of the better sunset shots, but the horizon should be straight and the saturation has been increased to the point that the sun is banding.', '2004-03-07 20:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(613146, 62813, 16216, '<td valign="top">I feel with a bit lower contrast this picture would have more of an impact, I like the silence of the Lamb outtake....</td>', 'I feel with a bit lower contrast this picture would have more of an impact, I like the silence of the Lamb outtake....', '2004-03-07 20:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(613150, 62477, 16216, '<td valign="top">I Love the abstract, flow of rainbow colors is awesome. I am not 100 % sure this is Silence unless you are trying to show a library. I rated it quite high due to the composition. Great Take</td>', 'I Love the abstract, flow of rainbow colors is awesome. I am not 100 % sure this is Silence unless you are trying to show a library. I rated it quite high due to the composition. Great Take', '2004-03-07 20:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(613151, 63004, 16216, '<td valign="top">I really love this picture, the play of light and shadow adds a dramatic effect. This is a hard picture to decipher though, I thisnk I feel silence but then again I see something else each time I look. Your is definitely one of my top picks</td>', 'I really love this picture, the play of light and shadow adds a dramatic effect. This is a hard picture to decipher though, I thisnk I feel silence but then again I see something else each time I look. Your is definitely one of my top picks', '2004-03-07 20:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(613152, 62926, 16216, '<td valign="top">I love the message this picture sends, very well composed and thought out. It is definitely one of my top picks</td>', 'I love the message this picture sends, very well composed and thought out. It is definitely one of my top picks', '2004-03-07 20:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(613155, 62361, 16216, '<td valign="top">I wouild have rated this a 10 in a challange themed Alone. I feel the silence and the cold at the same time. Your use of backlighting is awesome. I place you in the top 5 of my picks. Almost looks like a I miss you greeting card. Thank you very nice</td>', 'I wouild have rated this a 10 in a challange themed Alone. I feel the silence and the cold at the same time. Your use of backlighting is awesome. I place you in the top 5 of my picks. Almost looks like a I miss you greeting card. Thank you very nice', '2004-03-07 20:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(613158, 62958, 16095, '<td valign="top">i like the composition here and the texture of the wall, it conveys the challenge nicely, but overall photo seems to have a graininess to it.</td>', 'i like the composition here and the texture of the wall, it conveys the challenge nicely, but overall photo seems to have a graininess to it.', '2004-03-07 20:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(613160, 62959, 16216, '<td valign="top">Oh so Sad... Very nice Capture. Great focus and great framing. I would not do anything to add or take away from this a Great Photo</td>', 'Oh so Sad... Very nice Capture. Great focus and great framing. I would not do anything to add or take away from this a Great Photo', '2004-03-07 20:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(613163, 62654, 16095, '<td valign="top">technically a well done shot, border is a little distracting, i like the idea--at least no one else has done this!!</td>', 'technically a well done shot, border is a little distracting, i like the idea--at least no one else has done this!!', '2004-03-07 20:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(613164, 62566, 16216, '<td valign="top">Nice Capture, Would loved to see the Black Node Peak out of the Woods. Not an easy shot and you captured it brillently.</td>', 'Nice Capture, Would loved to see the Black Node Peak out of the Woods. Not an easy shot and you captured it brillently.', '2004-03-07 21:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(613165, 62826, 16216, '<td valign="top">Great Message.. Great thoght behind this composition. It is refreshing to see someone put their imagination to work in this challange</td>', 'Great Message.. Great thoght behind this composition. It is refreshing to see someone put their imagination to work in this challange', '2004-03-07 21:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(613166, 62654, 16216, '<td valign="top">Very Very Nice... I love the two oclock lighting effect any other angle would have hurt the image.. Good Luck</td>', 'Very Very Nice... I love the two oclock lighting effect any other angle would have hurt the image.. Good Luck', '2004-03-07 21:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(613167, 62588, 16216, '<td valign="top">The Glare on the egg holder is disturbing and distrake from a good picture. I would have cropped the green ledge once again takes my eye away from the main subject..</td>', 'The Glare on the egg holder is disturbing and distrake from a good picture. I would have cropped the green ledge once again takes my eye away from the main subject..', '2004-03-07 21:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(613169, 62599, 16216, '<td valign="top">Of all the hands or fingers or tape over the mouth I find yours to be very well thought out. The Pink in the whites fo the eyes though seems to pull me away from the picture as a whole</td>', 'Of all the hands or fingers or tape over the mouth I find yours to be very well thought out. The Pink in the whites fo the eyes though seems to pull me away from the picture as a whole', '2004-03-07 21:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(613171, 62862, 16216, '<td valign="top">Like the picture but the focus is set to the pictures on the wall causing the heads of both subjects to be a bit fuzzy.</td>', 'Like the picture but the focus is set to the pictures on the wall causing the heads of both subjects to be a bit fuzzy.', '2004-03-07 21:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(613172, 63014, 16216, '<td valign="top">Very Nice definitely different then most of the others I saw.</td>', 'Very Nice definitely different then most of the others I saw.', '2004-03-07 21:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(613173, 62852, 16216, '<td valign="top">Oh So quiet, Grasshooper... Silence can not be broken, Nice Shot</td>', 'Oh So quiet, Grasshooper... Silence can not be broken, Nice Shot', '2004-03-07 21:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(613175, 62603, 16216, '<td valign="top">Very Very Nice. I do not think it really hits the Theme on the nail, Yes a Flower is silent but so is every other still life. A 10 in a Themed contest of Softness or Poetry in Nature, Had to deduct for this otherwise rated high</td>', 'Very Very Nice. I do not think it really hits the Theme on the nail, Yes a Flower is silent but so is every other still life. A 10 in a Themed contest of Softness or Poetry in Nature, Had to deduct for this otherwise rated high', '2004-03-07 21:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(613177, 62594, 16216, '<td valign="top">Very Nice, What are those two breaks in the water just below the boat, if you would have waited just a moment more for these to pass a Perfect 10. Those breaks tend to break the silence of the scene...</td>', 'Very Nice, What are those two breaks in the water just below the boat, if you would have waited just a moment more for these to pass a Perfect 10. Those breaks tend to break the silence of the scene...', '2004-03-07 21:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(613178, 63109, 16216, '<td valign="top">Would have loved to see this picture a little tighter on the falls I feel the distraction of the small trees and shadows coming in fro 3 oclock drag my eyes away fron the main subject</td>', 'Would have loved to see this picture a little tighter on the falls I feel the distraction of the small trees and shadows coming in fro 3 oclock drag my eyes away fron the main subject', '2004-03-07 21:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(613181, 62488, 16216, '<td valign="top">Very Nice, very Nice indeed, I am waiting for the first bass to jump out of the water. So silent I am pushing this one up my list...</td>', 'Very Nice, very Nice indeed, I am waiting for the first bass to jump out of the water. So silent I am pushing this one up my list...', '2004-03-07 21:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
