(613543, 62211, 15920, '<td valign="top">A motor and a wake don''t make me think of quiet.  But this picture has great colors, and I like the siloutte effect.</td>', 'A motor and a wake don''t make me think of quiet.  But this picture has great colors, and I like the siloutte effect.', '2004-03-08 06:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
