(613577, 63070, 15920, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you are shooting, but a polarizer would help the water color.  Even without that, this is nice.</td>', 'Not sure what you are shooting, but a polarizer would help the water color.  Even without that, this is nice.', '2004-03-08 07:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(613579, 62990, 15919, '<td valign="top">This is very good image but more contrast and colorsaturation would have make it better I think.  Have you tried it B&amp;W?</td>', 'This is very good image but more contrast and colorsaturation would have make it better I think.  Have you tried it B&W?', '2004-03-08 07:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(613591, 62989, 16672, '<td valign="top">Okay and did you know your camera has a color balance?  I  am sure you could have gotten something other than red .<br/></td>', 'Okay and did you know your camera has a color balance?  I  am sure you could have gotten something other than red .', '2004-03-08 07:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(613609, 62929, 18207, '<td valign="top">Breath-taking... Best angle, great DOF. A bit too much undergrowth for me but one can''t choose where to find such a subject.</td>', 'Breath-taking... Best angle, great DOF. A bit too much undergrowth for me but one can''t choose where to find such a subject.', '2004-03-08 08:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(613611, 62839, 18207, '<td valign="top">Makes me even type my comment quiet :) Needs even more contrast, though.</td>', 'Makes me even type my comment quiet :) Needs even more contrast, though.', '2004-03-08 08:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(613631, 63126, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like your choice to opt for a square image shape and also the way that the foreground creates that wonderful triangle into the lower right corner. I also like the way the clouds echo the shapes of the mountain peaks.</td>', 'I like your choice to opt for a square image shape and also the way that the foreground creates that wonderful triangle into the lower right corner. I also like the way the clouds echo the shapes of the mountain peaks.', '2004-03-08 08:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(613636, 63104, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the way that the frame is split into three horizontal "stripes" - the largest white one, the vertically lined top one and the centre plain one. The dark spot on the right within the white band adds a focal point - I think I''d crop out the one at the far left to focus more on the one on the right.</td>', 'I like the way that the frame is split into three horizontal "stripes" - the largest white one, the vertically lined top one and the centre plain one. The dark spot on the right within the white band adds a focal point - I think I''d crop out the one at the far left to focus more on the one on the right.', '2004-03-08 09:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(613638, 62693, 3087, '<td valign="top">This one made me think to understand how it conveyed silence - and then I "auralised"  the sound of running water and realised this represented the absence of that sound. I like the abstract you''ve created.<br/>(Someone made up the word auralise for me when I said I wanted a "sound" version of visualise but then we later found the word has been coined before)</td>', 'This one made me think to understand how it conveyed silence - and then I "auralised"  the sound of running water and realised this represented the absence of that sound. I like the abstract you''ve created.(Someone made up the word auralise for me when I said I wanted a "sound" version of visualise but then we later found the word has been coined before)', '2004-03-08 09:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(613639, 62326, 3087, '<td valign="top">The subject itself is great - but I think the image lacks punch. Being so far away (and thus including trees, foreground etd) doesn''t really add anything, I think going closer might be better.<br/>I''m also most intrigued by the snow-covered tyres and think a photo of those would be striking.</td>', 'The subject itself is great - but I think the image lacks punch. Being so far away (and thus including trees, foreground etd) doesn''t really add anything, I think going closer might be better.I''m also most intrigued by the snow-covered tyres and think a photo of those would be striking.', '2004-03-08 09:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(613644, 62899, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like aspects of this image - the texture within the sand leading us in, the long shadows, the empty beach - but feel that overall it''s too dark and that the man is too close to the edge of the frame for a strong composition.</td>', 'I like aspects of this image - the texture within the sand leading us in, the long shadows, the empty beach - but feel that overall it''s too dark and that the man is too close to the edge of the frame for a strong composition.', '2004-03-08 09:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
