(614983, 62437, 15919, '<td valign="top">Its a fine shot.  Did you try a closer angel and set the focus to get the things closest to the lens out of focus?  Dont know if its possible since the subject is abolutly black and white but how about litle more contrast?</td>', 'Its a fine shot.  Did you try a closer angel and set the focus to get the things closest to the lens out of focus?  Dont know if its possible since the subject is abolutly black and white but how about litle more contrast?', '2004-03-09 08:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(615016, 62477, 17414, '<td valign="top">A very nice arrangement of colors. Great concept!</td>', 'A very nice arrangement of colors. Great concept!', '2004-03-09 09:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(615023, 62408, 15919, '<td valign="top">Its a strange cold white balance.  Think it gives the image more emotiveness.</td>', 'Its a strange cold white balance.  Think it gives the image more emotiveness.', '2004-03-09 09:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(615027, 62806, 15919, '<td valign="top">Graet capture.  You seem to have absolutely got it from the right angel; the smoke and you are capturing the audience without completly burning out the spotlit face of the performer.</td>', 'Graet capture.  You seem to have absolutely got it from the right angel; the smoke and you are capturing the audience without completly burning out the spotlit face of the performer.', '2004-03-09 09:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(615028, 63020, 15919, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape and very sharp and good image.  The colortones are litle strange, think its lack a litle more colorsaturation.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape and very sharp and good image.  The colortones are litle strange, think its lack a litle more colorsaturation.', '2004-03-09 09:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(615030, 62726, 15919, '<td valign="top">Litle more contrast and maybe better B&amp;W</td>', 'Litle more contrast and maybe better B&W', '2004-03-09 09:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(615031, 62282, 10339, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the index finger - I just wish that the flowers were in focus.<br/></td>', 'Nice detail on the index finger - I just wish that the flowers were in focus.', '2004-03-09 09:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(615033, 62895, 10339, '<td valign="top">Adding the flowers was a nice touch.</td>', 'Adding the flowers was a nice touch.', '2004-03-09 09:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(615035, 63070, 10339, '<td valign="top">I like the way the blue lake stands out in the background.</td>', 'I like the way the blue lake stands out in the background.', '2004-03-09 09:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(615036, 62361, 10339, '<td valign="top">Nice tones from the dark at the bottom to the light gray at the top.</td>', 'Nice tones from the dark at the bottom to the light gray at the top.', '2004-03-09 09:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(615038, 62571, 3461, '<td valign="top">Wish the person were in focus a little more. Nice mood.</td>', 'Wish the person were in focus a little more. Nice mood.', '2004-03-09 09:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(615039, 63090, 10339, '<td valign="top">Nice. I would have liked to see this without the power lines.</td>', 'Nice. I would have liked to see this without the power lines.', '2004-03-09 09:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(615042, 63020, 10339, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the detail of the tracks in the sand.</td>', 'Love the colors and the detail of the tracks in the sand.', '2004-03-09 09:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(615043, 63105, 3461, '<td valign="top">Poor kitty.</td>', 'Poor kitty.', '2004-03-09 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(615044, 62292, 3461, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this conveys silence.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this conveys silence.', '2004-03-09 09:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(615045, 62361, 16004, '<td valign="top">One word immediately comes to mind upon viewing this one:- Elegant.  I think it''s quite wonderful, definitely conveys quietness, and it''s understated appearance really works.  Only slight criticism is that it might be nicer a bit squarer, possibly with the tree filling the space a little more (with a little less foreground?).  Don''t know, it''s more a preference than a criticism.  So 10 it is.</td>', 'One word immediately comes to mind upon viewing this one:- Elegant.  I think it''s quite wonderful, definitely conveys quietness, and it''s understated appearance really works.  Only slight criticism is that it might be nicer a bit squarer, possibly with the tree filling the space a little more (with a little less foreground?).  Don''t know, it''s more a preference than a criticism.  So 10 it is.', '2004-03-09 09:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(615048, 62927, 3461, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. My only critique would be that it appears tilted to the left a bit.</td>', 'Very nice shot. My only critique would be that it appears tilted to the left a bit.', '2004-03-09 09:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(615051, 62446, 3461, '<td valign="top">Think it would be better if you had framed the entire snowman. It gave me a chuckle though.</td>', 'Think it would be better if you had framed the entire snowman. It gave me a chuckle though.', '2004-03-09 09:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(615053, 62442, 16095, '<td valign="top">the colors are so vibrant, i like the idea of having the plug in focus. The plug seems to have a cold white light source hitting it-detracts a bit from warm background. Nicely composed though.</td>', 'the colors are so vibrant, i like the idea of having the plug in focus. The plug seems to have a cold white light source hitting it-detracts a bit from warm background. Nicely composed though.', '2004-03-09 10:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(615054, 62991, 10339, '<td valign="top">Nice blue tone throughout the entire frame.</td>', 'Nice blue tone throughout the entire frame.', '2004-03-09 10:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(615055, 62618, 10339, '<td valign="top">You really captured a great expression!</td>', 'You really captured a great expression!', '2004-03-09 10:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(615058, 62645, 3461, '<td valign="top">Love the idea but it was difficult at first to know what this was. A little less contrast, a little less grain and having the full plane in view would improve it. Nice shot that was probably very tough to get.</td>', 'Love the idea but it was difficult at first to know what this was. A little less contrast, a little less grain and having the full plane in view would improve it. Nice shot that was probably very tough to get.', '2004-03-09 10:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(615059, 63029, 10339, '<td valign="top">Neat concept.</td>', 'Neat concept.', '2004-03-09 10:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(615062, 62572, 10339, '<td valign="top">What a neat shot! I like the way the mist covers the entire frame.</td>', 'What a neat shot! I like the way the mist covers the entire frame.', '2004-03-09 10:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(615067, 62503, 10339, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors. IMO it would be better if the horizon was horizontal. I get the feeling of sliding to the right.</td>', 'Very nice colors. IMO it would be better if the horizon was horizontal. I get the feeling of sliding to the right.', '2004-03-09 10:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(615071, 62253, 10339, '<td valign="top">Wow! How did you get the dog to jump like that - and snap at just the right time?</td>', 'Wow! How did you get the dog to jump like that - and snap at just the right time?', '2004-03-09 10:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(615072, 62488, 10339, '<td valign="top">I like the way the mist covers the tree line. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the way the mist covers the tree line. Nicely done.', '2004-03-09 10:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(615074, 62594, 10339, '<td valign="top">Great use of the red color in the boat!</td>', 'Great use of the red color in the boat!', '2004-03-09 10:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(615078, 62487, 17228, '<td valign="top">Really nice idea, shot and composition. I wonder how the photo would look if the model was wearing something color-wise that set her apart from the wooden guardrails for greater contrast and separation. Perhaps B&amp;W could have helped in that regard as well. Not a complaint really on a very good idea that captures the challenge theme and does so in a very artistic manner. Love the soft dreamy/painterly look to the landscape horizon. P.S. Oh, and thanks for NOT putting tape over her mouth.  ;)</td>', 'Really nice idea, shot and composition. I wonder how the photo would look if the model was wearing something color-wise that set her apart from the wooden guardrails for greater contrast and separation. Perhaps B&W could have helped in that regard as well. Not a complaint really on a very good idea that captures the challenge theme and does so in a very artistic manner. Love the soft dreamy/painterly look to the landscape horizon. P.S. Oh, and thanks for NOT putting tape over her mouth.  ;)', '2004-03-09 10:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(615139, 62217, 14773, '<td valign="top">I''m unfamiliar with the statue in the background, is it safe to assume it''s a war memorial?</td>', 'I''m unfamiliar with the statue in the background, is it safe to assume it''s a war memorial?', '2004-03-09 11:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(615142, 62386, 14773, '<td valign="top">I really like the detail in the main light, the way the fingers spread is very cool, and the tone is great as well. 6.</td>', 'I really like the detail in the main light, the way the fingers spread is very cool, and the tone is great as well. 6.', '2004-03-09 11:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(615144, 62734, 14773, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, fits challenge well, but really has been done a thousand times over.5.</td>', 'Very nice photo, fits challenge well, but really has been done a thousand times over.5.', '2004-03-09 11:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(615146, 62848, 14773, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea of without the written notes, there would be no music [symbolically of course, not literally].6.</td>', 'I really like this idea of without the written notes, there would be no music [symbolically of course, not literally].6.', '2004-03-09 11:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(615148, 62997, 14773, '<td valign="top">It looks like it could be a fantastic photo with great colors, but too small to tell.</td>', 'It looks like it could be a fantastic photo with great colors, but too small to tell.', '2004-03-09 11:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(615149, 62487, 14773, '<td valign="top">I really like the foggy, dewy feel created here.  It looks a little tilted, though. 6.</td>', 'I really like the foggy, dewy feel created here.  It looks a little tilted, though. 6.', '2004-03-09 11:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(615151, 62865, 14773, '<td valign="top">Yes, get it on film because you won''t be seeing much of this ;-)</td>', 'Yes, get it on film because you won''t be seeing much of this ;-)', '2004-03-09 11:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(615152, 63062, 14773, '<td valign="top">Light is a bit harsh and focus is out, but love the title and idea.  Creative = 6.</td>', 'Light is a bit harsh and focus is out, but love the title and idea.  Creative = 6.', '2004-03-09 11:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
