(615748, 62220, 9906, '<td valign="top">The use of negative space here doesn''t make sense to me.  You left in what looks like lens flare and placed the true subject of the shot too high.  Overall a not so interesting shot made less so by a rather unusual choice of composition.  Your fancy frame doesn''t add any thing to the mix either...<br/>TC</td>', 'The use of negative space here doesn''t make sense to me.  You left in what looks like lens flare and placed the true subject of the shot too high.  Overall a not so interesting shot made less so by a rather unusual choice of composition.  Your fancy frame doesn''t add any thing to the mix either...TC', '2004-03-09 22:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(615749, 62734, 9809, '<td valign="top">I''ve never known a waterfall to be quiet. Nice photo though.</td>', 'I''ve never known a waterfall to be quiet. Nice photo though.', '2004-03-09 22:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(615751, 62790, 18285, '<td valign="top">Great shot, not sure it''s in the right category.</td>', 'Great shot, not sure it''s in the right category.', '2004-03-09 22:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(615754, 62844, 9906, '<td valign="top">Painting with light or fill flash?  Either way, nicely lit.  The lights in the background are a bit distracting though.  A different angle might have helped...<br/>TC</td>', 'Painting with light or fill flash?  Either way, nicely lit.  The lights in the background are a bit distracting though.  A different angle might have helped...TC', '2004-03-09 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(615756, 62211, 9809, '<td valign="top">MOTOR on the boat isn''t too quiet, I''ll bet. Beautiful picture, but he should be rowing along, silently, or maybe at sail, but not motoring in.</td>', 'MOTOR on the boat isn''t too quiet, I''ll bet. Beautiful picture, but he should be rowing along, silently, or maybe at sail, but not motoring in.', '2004-03-09 22:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(615760, 62677, 18285, '<td valign="top">Cool shot</td>', 'Cool shot', '2004-03-09 22:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(615770, 62875, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is, I believe, a first for me.  Someone put this in the DPC calendar.  I think that this shot would be MUCH more potent as a black and white.  The green of the grass seems totally out of place with the feeling of the shot.  The only potential problem with that is that I don''t know if there is enough contrast in the texture of the grass to make it pop...<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow, this is, I believe, a first for me.  Someone put this in the DPC calendar.  I think that this shot would be MUCH more potent as a black and white.  The green of the grass seems totally out of place with the feeling of the shot.  The only potential problem with that is that I don''t know if there is enough contrast in the texture of the grass to make it pop...TC', '2004-03-09 23:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(615773, 63077, 13772, '<td valign="top">We all need a little love. Nice picture! Good take on the challenge.</td>', 'We all need a little love. Nice picture! Good take on the challenge.', '2004-03-09 23:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
