(615807, 63014, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very great idea.  The background, focus, color,  and DOF are great.  I love how the clear ring melts away.  I do not like the spit on the nipple though.  nice touch, but will put people off.</td>', 'Very great idea.  The background, focus, color,  and DOF are great.  I love how the clear ring melts away.  I do not like the spit on the nipple though.  nice touch, but will put people off.', '2004-03-09 23:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(615808, 63025, 6771, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  the light is very flat and muddy, giving the whole picture a dull appearance</td>', 'Good idea.  the light is very flat and muddy, giving the whole picture a dull appearance', '2004-03-09 23:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(615811, 62259, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very good DOF.  many people hate these (as I know in a current challenge the same thing) because it is NOT ALL IN FOCUS.  I think it needs just a bit more sharpness along the front of that specific key, but it is also black so it is hard to tell.</td>', 'Very good DOF.  many people hate these (as I know in a current challenge the same thing) because it is NOT ALL IN FOCUS.  I think it needs just a bit more sharpness along the front of that specific key, but it is also black so it is hard to tell.', '2004-03-09 23:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(615812, 62361, 10124, '<td valign="top">nice backlight on the tree. feels very calm and quiet.</td>', 'nice backlight on the tree. feels very calm and quiet.', '2004-03-09 23:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(615813, 62736, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph.  tells the story well.  the focus and lighting is superb.  nice crop  great job</td>', 'Very nice photograph.  tells the story well.  the focus and lighting is superb.  nice crop  great job', '2004-03-09 23:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
