(615821, 62855, 6771, '<td valign="top">Looks like the snowshoers are out and about.  Good work with exposure on the snow and getting it white.  touch of a blow out on the right trail, but...  I can see the silence in this....out in the middle of nowhere, crisp pine scented air.   OH YEAH!!!!!  Love it!</td>', 'Looks like the snowshoers are out and about.  Good work with exposure on the snow and getting it white.  touch of a blow out on the right trail, but...  I can see the silence in this....out in the middle of nowhere, crisp pine scented air.   OH YEAH!!!!!  Love it!', '2004-03-09 23:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(615823, 63020, 6771, '<td valign="top">SWEET!   UTAH I am on my way...soon.   This reminds of the area around Blanding and the Grand Gulch.   Get out there.   silent enough to hear your own heartbeat.  I love that.  Is the sand a little oversaturated?  otherwise, great lines and shadows.</td>', 'SWEET!   UTAH I am on my way...soon.   This reminds of the area around Blanding and the Grand Gulch.   Get out there.   silent enough to hear your own heartbeat.  I love that.  Is the sand a little oversaturated?  otherwise, great lines and shadows.', '2004-03-09 23:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
