(615831, 62978, 10124, '<td valign="top">great shot. i would suggest cropping in tighter on the man. in this case, i don''t feel the surrounding environment adds to the shot. the focus should be on him and his expression.</td>', 'great shot. i would suggest cropping in tighter on the man. in this case, i don''t feel the surrounding environment adds to the shot. the focus should be on him and his expression.', '2004-03-09 23:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
