(615837, 62784, 7151, '<td valign="top">I thought this might be yours!  Didn''t have time to comment during voting, but I like this idea because every other tree picture I looked at, I kept thinking "wind in the branches" - which isn''t silent!  The branchless stubbs made me think "Yes - silent trees!"  :)  I think it might have done better if you could have gotten the trunks at the top of the peak more prominantly in the shot.  Better luck next time.</td>', 'I thought this might be yours!  Didn''t have time to comment during voting, but I like this idea because every other tree picture I looked at, I kept thinking "wind in the branches" - which isn''t silent!  The branchless stubbs made me think "Yes - silent trees!"  :)  I think it might have done better if you could have gotten the trunks at the top of the peak more prominantly in the shot.  Better luck next time.', '2004-03-10 00:05:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(615842, 62594, 12268, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon! Fantastic shot!</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon! Fantastic shot!', '2004-03-10 00:08:50.000000', NULL, 0),
