(615928, 62853, 16477, '<td valign="top">everyone thanks for  great comments , members  have been very kind in voting for me and very helpful with their comments.<br/> <br/>Twain here didnot refer to Mark Twain or Shania  Twain, but it is  an an english proverb where twain means , two, hence it meant silence for two  shall never meet</td>', 'everyone thanks for  great comments , members  have been very kind in voting for me and very helpful with their comments. Twain here didnot refer to Mark Twain or Shania  Twain, but it is  an an english proverb where twain means , two, hence it meant silence for two  shall never meet', '2004-03-10 00:36:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(615947, 63096, 8953, '<td valign="top">Hi Katie<br/> <br/>You did very well for your first time out. Some folks will try and try and never get out of the bottom 10%. <br/> <br/>The journal is a bit blury and could have been rotated just a bit more. you were a little high in contrast ...loosing the writing on the page. <br/> <br/>Different monitors will show this a little brighter . It is always best to turn down the over all contrast just a bit. there is a bar below the images that go''s from white to black...you shoud be able to see each gradient distinctly different from the next all the way through the scale.<br/> <br/>anyway...wonderful first attempt<br/> <br/>DAD</td>', 'Hi Katie You did very well for your first time out. Some folks will try and try and never get out of the bottom 10%.  The journal is a bit blury and could have been rotated just a bit more. you were a little high in contrast ...loosing the writing on the page.  Different monitors will show this a little brighter . It is always best to turn down the over all contrast just a bit. there is a bar below the images that go''s from white to black...you shoud be able to see each gradient distinctly different from the next all the way through the scale. anyway...wonderful first attempt DAD', '2004-03-10 00:43:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(615954, 62488, 16420, '<td valign="top">My wife is very upset with me because I beat her in this challenge. ;) We took photos the same morning separately, and didn''t tell each other our subject, etc., until the entries were on DPChallenge. I actually thought hers would do better, so this ribbon was a nice surprise. Thanks so much for all the wonderful comments. You guys are very encouraging and I hope I can live up to this in the future. I was very lucky that we woke up to mist on the lake that morning.</td>', 'My wife is very upset with me because I beat her in this challenge. ;) We took photos the same morning separately, and didn''t tell each other our subject, etc., until the entries were on DPChallenge. I actually thought hers would do better, so this ribbon was a nice surprise. Thanks so much for all the wonderful comments. You guys are very encouraging and I hope I can live up to this in the future. I was very lucky that we woke up to mist on the lake that morning.', '2004-03-10 00:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(615971, 63115, 9504, '<td valign="top">You can hear the silence.  Nice photo.  Great placement.  Congrats!</td>', 'You can hear the silence.  Nice photo.  Great placement.  Congrats!', '2004-03-10 00:51:52.000000', NULL, 0),
