(616003, 62842, 17525, '<td valign="top">thankyou for all the comments :)<br/> <br/>the blown out highlights on the face were very deliberate, just my taste. (do notice that i didn''t leave them at full white, but brought them down a few figures to a lighter white grey.)</td>', 'thankyou for all the comments :) the blown out highlights on the face were very deliberate, just my taste. (do notice that i didn''t leave them at full white, but brought them down a few figures to a lighter white grey.)', '2004-03-10 01:12:43.000000', NULL, 0),
