(616033, 63081, 17550, '<td valign="top">Very cool, I also live in Montreal so I''ve seen the Notre Dame quite a few times...I think the best angle to take this picture is from the center, though (I''ve photographed it quite a few times from different angles myself ;) ), but good work!</td>', 'Very cool, I also live in Montreal so I''ve seen the Notre Dame quite a few times...I think the best angle to take this picture is from the center, though (I''ve photographed it quite a few times from different angles myself ;) ), but good work!', '2004-03-10 01:33:41.000000', NULL, 0),
