(616077, 62701, 16230, '<td valign="top">I had hoped that this one would score a lot better than it did. It''s a nice photo, and it''s a lot more original than several that scored higher. Oh well, keep up the good work and you will be successful. You have a good eye.</td>', 'I had hoped that this one would score a lot better than it did. It''s a nice photo, and it''s a lot more original than several that scored higher. Oh well, keep up the good work and you will be successful. You have a good eye.', '2004-03-10 02:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
