(616231, 63000, 17926, '<td valign="top">thanks everyone for your comments on my first challenge submission.  I was glad to see people noticed a few of my goals.  I was aiming for the shadow play between the actual wires and their shadows, and also the partial capturing of the headphones.  Blueswolfs'' comment were exactly my thoughts.  What I had composed exactly in my mind did not turn out as I had planned, but I guess that''s where the P8 is lacking.  <br/>Thanks again all for your comments.</td>', 'thanks everyone for your comments on my first challenge submission.  I was glad to see people noticed a few of my goals.  I was aiming for the shadow play between the actual wires and their shadows, and also the partial capturing of the headphones.  Blueswolfs'' comment were exactly my thoughts.  What I had composed exactly in my mind did not turn out as I had planned, but I guess that''s where the P8 is lacking.  Thanks again all for your comments.', '2004-03-10 05:41:58.000000', NULL, 0),
