(616266, 62477, 17031, '<td valign="top">This was an amazing art exhibit at Grounds for Sculpture in New Jersey.  From the outside it looked like a brown teepee (because of all the books pages) but when you crawled inside it was an amazing display of colors.  I can''t take credit for this beautiful work of art, just the photo of it.</td>', 'This was an amazing art exhibit at Grounds for Sculpture in New Jersey.  From the outside it looked like a brown teepee (because of all the books pages) but when you crawled inside it was an amazing display of colors.  I can''t take credit for this beautiful work of art, just the photo of it.', '2004-03-10 06:56:43.000000', NULL, 0),
