(616699, 62488, 16420, '<td valign="top">Hi,<br/> <br/>About the question of layers... I didn''t do any adjustments with this one. I''m happy to send the original into DP Challenge. This is actually a very good camera -- see review at: //www.imaging-resource.com/PRODS/DX6490/D64A.HTM<br/>Believe it or not, I think any camera could have captured this shot. It was a very grey mist and the water was extremely still - a great advantage to living in Victoria, British Columbia at this time of the year.</td>', 'Hi, About the question of layers... I didn''t do any adjustments with this one. I''m happy to send the original into DP Challenge. This is actually a very good camera -- see review at: //www.imaging-resource.com/PRODS/DX6490/D64A.HTMBelieve it or not, I think any camera could have captured this shot. It was a very grey mist and the water was extremely still - a great advantage to living in Victoria, British Columbia at this time of the year.', '2004-03-10 11:57:24.000000', NULL, 0),
