(616918, 62662, 16137, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by steventhewriter:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey!  A non-monotone graveyard shot!  And it''s done quite well.  I love the way it conveys the feeling of death without depression...sort of a peaceful end.  You also managed to include the sun quite elegantly.  I''m not sure everyone will appreciate this shot, but it''s one of my favorites. </i></td></tr></table>  Many thanks! Nice to know some people understood what i was trying to convey</td>', 'Originally posted by steventhewriter: Hey!  A non-monotone graveyard shot!  And it''s done quite well.  I love the way it conveys the feeling of death without depression...sort of a peaceful end.  You also managed to include the sun quite elegantly.  I''m not sure everyone will appreciate this shot, but it''s one of my favorites.   Many thanks! Nice to know some people understood what i was trying to convey', '2004-03-10 14:54:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(616955, 62805, 14487, '<td valign="top">Thanks guys, now that I look at it, it wouldn''t do a very good job of conveying silence without the title and all.  But I gonzo, I wish you''d said something a little more helpful or maybe less rude.  Thanks everyone else!</td>', 'Thanks guys, now that I look at it, it wouldn''t do a very good job of conveying silence without the title and all.  But I gonzo, I wish you''d said something a little more helpful or maybe less rude.  Thanks everyone else!', '2004-03-10 15:16:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(616973, 63033, 16648, '<td valign="top">Took me 5 days to find the sign, asking about, driving around. That is my son, and he hears well, listens most of the time too. Given more leeway on editing, I would blur the background, clone out the speed limit sign, perhaps add some spot color (his jacket is light green).  The sign had another sign on top of it, so i cropped to eliminate it and then had to crop the right side to match / balance things.</td>', 'Took me 5 days to find the sign, asking about, driving around. That is my son, and he hears well, listens most of the time too. Given more leeway on editing, I would blur the background, clone out the speed limit sign, perhaps add some spot color (his jacket is light green).  The sign had another sign on top of it, so i cropped to eliminate it and then had to crop the right side to match / balance things.', '2004-03-10 15:24:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(616985, 62361, 14509, '<td valign="top">This is first class photography. You should be very proud of yourself.<br/>Very calm, misty, and magical feel to this shot. Smooth sky, and considering you were facing the sun, you have done a grand job. Give yourself a pat on the back for this one. It was well worth walking that 1/4 mile. I''ve only dreamt of taking one like this.</td>', 'This is first class photography. You should be very proud of yourself.Very calm, misty, and magical feel to this shot. Smooth sky, and considering you were facing the sun, you have done a grand job. Give yourself a pat on the back for this one. It was well worth walking that 1/4 mile. I''ve only dreamt of taking one like this.', '2004-03-10 15:27:26.000000', NULL, 0),
