(617768, 62603, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty image and I gave it a 6. I might have given it a higher score in another challenge since it doesn''t happen to speak to me of silence as much as many other entries. Since all inanimate objects, including flowers, are "silent" my feeling was, in challenge theme terms, that you could just as easily enter an image of a toaster or shoe (not that these might be so appealing visually).<br/>In terms of the image itself, I really like the hints of green and purple in the longer, outer petals and the way that these outer petals have a slighly faded aspect compared with the central area. I also like the off-centre composition which I think is just right.</td>', 'This is a very pretty image and I gave it a 6. I might have given it a higher score in another challenge since it doesn''t happen to speak to me of silence as much as many other entries. Since all inanimate objects, including flowers, are "silent" my feeling was, in challenge theme terms, that you could just as easily enter an image of a toaster or shoe (not that these might be so appealing visually).In terms of the image itself, I really like the hints of green and purple in the longer, outer petals and the way that these outer petals have a slighly faded aspect compared with the central area. I also like the off-centre composition which I think is just right.', '2004-03-11 07:30:01.000000', NULL, 0),
