(617875, 62854, 5792, '<td valign="top">Just want you to know that I like this image a lot. It is one of the best of the challange and I like your use of light painting.</td>', 'Just want you to know that I like this image a lot. It is one of the best of the challange and I like your use of light painting.', '2004-03-11 09:41:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(617931, 62361, 18361, '<td valign="top">i love this photo! love! love! love!</td>', 'i love this photo! love! love! love!', '2004-03-11 10:41:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(617940, 63077, 14773, '<td valign="top">Rooster, you''re just kicking butt these days! Unfortunately I never saw this photo during voting, strange.....anyway, congrats!</td>', 'Rooster, you''re just kicking butt these days! Unfortunately I never saw this photo during voting, strange.....anyway, congrats!', '2004-03-11 10:49:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(618025, 62806, 15934, '<td valign="top">I agree with the comments that the face (and chicken) were too overexposed.  I wanted harsh lighting on those items, but it was a bit too much.  On the other hand, I don''t agree with comments that it didn''t meet the challenge.  It''s no sleeping baby or snowy landscape, but I think the scene was a great expression of uncomfortable silence!</td>', 'I agree with the comments that the face (and chicken) were too overexposed.  I wanted harsh lighting on those items, but it was a bit too much.  On the other hand, I don''t agree with comments that it didn''t meet the challenge.  It''s no sleeping baby or snowy landscape, but I think the scene was a great expression of uncomfortable silence!', '2004-03-11 11:42:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(618130, 62361, 17937, '<td valign="top">Very nice job...</td>', 'Very nice job...', '2004-03-11 13:09:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(618190, 62493, 16188, '<td valign="top">AH, so Mona, this was your picture!  We have more and more in common. :)</td>', 'AH, so Mona, this was your picture!  We have more and more in common. :)', '2004-03-11 14:03:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(618210, 62603, 14773, '<td valign="top">alright, now I get the title and how it fits with ''silence'' other than that flowers can''t speak :-)<br/></td>', 'alright, now I get the title and how it fits with ''silence'' other than that flowers can''t speak :-)', '2004-03-11 14:25:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(618268, 62806, 17717, '<td valign="top">great job bill.  i''m no photographer, but i love the shot.  smoke looks great and jones definitly looks like a comic at a loss for words in this shot.  see you at the gym.</td>', 'great job bill.  i''m no photographer, but i love the shot.  smoke looks great and jones definitly looks like a comic at a loss for words in this shot.  see you at the gym.', '2004-03-11 15:15:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(618283, 62361, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great choice and very opportune. Picking nits, I''d prefer to see the tree even more islolated (with more space around it) to emphasise the solitude. Beautifully lit, moody capture.</td>', 'Great choice and very opportune. Picking nits, I''d prefer to see the tree even more islolated (with more space around it) to emphasise the solitude. Beautifully lit, moody capture.', '2004-03-11 15:31:44.000000', NULL, 0),
