(618492, 62677, 11977, '<td valign="top">Very creative, technically well done, and it fits the challenge perfectly.  IMHO this should have won!</td>', 'Very creative, technically well done, and it fits the challenge perfectly.  IMHO this should have won!', '2004-03-11 18:31:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(618622, 63077, 12268, '<td valign="top">Hello Everyone!<br/> <br/>Thanks so much to everyone that dropped a comment on this shot. This was the fastest shoot ever for me! I took just two shots! Had fun tho as short as it was. I wish I could have done some advacne editing on it to even out the contrast but at las I could not!<br/></td>', 'Hello Everyone! Thanks so much to everyone that dropped a comment on this shot. This was the fastest shoot ever for me! I took just two shots! Had fun tho as short as it was. I wish I could have done some advacne editing on it to even out the contrast but at las I could not!', '2004-03-11 21:56:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(618912, 62842, 18248, '<td valign="top">wow thats an amazing photo. you''ve really expressed the emotion of it well. well done</td>', 'wow thats an amazing photo. you''ve really expressed the emotion of it well. well done', '2004-03-12 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(618918, 62677, 18248, '<td valign="top">no it doesnt make a sound....thats always been my arguement....:D but thats a brill pic</td>', 'no it doesnt make a sound....thats always been my arguement....:D but thats a brill pic', '2004-03-12 09:04:36.000000', NULL, 0),
