(619515, 62563, 13152, '<td valign="top">I don''t regret giving this a 10. Wish a few more had agreed! :-(</td>', 'I don''t regret giving this a 10. Wish a few more had agreed! :-(', '2004-03-12 20:21:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(619581, 62456, 10055, '<td valign="top">thank you for you all''s comments and votes. I have to agree as well now that the tape has to go. I see it now. Hmmm, I hoped that I didn''t get a low score on this one due the content from it, or was it the tape? Perhaps just the image itself? However, it was a fun shot for me. learn  a bit from it. thanks again for your alls input and advice.</td>', 'thank you for you all''s comments and votes. I have to agree as well now that the tape has to go. I see it now. Hmmm, I hoped that I didn''t get a low score on this one due the content from it, or was it the tape? Perhaps just the image itself? However, it was a fun shot for me. learn  a bit from it. thanks again for your alls input and advice.', '2004-03-12 23:56:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(619605, 62488, 714, '<td valign="top">Mmmm...this is a very peaceful shot.  I would love to sit at the dock with a cup of hot cocoa and listen to the frogs and crickets and just enjoy the beauty.  <br/> <br/>Congrats!  Excellent shot and well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'Mmmm...this is a very peaceful shot.  I would love to sit at the dock with a cup of hot cocoa and listen to the frogs and crickets and just enjoy the beauty.   Congrats!  Excellent shot and well deserved ribbon!', '2004-03-13 00:45:05.000000', NULL, 0),
