(692749, 62558, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good choice to use a vertical composition for this.  It helps emphasize the rope ladder, however, the lack of contrast tends to make the ladder blend with the background.</td>', 'Good choice to use a vertical composition for this.  It helps emphasize the rope ladder, however, the lack of contrast tends to make the ladder blend with the background.', '2004-05-01 14:35:58.000000', NULL, 0),
