(824764, 62594, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image is indeed a timeless winner. It speaks of the softer emotions withing our souls. Just looking at it  "silences"  the soul and places us in a holy communion with nature. Great job, great feelings and above all a wonderful capture that will remain permanent in our hearts.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-25 12:42:15.</i></td>', 'This image is indeed a timeless winner. It speaks of the softer emotions withing our souls. Just looking at it  "silences"  the soul and places us in a holy communion with nature. Great job, great feelings and above all a wonderful capture that will remain permanent in our hearts.', '2004-07-25 13:41:28.000000', '2004-07-25 13:42:15.000000', 0),
