(1204130, 62456, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very realistic effects.  It''s nice to see someone take the time to make it look real...rather than using ketchup like so many others. :-)</td>', 'Very realistic effects.  It''s nice to see someone take the time to make it look real...rather than using ketchup like so many others. :-)', '2005-03-02 19:19:07.000000', NULL, 0),
