(1480923, 62344, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''m going to stop gushing now.  I''ll just add you to my favorites and stop.  This is terrific.  The pink ears and the tight shot - wow.</td>', 'I''m going to stop gushing now.  I''ll just add you to my favorites and stop.  This is terrific.  The pink ears and the tight shot - wow.', '2005-06-24 11:41:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1569861, 63076, 13759, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by helgihelgi:</b></div><hr/><i> Less post-processing and a tighter crop  from the top would have been better. Jiffying up the colors is okay, but easy does it </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I´m sorry to disapoint you,but there is no post process at here. Only a crop!</td>', 'Originally posted by helgihelgi: Less post-processing and a tighter crop  from the top would have been better. Jiffying up the colors is okay, but easy does it  I´m sorry to disapoint you,but there is no post process at here. Only a crop!', '2005-07-28 13:02:22.000000', NULL, 0),
